(708020, 75629, 18505, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the lighting and the fact that you got some blur on the singer''s hand.  Nice mood.  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the lighting and the fact that you got some blur on the singer''s hand.  Nice mood.  Good luck on the challenge.', '2004-05-10 01:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
