(708041, 74798, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful view!  I think it would have been nice to deemphasize the window and emphasize the view.  Maybe a bit more zoom; maybe cropping the top.</td>', 'Beautiful view!  I think it would have been nice to deemphasize the window and emphasize the view.  Maybe a bit more zoom; maybe cropping the top.', '2004-05-10 01:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(708044, 75289, 12253, '<td valign="top">Looks like modern art.  Nice take on the challenge, nicely done.</td>', 'Looks like modern art.  Nice take on the challenge, nicely done.', '2004-05-10 01:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(708045, 75492, 5965, '<td valign="top">What a moving image. Based on the date on the stone, it''s obvious that this is a new monument, so it''s a good, if sorrowful, interpretation of the topic at hand.</td>', 'What a moving image. Based on the date on the stone, it''s obvious that this is a new monument, so it''s a good, if sorrowful, interpretation of the topic at hand.', '2004-05-10 01:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(708046, 75180, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, nice the way the path and wall leads me thru the picture, very nice image.</td>', 'Nice composition, nice the way the path and wall leads me thru the picture, very nice image.', '2004-05-10 01:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(708047, 75279, 7322, '<td valign="top">This got a 7 from me because I''m a big fan of street photography and photojournalism and this really works.  It might have gotten higher but I''m not sure I like that the foremost picketer has his face cut off. If it was your intention to include the hotel sign at the top of the frame, I can see why you would choose this odd point of view. Otherwise, I wonder why you didn''t aim just a bit lower?</td>', 'This got a 7 from me because I''m a big fan of street photography and photojournalism and this really works.  It might have gotten higher but I''m not sure I like that the foremost picketer has his face cut off. If it was your intention to include the hotel sign at the top of the frame, I can see why you would choose this odd point of view. Otherwise, I wonder why you didn''t aim just a bit lower?', '2004-05-10 01:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(708050, 75490, 13158, '<td valign="top">WOW look at those big eyes!!!  Very cute!  If you look at this picture closely it almost looks as if he''s holding the camera taking a self portrait.  Guess it''s the way his arms are angled.  (Hope it''s a he, sorry if not!)</td>', 'WOW look at those big eyes!!!  Very cute!  If you look at this picture closely it almost looks as if he''s holding the camera taking a self portrait.  Guess it''s the way his arms are angled.  (Hope it''s a he, sorry if not!)', '2004-05-10 02:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(708051, 75350, 13158, '<td valign="top">Sky is overexposed and it''s a bit soft.</td>', 'Sky is overexposed and it''s a bit soft.', '2004-05-10 02:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
