(708061, 75061, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hmmm ... nice shot!  I heard something a couple years ago about albino squirrels in a certain neighbourhood in Toronto;  I wonder where this picture was taken.  Are there albino squirrels in other places too?</td>', 'Hmmm ... nice shot!  I heard something a couple years ago about albino squirrels in a certain neighbourhood in Toronto;  I wonder where this picture was taken.  Are there albino squirrels in other places too?', '2004-05-10 02:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(708062, 74379, 12160, '<td valign="top">What do you know.. the first photo that came up. I would hope this is something new to you. Really funny. nice contrast, centering the subject works for this image.  good luck.</td>', 'What do you know.. the first photo that came up. I would hope this is something new to you. Really funny. nice contrast, centering the subject works for this image.  good luck.', '2004-05-10 02:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(708063, 75393, 13336, '<td valign="top">lovely textures in the fence, and the fog is gorgeous.  the bottom of the image moving into the left corner is very dark and distracts the eye, unfortunately, from the more interesting sections</td>', 'lovely textures in the fence, and the fog is gorgeous.  the bottom of the image moving into the left corner is very dark and distracts the eye, unfortunately, from the more interesting sections', '2004-05-10 02:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(708064, 74866, 18505, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  Nice capture with crest up.  Excellent composition.  Wonderful colors and textures. These guys are not always easy to photography.  10.</td>', 'Lovely!  Nice capture with crest up.  Excellent composition.  Wonderful colors and textures. These guys are not always easy to photography.  10.', '2004-05-10 02:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(708065, 75527, 13158, '<td valign="top">Interesting title!</td>', 'Interesting title!', '2004-05-10 02:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(708067, 75279, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, especially because a number of the people here are smiling, like they''re really enjoying this demonstration.  Good use of B/W.  The washed out background kinda works here.</td>', 'I like this shot, especially because a number of the people here are smiling, like they''re really enjoying this demonstration.  Good use of B/W.  The washed out background kinda works here.', '2004-05-10 02:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(708068, 75094, 18505, '<td valign="top">Nice color and lighting.</td>', 'Nice color and lighting.', '2004-05-10 02:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(708069, 75163, 13336, '<td valign="top">you should definately download the free version of Neat Image - the blurred background is great, but its full of digital noise.  this could be from using a higher ISO setting than your camera is actually capable of handling.  my g3 offers up to 400, but i only use 50 since anything else produces more noise than i care to see in my images...</td>', 'you should definately download the free version of Neat Image - the blurred background is great, but its full of digital noise.  this could be from using a higher ISO setting than your camera is actually capable of handling.  my g3 offers up to 400, but i only use 50 since anything else produces more noise than i care to see in my images...', '2004-05-10 02:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(708071, 75472, 4793, '<td valign="top">This is different  I would like to see this with the greens of the trees cloned out and just have the blue sky for the back drop. Nice idea,nice work.</td>', 'This is different  I would like to see this with the greens of the trees cloned out and just have the blue sky for the back drop. Nice idea,nice work.', '2004-05-10 02:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(708072, 75496, 13158, '<td valign="top">Underexposed and the composition is off.</td>', 'Underexposed and the composition is off.', '2004-05-10 02:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(708075, 75537, 13336, '<td valign="top">beautiful.  lovely tone.  i''d have cloned out the two gulls that only look like dots in the sky.  your horizon is straight as a whip.  good job.</td>', 'beautiful.  lovely tone.  i''d have cloned out the two gulls that only look like dots in the sky.  your horizon is straight as a whip.  good job.', '2004-05-10 02:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(708078, 74670, 6008, '<td valign="top">Nice toning but it looks out of focus, possibly due to low light. The shadows in the corners dont really help much either.</td>', 'Nice toning but it looks out of focus, possibly due to low light. The shadows in the corners dont really help much either.', '2004-05-10 02:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(708079, 75588, 20786, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast! I really like the way you have the walkway offset to the left slightly. great subject.</td>', 'Nice contrast! I really like the way you have the walkway offset to the left slightly. great subject.', '2004-05-10 02:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(708080, 75639, 6008, '<td valign="top">Neat symmetry with good composition, lighting, and colors. It''s like good and evil twin bridges with one in shadow and one in light. Very nicely captured.</td>', 'Neat symmetry with good composition, lighting, and colors. It''s like good and evil twin bridges with one in shadow and one in light. Very nicely captured.', '2004-05-10 02:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(708082, 75289, 13336, '<td valign="top">i love the composition and the texture.  i''d say you''ll get mailed by most for too much negative space and for the border.  i like the neg space here, and though i''d rather see it without the border it doesn''t do anything to bring down my score here.  the shadow is a tad long though.</td>', 'i love the composition and the texture.  i''d say you''ll get mailed by most for too much negative space and for the border.  i like the neg space here, and though i''d rather see it without the border it doesn''t do anything to bring down my score here.  the shadow is a tad long though.', '2004-05-10 02:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(708083, 75274, 4793, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and beautiful colors, very nice image overall.</td>', 'Very nice composition and beautiful colors, very nice image overall.', '2004-05-10 02:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(708085, 74290, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s fairly abstract and I dont know if your reflection was intentional or not, but it does give it a somewhat reflecting pool look. Not a lot of interest or contrast in the shot to really pique my curiosity.</td>', 'It''s fairly abstract and I dont know if your reflection was intentional or not, but it does give it a somewhat reflecting pool look. Not a lot of interest or contrast in the shot to really pique my curiosity.', '2004-05-10 02:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(708086, 75603, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of this dog''s eyes and expression.  I think it is slightly soft in focus perhaps mostly due to low DOF.  Centric composition hurts this a little.</td>', 'Wonderful capture of this dog''s eyes and expression.  I think it is slightly soft in focus perhaps mostly due to low DOF.  Centric composition hurts this a little.', '2004-05-10 02:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(708087, 75460, 13336, '<td valign="top">i hope you asked this man permission to take his photo and put it online.<br/> <br/>i have a knee-jerk reaction to seeing pictures of homeless people on dpc.<br/> <br/>the wall and blanket are a tad over exposed - t-shirt too.</td>', 'i hope you asked this man permission to take his photo and put it online. i have a knee-jerk reaction to seeing pictures of homeless people on dpc. the wall and blanket are a tad over exposed - t-shirt too.', '2004-05-10 02:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(708089, 75231, 20786, '<td valign="top">nice composition. I''d like to see the colors a little more vibrant.</td>', 'nice composition. I''d like to see the colors a little more vibrant.', '2004-05-10 02:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(708090, 75634, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the shot and use of B&amp;W.  Looks like you selectively reduced the contrast on the boy--it sticks out that he looks like he has too little contrast, and yet the background contrast looks perfect.  I don''t understand why you would do that here.</td>', 'I like the shot and use of B&W.  Looks like you selectively reduced the contrast on the boy--it sticks out that he looks like he has too little contrast, and yet the background contrast looks perfect.  I don''t understand why you would do that here.', '2004-05-10 02:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(708091, 75598, 13336, '<td valign="top">heh... sure it is...  ;-p<br/> <br/>nice job.  lovely colors.  strong, full frame.</td>', 'heh... sure it is...  ;-p nice job.  lovely colors.  strong, full frame.', '2004-05-10 02:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(708092, 75527, 6008, '<td valign="top">The black and white is good although I think the contrast may be a little too high as the white of the taller salt shaker is a little too bright, almost blown. The toning is good and the texture of wood table and background go well with the black and white used. The perspective of the table gives it a sense of ''tilted horizon''. The overall idea of giving inanimate objects human personality is cute and of course works better with the tie-in with the title, but works well without as well.</td>', 'The black and white is good although I think the contrast may be a little too high as the white of the taller salt shaker is a little too bright, almost blown. The toning is good and the texture of wood table and background go well with the black and white used. The perspective of the table gives it a sense of ''tilted horizon''. The overall idea of giving inanimate objects human personality is cute and of course works better with the tie-in with the title, but works well without as well.', '2004-05-10 02:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(708093, 75523, 17148, '<td valign="top"></td>', '', '2004-05-10 02:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(708094, 75208, 20786, '<td valign="top">beautiful lighting. This image would probably do well in the "opposites" challenge.</td>', 'beautiful lighting. This image would probably do well in the "opposites" challenge.', '2004-05-10 02:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(708095, 75527, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good simple take on the challenge, nicely composed and converted to B&amp;W.  But the light is a bit strong on the white sugar (and salt).  A little shade might have helped with this difficult exposure.</td>', 'Good simple take on the challenge, nicely composed and converted to B&W.  But the light is a bit strong on the white sugar (and salt).  A little shade might have helped with this difficult exposure.', '2004-05-10 02:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(708096, 74726, 5965, '<td valign="top">Could be sharper. You might try an unsharp mask to achieve that. Too bad you don''t have that for the new center contest. Couldn''t think of a better entry.</td>', 'Could be sharper. You might try an unsharp mask to achieve that. Too bad you don''t have that for the new center contest. Couldn''t think of a better entry.', '2004-05-10 02:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(708097, 75098, 6008, '<td valign="top">First thing I notice is that most of the shot is out of focus. There is a lot of clutter with the masts and not a singluar focal point. The masts are also cropped out, likely due to you trying to get the reflection in as well. Changing to a portrait format and isolating one boat may have given you less clutter and more of the whole of the boat, else stepping back some (if possible) to get more of the scene, or zooming in to get less, such as the two hulls(?) and their reflections.</td>', 'First thing I notice is that most of the shot is out of focus. There is a lot of clutter with the masts and not a singluar focal point. The masts are also cropped out, likely due to you trying to get the reflection in as well. Changing to a portrait format and isolating one boat may have given you less clutter and more of the whole of the boat, else stepping back some (if possible) to get more of the scene, or zooming in to get less, such as the two hulls(?) and their reflections.', '2004-05-10 02:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(708099, 75407, 20786, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Love the warm glow.</td>', 'Stunning. Love the warm glow.', '2004-05-10 02:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(708100, 74670, 17148, '<td valign="top">looks a tad blurry</td>', 'looks a tad blurry', '2004-05-10 02:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(708101, 75223, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good composition and lighting, although the image seems a little soft. USM may have helped it out some.</td>', 'Good composition and lighting, although the image seems a little soft. USM may have helped it out some.', '2004-05-10 02:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(708102, 75543, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent scene and crop.  I say crop because the tree looks like it''s showing the end of the resolution for your camera--so I am guessing you had to crop at the full resolution to get this wonderful composition here.  The loss of clarity is one small price to pay, but you did this perfectly otherwise, it''s a wonderful shot.</td>', 'Excellent scene and crop.  I say crop because the tree looks like it''s showing the end of the resolution for your camera--so I am guessing you had to crop at the full resolution to get this wonderful composition here.  The loss of clarity is one small price to pay, but you did this perfectly otherwise, it''s a wonderful shot.', '2004-05-10 02:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(708104, 75400, 20786, '<td valign="top">Original idea. I like the way the container glows.</td>', 'Original idea. I like the way the container glows.', '2004-05-10 02:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(708105, 74665, 12253, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous scene and tones.  Love the mist.  One nit is that you have some vignetting happening in the corners, perhaps from using a telextender.</td>', 'Gorgeous scene and tones.  Love the mist.  One nit is that you have some vignetting happening in the corners, perhaps from using a telextender.', '2004-05-10 02:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(708106, 75527, 5965, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of finding beauty in common objects. There are some wonderfully designed objects around us and this challenge was a good opportunity to give them their due. For that reason I''m really liking this image. Most folks woulnd''t waste thier time taking pictures of these items. You''ve managed to bring out thier innate beauty.</td>', 'I like the idea of finding beauty in common objects. There are some wonderfully designed objects around us and this challenge was a good opportunity to give them their due. For that reason I''m really liking this image. Most folks woulnd''t waste thier time taking pictures of these items. You''ve managed to bring out thier innate beauty.', '2004-05-10 02:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(708107, 75536, 18505, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot.  That hopper blends right in.  Nice colors and composition.</td>', 'Amazing shot.  That hopper blends right in.  Nice colors and composition.', '2004-05-10 02:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(708108, 75541, 20786, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space.', '2004-05-10 02:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(708109, 75540, 6008, '<td valign="top">Overcast skies are always unfortunate but I think it goes with the sepia tone that you''ve chosen. It''s a good shot, but I just dont get much wow factor from it. Compositions of large buildings from up close can be difficult, and I think you likely got the best angle of it that you could.</td>', 'Overcast skies are always unfortunate but I think it goes with the sepia tone that you''ve chosen. It''s a good shot, but I just dont get much wow factor from it. Compositions of large buildings from up close can be difficult, and I think you likely got the best angle of it that you could.', '2004-05-10 02:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(708110, 75327, 17148, '<td valign="top">needs more DoF</td>', 'needs more DoF', '2004-05-10 02:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(708113, 75545, 5965, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming you''re not submitting these images from the space station, so how did you pull this off. Is it a photo of a photo. Anyway, it''s a creative solution to the problem of the challenge.</td>', 'I''m assuming you''re not submitting these images from the space station, so how did you pull this off. Is it a photo of a photo. Anyway, it''s a creative solution to the problem of the challenge.', '2004-05-10 02:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(708115, 75368, 18505, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and composition!  You sure got their attention.  Good luck in the challenge.  You get a 10 from me!</td>', 'Wonderful color and composition!  You sure got their attention.  Good luck in the challenge.  You get a 10 from me!', '2004-05-10 02:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(708116, 75586, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like how it is almost like he is looking up at the light source. Interesting choice to use black and white. The water splashing and the fact that it is really hot here right now makes me want to think summery, but the black and white doesnt support that very well. I think I''m tempted to want the female over his shoulder to be less in the shadows also. It''s a good capture of a fountain.</td>', 'I like how it is almost like he is looking up at the light source. Interesting choice to use black and white. The water splashing and the fact that it is really hot here right now makes me want to think summery, but the black and white doesnt support that very well. I think I''m tempted to want the female over his shoulder to be less in the shadows also. It''s a good capture of a fountain.', '2004-05-10 02:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(708119, 75274, 18505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color, composition and lighting.  I wouldn''t change a thing.  10</td>', 'Beautiful color, composition and lighting.  I wouldn''t change a thing.  10', '2004-05-10 02:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(708122, 74290, 5965, '<td valign="top">I can believe this is a photo of something you''ve never photographed before. Somehow I doubt it''s in a place you''ve never visited though. <br/> <br/>Also, I wish there was a way to eliminate your reflection. However I love the subtlety of the colors and tones. Even when I realized what I was looking at.</td>', 'I can believe this is a photo of something you''ve never photographed before. Somehow I doubt it''s in a place you''ve never visited though.  Also, I wish there was a way to eliminate your reflection. However I love the subtlety of the colors and tones. Even when I realized what I was looking at.', '2004-05-10 02:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(708123, 74361, 18505, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subject, composition and color.  Highland coos?  10.</td>', 'Wonderful subject, composition and color.  Highland coos?  10.', '2004-05-10 02:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(708128, 75279, 20786, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. I like the way the young man in the center looks as though he is peeking over into the frame.</td>', 'Interesting composition. I like the way the young man in the center looks as though he is peeking over into the frame.', '2004-05-10 02:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(708132, 75061, 16301, '<td valign="top">WOW, I didn''t know there were albino squirrels. Nice capture...</td>', 'WOW, I didn''t know there were albino squirrels. Nice capture...', '2004-05-10 02:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(708134, 75545, 19040, '<td valign="top">It''s been done before, but not like this.</td>', 'It''s been done before, but not like this.', '2004-05-10 02:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(708135, 75436, 20786, '<td valign="top">Nice repeating lines.</td>', 'Nice repeating lines.', '2004-05-10 02:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(708138, 75586, 20786, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. Good stop action and contrast.</td>', 'Nice lighting. Good stop action and contrast.', '2004-05-10 02:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(708139, 75349, 19184, '<td valign="top">I love this picture, wish I lived around a place like this.  It is beautiful.</td>', 'I love this picture, wish I lived around a place like this.  It is beautiful.', '2004-05-10 02:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(708142, 75418, 13158, '<td valign="top">LOL too cute.</td>', 'LOL too cute.', '2004-05-10 02:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(708143, 75555, 18505, '<td valign="top">Ooooh.  I wish I was there right now.  This could be a magazine cover.  Love it.</td>', 'Ooooh.  I wish I was there right now.  This could be a magazine cover.  Love it.', '2004-05-10 02:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(708145, 75500, 20786, '<td valign="top">I think the background is a little too blury. it detracts some from the train.</td>', 'I think the background is a little too blury. it detracts some from the train.', '2004-05-10 02:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(708147, 75288, 19184, '<td valign="top">I love sunset photos, and this one is very beautiful.  Good luck in the challenge, this one is a favorite so far in it.</td>', 'I love sunset photos, and this one is very beautiful.  Good luck in the challenge, this one is a favorite so far in it.', '2004-05-10 02:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(708150, 75210, 20786, '<td valign="top">Nice POV. good DOF. Interseting subject.</td>', 'Nice POV. good DOF. Interseting subject.', '2004-05-10 02:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(708151, 75305, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot.  I can ''hear'' the quiet.  The occasional splash of a fish or bull frog.  I can smell the rain that is just over the hill.  Great shot.  Were you in another boat?  On a pier?  I''m gonna guess Ireland.  Damn...  I can smell the fish frying...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is an awesome shot.  I can ''hear'' the quiet.  The occasional splash of a fish or bull frog.  I can smell the rain that is just over the hill.  Great shot.  Were you in another boat?  On a pier?  I''m gonna guess Ireland.  Damn...  I can smell the fish frying...TC', '2004-05-10 02:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(708153, 75090, 12962, '<td valign="top">Exquisite.  Depth of field and eccentric placement are quite wonderful.  Complimentary colors are very attractive.  No suggestion for improvement from me because it is already top notch.  A ten.</td>', 'Exquisite.  Depth of field and eccentric placement are quite wonderful.  Complimentary colors are very attractive.  No suggestion for improvement from me because it is already top notch.  A ten.', '2004-05-10 02:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(708154, 75090, 17148, '<td valign="top">more DoF wouldve been better</td>', 'more DoF wouldve been better', '2004-05-10 02:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(708155, 75598, 18505, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color and composition.  If this is your first attempt at flowers, you need to keep at it!!!  10.</td>', 'Gorgeous color and composition.  If this is your first attempt at flowers, you need to keep at it!!!  10.', '2004-05-10 02:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(708156, 75490, 12962, '<td valign="top">Love it. Perfect representation of an expression only babies could give you.  Very universal appeal.  Hope you do well.</td>', 'Love it. Perfect representation of an expression only babies could give you.  Very universal appeal.  Hope you do well.', '2004-05-10 02:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(708157, 74665, 18505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition.  Love the mood the mist conveys.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition.  Love the mood the mist conveys.', '2004-05-10 02:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(708158, 74798, 13158, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast and color. Love the perspective too!  Cropping out some of the roof might make it a stronger image.</td>', 'Very nice contrast and color. Love the perspective too!  Cropping out some of the roof might make it a stronger image.', '2004-05-10 02:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(708159, 75542, 20786, '<td valign="top">They have such sweet eyes.</td>', 'They have such sweet eyes.', '2004-05-10 02:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(708160, 75254, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice reflective mood ... would be even nicer if you placed them (dog and friend) a little bit more off center than this, as for example, crop just about an inch before the dog.</td>', 'Nice reflective mood ... would be even nicer if you placed them (dog and friend) a little bit more off center than this, as for example, crop just about an inch before the dog.', '2004-05-10 02:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(708161, 75061, 12962, '<td valign="top">A ten just by posting a rare specimen.  Wow!!!!</td>', 'A ten just by posting a rare specimen.  Wow!!!!', '2004-05-10 02:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(708162, 74763, 9906, '<td valign="top">Can you hear the sizzling of the welding rods?  I can.  I can feel the heat on my face and feel the need to turn my head from the brightness.  One man weilding the fire of creation, framed within the framework.  Hope I can feel as content in my work as this man appears...<br/>TC</td>', 'Can you hear the sizzling of the welding rods?  I can.  I can feel the heat on my face and feel the need to turn my head from the brightness.  One man weilding the fire of creation, framed within the framework.  Hope I can feel as content in my work as this man appears...TC', '2004-05-10 02:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(708163, 75246, 18722, '<td valign="top">Colors are vibrant, but the shot seems lacking in composition.</td>', 'Colors are vibrant, but the shot seems lacking in composition.', '2004-05-10 02:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(708166, 75550, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice textures over most of the pedals, but there are a few hot spots on the tips.</td>', 'Nice textures over most of the pedals, but there are a few hot spots on the tips.', '2004-05-10 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(708168, 75536, 9906, '<td valign="top">Unfortunatly, the camoflauge that you refer to works against you in this instance IMHO...  I can see many people not taking the time to see what is really there.  If you don''t see it, it is an uninteresting snap...  If you do see it, it is an interesting snap.  Not much for staying power though...<br/>TC</td>', 'Unfortunatly, the camoflauge that you refer to works against you in this instance IMHO...  I can see many people not taking the time to see what is really there.  If you don''t see it, it is an uninteresting snap...  If you do see it, it is an interesting snap.  Not much for staying power though...TC', '2004-05-10 02:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(708170, 75575, 18722, '<td valign="top">The DOF seems a bit shallow to me, and the cropping a bit tight.</td>', 'The DOF seems a bit shallow to me, and the cropping a bit tight.', '2004-05-10 02:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(708171, 74919, 9906, '<td valign="top">After a moment of silence, a reflection on the peacefulness of the scene.  Repetition to grab the eye and take it into and through the shot.  Then the realization that each repetition has a story to tell.  Less we forget...<br/>TC</td>', 'After a moment of silence, a reflection on the peacefulness of the scene.  Repetition to grab the eye and take it into and through the shot.  Then the realization that each repetition has a story to tell.  Less we forget...TC', '2004-05-10 02:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(708172, 75526, 9906, '<td valign="top">Ah the playfulness of youth.  How soon is it that we forget how much fun a spring rain can be?  To get back the joy...<br/>TC</td>', 'Ah the playfulness of youth.  How soon is it that we forget how much fun a spring rain can be?  To get back the joy...TC', '2004-05-10 02:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(708173, 75598, 13158, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Awesome image!  Love the colors and the focus is terrific.  First flower picture?  Couldn''t tell by the way this one turned out.  Great job. 8</td>', 'Wow!  Awesome image!  Love the colors and the focus is terrific.  First flower picture?  Couldn''t tell by the way this one turned out.  Great job. 8', '2004-05-10 02:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(708174, 75555, 18722, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscape.  The Keep seems a bit flat to me; a bit more contrast (maybe sharpening) on jus the keep would have made its presence more prominent.</td>', 'Lovely landscape.  The Keep seems a bit flat to me; a bit more contrast (maybe sharpening) on jus the keep would have made its presence more prominent.', '2004-05-10 03:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(708179, 75350, 18722, '<td valign="top">The image as a whole seems to lack saturation.  The sky is blown out as well; unfortunately I can''t comment on what to do about that -- the sky in my photos are usually blown out as well. :(</td>', 'The image as a whole seems to lack saturation.  The sky is blown out as well; unfortunately I can''t comment on what to do about that -- the sky in my photos are usually blown out as well. :(', '2004-05-10 03:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(708181, 75541, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very striking and powerful image. I see lots of "new" here. Fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Very striking and powerful image. I see lots of "new" here. Fits the challenge well.', '2004-05-10 03:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(708182, 75177, 13158, '<td valign="top">No, don''t like the reflections in the glass.  That''s an awesome looking tree in the background though!</td>', 'No, don''t like the reflections in the glass.  That''s an awesome looking tree in the background though!', '2004-05-10 03:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(708183, 75625, 18722, '<td valign="top">The DOF seems to be extremely tight on this.</td>', 'The DOF seems to be extremely tight on this.', '2004-05-10 03:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(708185, 75472, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot caught my eye and for a moment I couldn''t figure out why...  Then it hit me.  We''ve all done this.  You drive along through life and something hit''s you right in the rear view and you wonder...  What if I went that way instead?<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot caught my eye and for a moment I couldn''t figure out why...  Then it hit me.  We''ve all done this.  You drive along through life and something hit''s you right in the rear view and you wonder...  What if I went that way instead?TC', '2004-05-10 03:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(708186, 75498, 13158, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.  Is there a hidden meaning and I''m missing it??</td>', 'I don''t get it.  Is there a hidden meaning and I''m missing it??', '2004-05-10 03:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(708187, 75328, 9906, '<td valign="top">What if I don''t want to leave the woods?<br/>TC</td>', 'What if I don''t want to leave the woods?TC', '2004-05-10 03:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(708190, 75277, 13158, '<td valign="top">Aww very cute.  Technically it needs a level and contrast boost.</td>', 'Aww very cute.  Technically it needs a level and contrast boost.', '2004-05-10 03:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(708191, 75499, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is great</td>', 'This is great', '2004-05-10 03:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(708193, 75302, 10848, '<td valign="top">Now this is a sport I can relate to, my son and I love Kayaking. We participate in this alot. Very exciting, I love it.</td>', 'Now this is a sport I can relate to, my son and I love Kayaking. We participate in this alot. Very exciting, I love it.', '2004-05-10 03:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(708194, 75163, 13158, '<td valign="top">Ewww nasty looking bug.  Did you use a high iso?  Seems to be a bit grainy.</td>', 'Ewww nasty looking bug.  Did you use a high iso?  Seems to be a bit grainy.', '2004-05-10 03:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(708195, 74379, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t even want to know...<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t even want to know...TC', '2004-05-10 03:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(708197, 75274, 13158, '<td valign="top">Nice image, the shadow in the bottom right throws it off a little.  Nice focusing on the largest flower though.</td>', 'Nice image, the shadow in the bottom right throws it off a little.  Nice focusing on the largest flower though.', '2004-05-10 03:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(708198, 75277, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot</td>', 'Wonderful shot', '2004-05-10 03:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
