(708262, 75515, 16046, '<td valign="top">If only the lighting was better, great other than that. Her right cheek is washed out. Great smile.</td>', 'If only the lighting was better, great other than that. Her right cheek is washed out. Great smile.', '2004-05-10 03:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(708263, 75253, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. The clarity and colors are very good. I almost entered a picture of a micro-brewery; glad a didn''t as yours is much better!</td>', 'Very nice picture. The clarity and colors are very good. I almost entered a picture of a micro-brewery; glad a didn''t as yours is much better!', '2004-05-10 03:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
