(708419, 74763, 16957, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Saw this in the discussion forums though. FYI, it is not considered good form to reveal your entry in the week of voting or to seek opinions in advance of entering.<br/> <br/>That said, a good piece of work. You''ve captured the lighting very well and the composition is excellent. Effective use of square format</td>', 'Nice photo. Saw this in the discussion forums though. FYI, it is not considered good form to reveal your entry in the week of voting or to seek opinions in advance of entering. That said, a good piece of work. You''ve captured the lighting very well and the composition is excellent. Effective use of square format', '2004-05-10 07:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(708425, 75496, 18098, '<td valign="top">These are beautiful and unusual flowers that I would like in my yard.  10.</td>', 'These are beautiful and unusual flowers that I would like in my yard.  10.', '2004-05-10 07:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
