(708612, 75501, 14593, '<td valign="top">interesting depth of field.....I like it.  This depth of field to me adds an element of emotion to the photo...rather than just taking a photo of the house which would have been stark and predicitable....</td>', 'interesting depth of field.....I like it.  This depth of field to me adds an element of emotion to the photo...rather than just taking a photo of the house which would have been stark and predicitable....', '2004-05-10 10:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
