(708634, 75513, 14593, '<td valign="top">looks like slimey body parts.....haha.....these caves are very interesting, and hard to photograph too.  I went into one in the NC mountains last year....</td>', 'looks like slimey body parts.....haha.....these caves are very interesting, and hard to photograph too.  I went into one in the NC mountains last year....', '2004-05-10 11:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(708639, 75369, 8139, '<td valign="top">WOW. The light is great. Like to know how it was (or not) post processed to obtain the fairy effect. 10</td>', 'WOW. The light is great. Like to know how it was (or not) post processed to obtain the fairy effect. 10', '2004-05-10 11:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(708649, 75369, 19608, '<td valign="top">Such SPECTACULAR lighting!  Perfect composition.  I usually try to make a suggestion on how to improve an image, but in this case - you''ve done it so well, I''m speechless.  Get ready for a ribbon.</td>', 'Such SPECTACULAR lighting!  Perfect composition.  I usually try to make a suggestion on how to improve an image, but in this case - you''ve done it so well, I''m speechless.  Get ready for a ribbon.', '2004-05-10 11:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(708652, 75598, 14614, '<td valign="top">and a nice one it is... the lighting is just right with your main subject a shade or two lighter than those around it</td>', 'and a nice one it is... the lighting is just right with your main subject a shade or two lighter than those around it', '2004-05-10 11:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(708656, 75515, 20577, '<td valign="top">I love this! What a great capture. If this is your daughter then you have taken a shot of a lifetime.  I wish I could give it higher then a 10. 10</td>', 'I love this! What a great capture. If this is your daughter then you have taken a shot of a lifetime.  I wish I could give it higher then a 10. 10', '2004-05-10 11:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(708657, 75246, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like the color variety you''ve created.  the lawn ornaments (?) in the center of the shot detract from the composition as does the clay pot and brown thing (top center).  Did you consider cloning these out?</td>', 'I like the color variety you''ve created.  the lawn ornaments (?) in the center of the shot detract from the composition as does the clay pot and brown thing (top center).  Did you consider cloning these out?', '2004-05-10 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
