(708679, 75533, 14614, '<td valign="top">the background is what makes this fine shot extra-ordinary as it is a surprise element - your cropping and crisp exposure has this one stand out from the "too many" motorcycle shots.  well done</td>', 'the background is what makes this fine shot extra-ordinary as it is a surprise element - your cropping and crisp exposure has this one stand out from the "too many" motorcycle shots.  well done', '2004-05-10 11:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
