(709194, 75286, 8054, '<td valign="top">Background seems a bit distracting. If it were less focused (shallow DOF) I think it would be much better and emphasize the spider web even more. The lighting is a bit flat and it seems it was a very overcast day. Maybe a fill flash would have helped. Good effort overall and nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'Background seems a bit distracting. If it were less focused (shallow DOF) I think it would be much better and emphasize the spider web even more. The lighting is a bit flat and it seems it was a very overcast day. Maybe a fill flash would have helped. Good effort overall and nice take on the challenge.', '2004-05-10 15:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
