(709407, 74665, 10047, '<td valign="top">Looks like Camp Yawgoog in Rhode Isalnd. Beautiful capture. The mist is really well done.</td>', 'Looks like Camp Yawgoog in Rhode Isalnd. Beautiful capture. The mist is really well done.', '2004-05-10 17:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
