(709417, 75306, 16739, '<td valign="top">very good</td>', 'very good', '2004-05-10 17:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(709418, 75515, 14476, '<td valign="top">Sweet composition of this pretty little girl.  Good depth of field to keep that background blurred.  Maybe a little ''hot'' on the sweater?  Overall, really, really nice.</td>', 'Sweet composition of this pretty little girl.  Good depth of field to keep that background blurred.  Maybe a little ''hot'' on the sweater?  Overall, really, really nice.', '2004-05-10 17:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(709419, 75042, 16739, '<td valign="top">great job</td>', 'great job', '2004-05-10 17:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(709420, 75305, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The somber sky and water complement the vegetation and terrain.</td>', 'Nicely done. The somber sky and water complement the vegetation and terrain.', '2004-05-10 17:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(709421, 75539, 16739, '<td valign="top">very nice , good job</td>', 'very nice , good job', '2004-05-10 17:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(709423, 75531, 8054, '<td valign="top">Lighting and textures seem flat. No offense, but not the most inspiring. Maybe if taken from a different angle with different light it would be better.</td>', 'Lighting and textures seem flat. No offense, but not the most inspiring. Maybe if taken from a different angle with different light it would be better.', '2004-05-10 17:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(709429, 75523, 14476, '<td valign="top">This, of course, is an exceptional image.  I hope you didn''t stick around too long and that momma bird could easily get back to her babies.</td>', 'This, of course, is an exceptional image.  I hope you didn''t stick around too long and that momma bird could easily get back to her babies.', '2004-05-10 17:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(709430, 75204, 8054, '<td valign="top">I think if the image gave a sense of speed it would rate higher. Next time, try panning the cars and then snap the photo. The background wouldn''t matter since it''s all gray anyway but the tracks would be blurred giving the impression of speed.</td>', 'I think if the image gave a sense of speed it would rate higher. Next time, try panning the cars and then snap the photo. The background wouldn''t matter since it''s all gray anyway but the tracks would be blurred giving the impression of speed.', '2004-05-10 17:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(709434, 75510, 18219, '<td valign="top">a little dark, but a great capture.</td>', 'a little dark, but a great capture.', '2004-05-10 17:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(709436, 74361, 18219, '<td valign="top">great picture</td>', 'great picture', '2004-05-10 17:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(709438, 75390, 14476, '<td valign="top">I''m having a little trouble delineating the generations here, but it is an interesting image.  Expect the limited dof is intentional.  Wonder what it would have looked like with everything in focus.  Probably would have lost your message tho...</td>', 'I''m having a little trouble delineating the generations here, but it is an interesting image.  Expect the limited dof is intentional.  Wonder what it would have looked like with everything in focus.  Probably would have lost your message tho...', '2004-05-10 17:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(709442, 75583, 14476, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t it have been grand if the tree had a bird at the top or a nest somewhere on it!  It''s a good image, and perhaps would have been more powerful had the tree been offcenter.  Excellent clarity and depth of field.</td>', 'Wouldn''t it have been grand if the tree had a bird at the top or a nest somewhere on it!  It''s a good image, and perhaps would have been more powerful had the tree been offcenter.  Excellent clarity and depth of field.', '2004-05-10 17:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(709443, 75549, 18219, '<td valign="top">unfortunately, my eye keeps getting drawn to that black thing on the left of the flower, otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'unfortunately, my eye keeps getting drawn to that black thing on the left of the flower, otherwise a nice shot.', '2004-05-10 17:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(709445, 75501, 13136, '<td valign="top">To me, if the house is the subject, it needs better focus and lighting. If the subject is the fence/ivy with the house as a backdrop, this is a very good picture.</td>', 'To me, if the house is the subject, it needs better focus and lighting. If the subject is the fence/ivy with the house as a backdrop, this is a very good picture.', '2004-05-10 17:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(709450, 75528, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo and use of the close-up limb. The whole shot seems a little fuzzy or pixelated somehow. Good color, lighting and composition.</td>', 'Interesting photo and use of the close-up limb. The whole shot seems a little fuzzy or pixelated somehow. Good color, lighting and composition.', '2004-05-10 17:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(709452, 74379, 18219, '<td valign="top">cheeky!</td>', 'cheeky!', '2004-05-10 17:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(709455, 75417, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro. Good use of DOF to make the background interesting without being distracting.</td>', 'Very nice macro. Good use of DOF to make the background interesting without being distracting.', '2004-05-10 17:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(709456, 75412, 14476, '<td valign="top">Awesome display!  Good seeing and good photography.</td>', 'Awesome display!  Good seeing and good photography.', '2004-05-10 17:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(709458, 74379, 13136, '<td valign="top">Stark. Almost looks like the person was pasted on. New to nudity?</td>', 'Stark. Almost looks like the person was pasted on. New to nudity?', '2004-05-10 17:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(709460, 75201, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice show of motion. I even like the dim light on the subject. Maybe not wild about the slight tilt, but on second view it makes it look like the person is falling because of the tilt.</td>', 'Nice show of motion. I even like the dim light on the subject. Maybe not wild about the slight tilt, but on second view it makes it look like the person is falling because of the tilt.', '2004-05-10 17:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(709462, 75418, 13136, '<td valign="top">Picture looks a little faded. May just be the DOF and focus on the bear''s side fur. Seems like it could use a little more contrast though, not sure. Good catch on the expression and focus on the face.</td>', 'Picture looks a little faded. May just be the DOF and focus on the bear''s side fur. Seems like it could use a little more contrast though, not sure. Good catch on the expression and focus on the face.', '2004-05-10 17:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(709463, 75626, 13136, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Good focus. Almost too bright.</td>', 'Pretty. Good focus. Almost too bright.', '2004-05-10 17:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(709466, 74979, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good DOF for an interesting background. Bird''s face seems a bit soft focus.</td>', 'Good DOF for an interesting background. Bird''s face seems a bit soft focus.', '2004-05-10 17:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(709470, 74763, 14476, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this in the forums and commented on it there.  Does it belong in this Challenge?  (After looking this up, I see you''re new, SpOOf, and perhaps didn''t know that we try to keep all challenge entries confidential and anonymous)</td>', 'I''ve seen this in the forums and commented on it there.  Does it belong in this Challenge?  (After looking this up, I see you''re new, SpOOf, and perhaps didn''t know that we try to keep all challenge entries confidential and anonymous)', '2004-05-10 17:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(709471, 75490, 13136, '<td valign="top">What an expression. The way the arms are placed, it almost looks like the baby is taking it''s own picture. The bright light on one side makes the eyes different colors and different iris openings, making the face a little lopsided.</td>', 'What an expression. The way the arms are placed, it almost looks like the baby is taking it''s own picture. The bright light on one side makes the eyes different colors and different iris openings, making the face a little lopsided.', '2004-05-10 17:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(709474, 75595, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice old-time feel to this shot. Good focus, composition and lighting.</td>', 'Nice old-time feel to this shot. Good focus, composition and lighting.', '2004-05-10 18:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(709476, 75204, 6999, '<td valign="top">Something about the extreme sharpness of those edges speaks of an edited high-key exclusion of background, rather than a simple effect of exposure - and gives it an edited unreality that runs against the suggestion of spontaneity in the image itself. I don''t like that effect, personally, though its very competently executed.</td>', 'Something about the extreme sharpness of those edges speaks of an edited high-key exclusion of background, rather than a simple effect of exposure - and gives it an edited unreality that runs against the suggestion of spontaneity in the image itself. I don''t like that effect, personally, though its very competently executed.', '2004-05-10 18:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(709477, 74669, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of lighting. The lack of any clear focal point makes this less interesting. Good use of negative space.</td>', 'Interesting use of lighting. The lack of any clear focal point makes this less interesting. Good use of negative space.', '2004-05-10 18:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(709478, 75204, 10084, '<td valign="top">The composition is enhanced by the angle of the capture. Very dynamic and gives the sense of motion. The subjects are more enhanced by the white background. almost like an abstract because of the beautiful curve in the coaster.<br/> <br/>This is how the photos you can purchase after riding should look. Then maybe more people would buy. "10"</td>', 'The composition is enhanced by the angle of the capture. Very dynamic and gives the sense of motion. The subjects are more enhanced by the white background. almost like an abstract because of the beautiful curve in the coaster. This is how the photos you can purchase after riding should look. Then maybe more people would buy. "10"', '2004-05-10 18:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(709482, 75305, 2764, '<td valign="top">Ahhh - first pic I open is a ten!!! This is going to be a great challenge</td>', 'Ahhh - first pic I open is a ten!!! This is going to be a great challenge', '2004-05-10 18:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(709483, 74999, 13136, '<td valign="top">I did not see those arches the last time I was there (last summer) or am I just forgetting them? My dad used to live about a block north of this back in the 60''s.<br/>Nice composition especially with the color shadows falling away from the arches.</td>', 'I did not see those arches the last time I was there (last summer) or am I just forgetting them? My dad used to live about a block north of this back in the 60''s.Nice composition especially with the color shadows falling away from the arches.', '2004-05-10 18:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(709484, 75089, 6999, '<td valign="top">Love the depth of field, but am unconvinced by your cropping: I would personally have framed things so that the focussed pegs were bottom left, and the unfocussed set top right - this way, there''s a negative space below the focussed set that pulls the eye - as though there should be some illuminating element there, only there isn''t anything beyond the blur of the doorway. I think perhaps you''ve only thought about the thirds rule in the horizontal axis - but it functions vertically too :-)</td>', 'Love the depth of field, but am unconvinced by your cropping: I would personally have framed things so that the focussed pegs were bottom left, and the unfocussed set top right - this way, there''s a negative space below the focussed set that pulls the eye - as though there should be some illuminating element there, only there isn''t anything beyond the blur of the doorway. I think perhaps you''ve only thought about the thirds rule in the horizontal axis - but it functions vertically too :-)', '2004-05-10 18:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(709487, 75254, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very good example of showing a subject surrounded by immense scenery. Very good use of DOF to create a beutiful picture that, nevertheless, directs the eye toward the main subject(s).</td>', 'Very good example of showing a subject surrounded by immense scenery. Very good use of DOF to create a beutiful picture that, nevertheless, directs the eye toward the main subject(s).', '2004-05-10 18:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(709488, 75398, 6999, '<td valign="top">Has a impression of being over-sharpened, as though to negate the effects of slightly too slow an exposure, but the freezing of the water in motion suggests otherwise - perhaps too tight a crop on a small image, or something similar? Lacks the immediate sharpness of a real pop image, although its a great moment to capture for all that.</td>', 'Has a impression of being over-sharpened, as though to negate the effects of slightly too slow an exposure, but the freezing of the water in motion suggests otherwise - perhaps too tight a crop on a small image, or something similar? Lacks the immediate sharpness of a real pop image, although its a great moment to capture for all that.', '2004-05-10 18:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(709490, 75036, 16957, '<td valign="top">This is an arresting image with a fascinating depth when viewed on a flat screen from different angles. The colours and composition are effective and stimulating. the only thing that detracts from its appeal for me is the apparently over blurred/softened water. 8</td>', 'This is an arresting image with a fascinating depth when viewed on a flat screen from different angles. The colours and composition are effective and stimulating. the only thing that detracts from its appeal for me is the apparently over blurred/softened water. 8', '2004-05-10 18:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(709492, 75540, 13136, '<td valign="top">Seems a little overly bright on the top. There  is no detail in the sky at all (may not have been or may have been clouds). That contrasts with the fine detail of the road and weeds to create a discontinuity that is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Seems a little overly bright on the top. There  is no detail in the sky at all (may not have been or may have been clouds). That contrasts with the fine detail of the road and weeds to create a discontinuity that is a bit distracting.', '2004-05-10 18:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(709495, 75492, 6999, '<td valign="top">That really heavy balck order is I guess appropriate in this case - and I like the intention I percieve here - though i always find selective desturation slightly too blunt an effect to have real emotional impact. Love the rest of the editing work - though the suggestion of the sun in that burnt-out light makes the absence of shadows a touch too weird for my taste. Intriguing shot though - great sense of balance, compositionally.</td>', 'That really heavy balck order is I guess appropriate in this case - and I like the intention I percieve here - though i always find selective desturation slightly too blunt an effect to have real emotional impact. Love the rest of the editing work - though the suggestion of the sun in that burnt-out light makes the absence of shadows a touch too weird for my taste. Intriguing shot though - great sense of balance, compositionally.', '2004-05-10 18:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(709497, 75315, 13136, '<td valign="top">I realize your title puts the focus on the antlers, but somehow, I feel cheated not seeing their heads. Otherwise, the shot looks to be a bit light to me.</td>', 'I realize your title puts the focus on the antlers, but somehow, I feel cheated not seeing their heads. Otherwise, the shot looks to be a bit light to me.', '2004-05-10 18:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(709501, 75449, 13136, '<td valign="top">Pretty good. You got the fine detail of the hairs and the iridescence of the wings.</td>', 'Pretty good. You got the fine detail of the hairs and the iridescence of the wings.', '2004-05-10 18:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(709504, 75349, 21217, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Dramatic sky.</td>', 'Nice photo. Dramatic sky.', '2004-05-10 18:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(709507, 75523, 6999, '<td valign="top">Staggeringly good wildlife photo - almost beggars belief that you''ve never shot this before :-) That sense of chaos given by the specks of dirt that appear to be flying (on closer inspection the might well just be on a wall), but nevertheless the imapct is special. Great image.</td>', 'Staggeringly good wildlife photo - almost beggars belief that you''ve never shot this before :-) That sense of chaos given by the specks of dirt that appear to be flying (on closer inspection the might well just be on a wall), but nevertheless the imapct is special. Great image.', '2004-05-10 18:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(709509, 75526, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. Just enough motion on the water to keep the feel of it''s mostion. And a good expression on the model. You also managed to keep the face well lit even with the book covering the head. I hope you didn''t ruin the book.</td>', 'Nice catch. Just enough motion on the water to keep the feel of it''s mostion. And a good expression on the model. You also managed to keep the face well lit even with the book covering the head. I hope you didn''t ruin the book.', '2004-05-10 18:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(709511, 75532, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good: Lots of sharp details and excellent focus on the engine. Background is a bit blurry like the trees but not too bad.<br/> <br/>Bad: Appears to be overexposed. Hues and tones seem a bit unnatural.</td>', 'Good: Lots of sharp details and excellent focus on the engine. Background is a bit blurry like the trees but not too bad. Bad: Appears to be overexposed. Hues and tones seem a bit unnatural.', '2004-05-10 18:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(709512, 75539, 21217, '<td valign="top">May be a impressionist style painting?. Nice photo.</td>', 'May be a impressionist style painting?. Nice photo.', '2004-05-10 18:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(709513, 74924, 13136, '<td valign="top">Aaarrrgg! Too much green. <br/>Just kidding. Good composition and subject. I tend to think of a swamp as a dark place, maybe a bit too bright?</td>', 'Aaarrrgg! Too much green. Just kidding. Good composition and subject. I tend to think of a swamp as a dark place, maybe a bit too bright?', '2004-05-10 18:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(709516, 75185, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and composition. Not sure if it''s missing something in the Oomph department by not being green?</td>', 'Nice focus and composition. Not sure if it''s missing something in the Oomph department by not being green?', '2004-05-10 18:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(709518, 75536, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! Lucky how the grasshopper (or whatever this is) stayed put while you took the photo. Nice focus and lghting. Only thing I would have done is crop some of the dirt off the bottom.</td>', 'Nice shot! Lucky how the grasshopper (or whatever this is) stayed put while you took the photo. Nice focus and lghting. Only thing I would have done is crop some of the dirt off the bottom.', '2004-05-10 18:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(709519, 75349, 13610, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape. I''d really like to find a place like thisto take numerous shot of it. The horizon seems to be tilted down to the left a bit. It''s always hard to get a good exposure of something that is really far and you really did a great job in that department, still there is some blue fog left in front of your mountain but I think at this point that there''s nothing that can be done to release all the humidity from the air to get a clean mountain. I personnally like this kind of shot to have a warmer color temp. All in all a very very good shot. Worth a print (7)</td>', 'Beautiful landscape. I''d really like to find a place like thisto take numerous shot of it. The horizon seems to be tilted down to the left a bit. It''s always hard to get a good exposure of something that is really far and you really did a great job in that department, still there is some blue fog left in front of your mountain but I think at this point that there''s nothing that can be done to release all the humidity from the air to get a clean mountain. I personnally like this kind of shot to have a warmer color temp. All in all a very very good shot. Worth a print (7)', '2004-05-10 18:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(709520, 75234, 13610, '<td valign="top">Good colors, good choice of DOF. Too much noise, It look like a leveled underexposed shot.</td>', 'Good colors, good choice of DOF. Too much noise, It look like a leveled underexposed shot.', '2004-05-10 18:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(709521, 75595, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great perspective! Sepia works very well in this image. Well cropped. I do see evidence of compression but not enough where it''s overbearing. 8.</td>', 'Great perspective! Sepia works very well in this image. Well cropped. I do see evidence of compression but not enough where it''s overbearing. 8.', '2004-05-10 18:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(709522, 75575, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lots of things I don''t like about this I''m afraid. It ain''t easy to be hard about something, but or the sake of the low score I''m going to give you I''m going to explain. The organisation of stuff is poor - there''s such a lot going on, but nothing that specifically draws the eye - at one point it''s the colour of one area, at another the shape of something, but then the focus and the depth of field take the eye from there and pull it elsewhere. The lighting (which appears to be simply on-board flash) leaves no great sense of texture in anything, and also seems to have washed out what colour there is in this image. Look carefully at the more succesful still life shots here - and try to notice something about the quality of light in them, and the simplicity of composition of subject-matter.  There is no sense of organisation of subject here, and nothing to direct the eye, and this it scores a 1 from me.</td>', 'Lots of things I don''t like about this I''m afraid. It ain''t easy to be hard about something, but or the sake of the low score I''m going to give you I''m going to explain. The organisation of stuff is poor - there''s such a lot going on, but nothing that specifically draws the eye - at one point it''s the colour of one area, at another the shape of something, but then the focus and the depth of field take the eye from there and pull it elsewhere. The lighting (which appears to be simply on-board flash) leaves no great sense of texture in anything, and also seems to have washed out what colour there is in this image. Look carefully at the more succesful still life shots here - and try to notice something about the quality of light in them, and the simplicity of composition of subject-matter.  There is no sense of organisation of subject here, and nothing to direct the eye, and this it scores a 1 from me.', '2004-05-10 18:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(709526, 74866, 13610, '<td valign="top">Very good color, a lot of details on the tree. The bird seem Neatimaged a lot.</td>', 'Very good color, a lot of details on the tree. The bird seem Neatimaged a lot.', '2004-05-10 18:24:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(709527, 75537, 8054, '<td valign="top">Way too much water. I think this would have looked much better with more sky as the negative space.</td>', 'Way too much water. I think this would have looked much better with more sky as the negative space.', '2004-05-10 18:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(709528, 75515, 19205, '<td valign="top">More like great hair day, love it</td>', 'More like great hair day, love it', '2004-05-10 18:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(709529, 75526, 6999, '<td valign="top">Highly competent of it''s type I should think - though that type is something I find unappealing - kind of bland, and fake in a way that''s purely about a pretty girl in a posed situation ... has a slightly sinister undertone of sexism.</td>', 'Highly competent of it''s type I should think - though that type is something I find unappealing - kind of bland, and fake in a way that''s purely about a pretty girl in a posed situation ... has a slightly sinister undertone of sexism.', '2004-05-10 18:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(709530, 75545, 19205, '<td valign="top">Did you really go there?</td>', 'Did you really go there?', '2004-05-10 18:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(709532, 75630, 8054, '<td valign="top">This could benefit from tighter cropping. You have a good photo, however, with nice saturation, focus and details.</td>', 'This could benefit from tighter cropping. You have a good photo, however, with nice saturation, focus and details.', '2004-05-10 18:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(709533, 75307, 13610, '<td valign="top">Nothing to do with the photo by itself and it doesn''t affect the score but your title is moving out while the picture suggest moving in...<br/> <br/>I like the composition and the colors but the contrast seem to have bee set too high. The light seems very hard in this photo (5)</td>', 'Nothing to do with the photo by itself and it doesn''t affect the score but your title is moving out while the picture suggest moving in... I like the composition and the colors but the contrast seem to have bee set too high. The light seems very hard in this photo (5)', '2004-05-10 18:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(709539, 75515, 7628, '<td valign="top">A little bright on her right cheek, but a fabulous idea, well done with the hair flying and DOF shallow and the chains framing it so well! 8</td>', 'A little bright on her right cheek, but a fabulous idea, well done with the hair flying and DOF shallow and the chains framing it so well! 8', '2004-05-10 18:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(709541, 75597, 8054, '<td valign="top">WOW, amazing colors! I love the reds and pinks (in a manly sorta way)! At first I thought that this would be better with a shallow DOF but after I stared at it for a while, this version works better. Great focus and details throughout the image. 10!</td>', 'WOW, amazing colors! I love the reds and pinks (in a manly sorta way)! At first I thought that this would be better with a shallow DOF but after I stared at it for a while, this version works better. Great focus and details throughout the image. 10!', '2004-05-10 18:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(709544, 75300, 19205, '<td valign="top">Nice use of light</td>', 'Nice use of light', '2004-05-10 18:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(709546, 75390, 7628, '<td valign="top">the perfect idea!  I went to check out the WWII memorial website and none of their pictures of the wall convey th feeling this does.  I like your use of DOF, and the way the stars curve and how you''ve framed them works wonderfully. 9</td>', 'the perfect idea!  I went to check out the WWII memorial website and none of their pictures of the wall convey th feeling this does.  I like your use of DOF, and the way the stars curve and how you''ve framed them works wonderfully. 9', '2004-05-10 18:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(709547, 75626, 6999, '<td valign="top">In terms of simple technical competence this is wonderful. However, there''s an element of meaningfulness that I look for in a shot, and I don''t find much here - no great absorbtion in the light, and no great attraction in the image as a whole. Still a 6 though.</td>', 'In terms of simple technical competence this is wonderful. However, there''s an element of meaningfulness that I look for in a shot, and I don''t find much here - no great absorbtion in the light, and no great attraction in the image as a whole. Still a 6 though.', '2004-05-10 18:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(709548, 75498, 13610, '<td valign="top">Too much of a descriptive shot for my taste. 1st the subject is tilted. 2nd there are no colors. There are nothing special in your light and the subject is cropped too tight.</td>', 'Too much of a descriptive shot for my taste. 1st the subject is tilted. 2nd there are no colors. There are nothing special in your light and the subject is cropped too tight.', '2004-05-10 18:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(709550, 75306, 19205, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo</td>', 'Very nice photo', '2004-05-10 18:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(709552, 74763, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice color and interesting lighting.  I''d crop in a bit - maybe go with a vertical composition.</td>', 'Nice color and interesting lighting.  I''d crop in a bit - maybe go with a vertical composition.', '2004-05-10 18:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(709553, 74371, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how the sunlight draws a path within the path.</td>', 'I like how the sunlight draws a path within the path.', '2004-05-10 18:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(709555, 75549, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF for what it does to the background, but I wish more of the dandilion was tack sharp.</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF for what it does to the background, but I wish more of the dandilion was tack sharp.', '2004-05-10 18:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(709559, 75598, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, the lighting is a bit stark - did you use a flash?  More natural lighting on a cloudy day brings out color and texture better.</td>', 'Nice composition, the lighting is a bit stark - did you use a flash?  More natural lighting on a cloudy day brings out color and texture better.', '2004-05-10 18:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(709560, 75595, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great composition, lighting, and use of duotone, but the lovely texture of the old surfaces is lost in the compression artifacts. Looks like the file is 68k, remember you just have to get it under 150k. You are *much* better off in the 80-95% quality JPEG compression range, this looks closer to 50%.</td>', 'Great composition, lighting, and use of duotone, but the lovely texture of the old surfaces is lost in the compression artifacts. Looks like the file is 68k, remember you just have to get it under 150k. You are *much* better off in the 80-95% quality JPEG compression range, this looks closer to 50%.', '2004-05-10 18:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(709561, 75620, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice range of browns - I love the hairy texture - that winter coat is coming off!  Wish you had framed this with the barn above the action - rather than the horses ears popping over the top - a solid background would keep my eyes from wandering up to the sky.</td>', 'Nice range of browns - I love the hairy texture - that winter coat is coming off!  Wish you had framed this with the barn above the action - rather than the horses ears popping over the top - a solid background would keep my eyes from wandering up to the sky.', '2004-05-10 18:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(709563, 75098, 9763, '<td valign="top">The left side is a bit dark, perhaps cut that part out of the photo.  The colors are nice, especially in the reflection.  I would try to back up and get the entire boat (with polls and all).  Nice contrast.</td>', 'The left side is a bit dark, perhaps cut that part out of the photo.  The colors are nice, especially in the reflection.  I would try to back up and get the entire boat (with polls and all).  Nice contrast.', '2004-05-10 18:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(709564, 75532, 13610, '<td valign="top">I really like the exposition. It''s not too bright but we''re able to see a lot of details, unlike many of these too contrasted type of shots. (7)</td>', 'I really like the exposition. It''s not too bright but we''re able to see a lot of details, unlike many of these too contrasted type of shots. (7)', '2004-05-10 18:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(709565, 74670, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the nostalgic feel lent by the shadows.  Wish the radio was in sharper focus,</td>', 'I like the nostalgic feel lent by the shadows.  Wish the radio was in sharper focus,', '2004-05-10 18:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(709566, 75253, 9763, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit much, a bit washed out it seems.  The cropping is fine, but the rotation needs to move a tad bit counterclockwise I think.  The color is okay, but doesn''t stand out enough.  The idea is neat.</td>', 'The light is a bit much, a bit washed out it seems.  The cropping is fine, but the rotation needs to move a tad bit counterclockwise I think.  The color is okay, but doesn''t stand out enough.  The idea is neat.', '2004-05-10 18:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(709568, 75513, 7485, '<td valign="top">Cool subject, but odd lighting. Also, I think a much tighter crop could be more interesting.</td>', 'Cool subject, but odd lighting. Also, I think a much tighter crop could be more interesting.', '2004-05-10 18:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(709569, 74645, 9763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful symmetry!  I like the colors, composition and contrast.  The lighting is a bit bright though.  Perhaps close the aperature a tiny bit at the same exposure time.</td>', 'Beautiful symmetry!  I like the colors, composition and contrast.  The lighting is a bit bright though.  Perhaps close the aperature a tiny bit at the same exposure time.', '2004-05-10 18:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(709570, 75306, 9763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reptile.  I like the colors, the background and the composition.  The lighting is a bit bright though.  Nice clarity.</td>', 'Beautiful reptile.  I like the colors, the background and the composition.  The lighting is a bit bright though.  Nice clarity.', '2004-05-10 18:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(709571, 75636, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the novel angle on this one.  What beautiful eyes this cat has.</td>', 'I like the novel angle on this one.  What beautiful eyes this cat has.', '2004-05-10 18:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(709572, 75537, 13610, '<td valign="top">Great by the book composition. Maybe a little oversaturated. A good postal card. (6)</td>', 'Great by the book composition. Maybe a little oversaturated. A good postal card. (6)', '2004-05-10 18:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(709573, 75616, 9763, '<td valign="top">Blurry, abstract, not really engaging.  This would look better if it were clear and the top roundish thing weren''t cut off at all.</td>', 'Blurry, abstract, not really engaging.  This would look better if it were clear and the top roundish thing weren''t cut off at all.', '2004-05-10 18:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(709574, 75305, 19205, '<td valign="top">Did you mean "Still &amp; Quiet"??? Still I liked the picture</td>', 'Did you mean "Still & Quiet"??? Still I liked the picture', '2004-05-10 18:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(709575, 75496, 13610, '<td valign="top">Beautifull flower but the backgroung is noisy and blue</td>', 'Beautifull flower but the backgroung is noisy and blue', '2004-05-10 18:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(709576, 75537, 9763, '<td valign="top">Great color, composition, clarity and contrast.  I think the lighitng in the bottom left is a tad dark though... great photo overall 9</td>', 'Great color, composition, clarity and contrast.  I think the lighitng in the bottom left is a tad dark though... great photo overall 9', '2004-05-10 18:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(709577, 74361, 17065, '<td valign="top">Nice!<br/>On the critique side, the top third of the picture is a bit uninteresting, and it is a bit distracting that the lake creates a line is just above their backs. By lowering the camera a bit more, the lake would have ben covered. <br/>Still a good shot with good DOF. 7</td>', 'Nice!On the critique side, the top third of the picture is a bit uninteresting, and it is a bit distracting that the lake creates a line is just above their backs. By lowering the camera a bit more, the lake would have ben covered. Still a good shot with good DOF. 7', '2004-05-10 18:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(709579, 75642, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very simple.  The photo is a bit grey and not too engaging or interesting.  The shadow is nice, but the colors are a bit drab.  I would consider a different subject or perhaps put something else like a mouse or keyboard in the shot too.</td>', 'Very simple.  The photo is a bit grey and not too engaging or interesting.  The shadow is nice, but the colors are a bit drab.  I would consider a different subject or perhaps put something else like a mouse or keyboard in the shot too.', '2004-05-10 18:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(709581, 75527, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great composition and use of shallow DOF, but too bright. On my (recently calibrated) display, most of the suger is just one saturated white mass.</td>', 'Great composition and use of shallow DOF, but too bright. On my (recently calibrated) display, most of the suger is just one saturated white mass.', '2004-05-10 18:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(709582, 75115, 9763, '<td valign="top">Beatiful color and lighting.  I wish it weren''t cropped so tightly on the left (cutting off the feet).  I also think the top (above the head) needs a little more room.  Great action shot of the licking and cleaning!</td>', 'Beatiful color and lighting.  I wish it weren''t cropped so tightly on the left (cutting off the feet).  I also think the top (above the head) needs a little more room.  Great action shot of the licking and cleaning!', '2004-05-10 18:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(709588, 75382, 7485, '<td valign="top">Not quite sharp, and the light looks kind''a orange, but a great idea!</td>', 'Not quite sharp, and the light looks kind''a orange, but a great idea!', '2004-05-10 18:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(709589, 75369, 7628, '<td valign="top">Otherworldly.  What a fantastic glow.  Looks like Middle Earth.</td>', 'Otherworldly.  What a fantastic glow.  Looks like Middle Earth.', '2004-05-10 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(709591, 75436, 17065, '<td valign="top">Hm... interesting idea. Cant help but thinking the poles create a chaotic, distracting, pattern which is preventing me from be at rest with the composition. . 6.</td>', 'Hm... interesting idea. Cant help but thinking the poles create a chaotic, distracting, pattern which is preventing me from be at rest with the composition. . 6.', '2004-05-10 18:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(709593, 75536, 8005, '<td valign="top">I really had to look close...good job - 7</td>', 'I really had to look close...good job - 7', '2004-05-10 18:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(709595, 75555, 17065, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great DOF and very nice composition. Well spotted! 9.</td>', 'Wow. Great DOF and very nice composition. Well spotted! 9.', '2004-05-10 18:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(709597, 75539, 7628, '<td valign="top">A novel subject.  I like the colors and texture - the "open" saves it from being too abstract. 8</td>', 'A novel subject.  I like the colors and texture - the "open" saves it from being too abstract. 8', '2004-05-10 18:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(709600, 75100, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Love the sunset reflections, but the light on the rose and roof is kind''a bland.</td>', 'Great idea! Love the sunset reflections, but the light on the rose and roof is kind''a bland.', '2004-05-10 18:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(709601, 75620, 8054, '<td valign="top">Outstanding photo! Superb details everywhere. Nice job with DOF, too. 10.</td>', 'Outstanding photo! Superb details everywhere. Nice job with DOF, too. 10.', '2004-05-10 18:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(709604, 75597, 7485, '<td valign="top">If this your first spring flower picture, keep it up, it''s great!</td>', 'If this your first spring flower picture, keep it up, it''s great!', '2004-05-10 18:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(709605, 75177, 17065, '<td valign="top">Hmm.. looks like a snapshot to me. No obvious composition to enforce what the main subject is.</td>', 'Hmm.. looks like a snapshot to me. No obvious composition to enforce what the main subject is.', '2004-05-10 18:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(709607, 75555, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, a great place!  Wish there were more contrast in the sky and the colors were brighter.</td>', 'Lovely composition, a great place!  Wish there were more contrast in the sky and the colors were brighter.', '2004-05-10 18:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(709608, 75460, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very moving subject but it is overexposed.</td>', 'Very moving subject but it is overexposed.', '2004-05-10 18:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(709612, 75098, 8005, '<td valign="top">Pretty picture but out of focus</td>', 'Pretty picture but out of focus', '2004-05-10 18:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(709613, 75460, 7628, '<td valign="top">the stark white background really shows off the subject - harsh reality.  A difficult subject well portrayed.9</td>', 'the stark white background really shows off the subject - harsh reality.  A difficult subject well portrayed.9', '2004-05-10 18:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(709617, 75393, 8005, '<td valign="top">Not being able to see the tops of the trees takes away from the image.</td>', 'Not being able to see the tops of the trees takes away from the image.', '2004-05-10 18:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(709618, 75460, 17065, '<td valign="top">There''s a wow factor somewhere in this one, but you should soften the very bright background to get more focus on the main subject. <br/>Very nice composition. Good one!</td>', 'There''s a wow factor somewhere in this one, but you should soften the very bright background to get more focus on the main subject. Very nice composition. Good one!', '2004-05-10 18:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(709620, 75204, 8005, '<td valign="top">Great picture - 8</td>', 'Great picture - 8', '2004-05-10 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(709625, 74765, 7485, '<td valign="top">Just the eggs and nest could have been great (love that color blue!), but the out of focus leaves don''t work. In fact, just cropping this shot so the eggs end in the bottom-right corner would be a big improvement.</td>', 'Just the eggs and nest could have been great (love that color blue!), but the out of focus leaves don''t work. In fact, just cropping this shot so the eggs end in the bottom-right corner would be a big improvement.', '2004-05-10 18:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(709626, 75174, 8005, '<td valign="top">Great action shot - 9</td>', 'Great action shot - 9', '2004-05-10 18:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(709629, 75480, 7628, '<td valign="top">Radient! - Good lighting, I like the balance between the model and the weight - good idea Ms. Lemming!</td>', 'Radient! - Good lighting, I like the balance between the model and the weight - good idea Ms. Lemming!', '2004-05-10 19:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(709638, 75637, 7485, '<td valign="top">Straaaaange lighting! But I think I like the overall effect, I''ll have to come back to this one...</td>', 'Straaaaange lighting! But I think I like the overall effect, I''ll have to come back to this one...', '2004-05-10 19:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(709643, 75382, 17065, '<td valign="top">A bit uninteresting since there is nothing obvious to focus on. Maybe it would have been an improvement if the nozzle of the hose had been present in the pic just to get a natural subject. <br/>Nice capture of the texture. 6</td>', 'A bit uninteresting since there is nothing obvious to focus on. Maybe it would have been an improvement if the nozzle of the hose had been present in the pic just to get a natural subject. Nice capture of the texture. 6', '2004-05-10 19:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
