(709707, 74866, 5792, '<td valign="top">The cockatiel is exceptionally well focused and it is a nice pose. The tree, however, seems just a little harsh and "digital". I''d recommend selecting the branch only and apply a little gaussian blur to soften the branch up a little. That would also draw the viewer away from it and toward the main subject more. In any regard this is one of the best  images in the challenge.</td>', 'The cockatiel is exceptionally well focused and it is a nice pose. The tree, however, seems just a little harsh and "digital". I''d recommend selecting the branch only and apply a little gaussian blur to soften the branch up a little. That would also draw the viewer away from it and toward the main subject more. In any regard this is one of the best  images in the challenge.', '2004-05-10 19:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(709708, 75066, 18191, '<td valign="top">What a find...I wish a better zoom could have been taken but this shot makes me laugh regardless...</td>', 'What a find...I wish a better zoom could have been taken but this shot makes me laugh regardless...', '2004-05-10 19:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(709710, 75412, 7485, '<td valign="top">That *is* a new one: bicycles as texture! And that one red seat anchors it all, if only if had been a little higher up in the frame (and maybe loose some of the sky) the composition would be more balanced. 7</td>', 'That *is* a new one: bicycles as texture! And that one red seat anchors it all, if only if had been a little higher up in the frame (and maybe loose some of the sky) the composition would be more balanced. 7', '2004-05-10 19:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(709712, 75598, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done flower. Color, focus and DOF are all top notch. Background is great. One of the better flower images I have seen in while in challenges.</td>', 'Very nicely done flower. Color, focus and DOF are all top notch. Background is great. One of the better flower images I have seen in while in challenges.', '2004-05-10 19:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(709714, 75279, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great use of photojournalism...even though I cannot read the signs, the message is still brought through the image.</td>', 'Great use of photojournalism...even though I cannot read the signs, the message is still brought through the image.', '2004-05-10 19:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(709716, 75634, 17065, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been a stronger image if the boy had not been looking out of the picture. The subject implies a lonely boy contemplating whatever, but I can''t help getting the feeling he is watching something just outside the left edge. If he had been placed more to the right, it would look more as if he stared into nothingness, since there would more "nothing" to see in the picture. <br/>That said, this is a very good shot.</td>', 'I think it would have been a stronger image if the boy had not been looking out of the picture. The subject implies a lonely boy contemplating whatever, but I can''t help getting the feeling he is watching something just outside the left edge. If he had been placed more to the right, it would look more as if he stared into nothingness, since there would more "nothing" to see in the picture. That said, this is a very good shot.', '2004-05-10 19:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(709717, 75048, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing but an exceptional technical image. Great tones.</td>', 'Interesting framing but an exceptional technical image. Great tones.', '2004-05-10 19:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(709722, 74635, 18191, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, although the focus is a little off..I like the almost symmetrical look.</td>', 'Interesting subject, although the focus is a little off..I like the almost symmetrical look.', '2004-05-10 19:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
