(709727, 75490, 17065, '<td valign="top">If I didn''t know better I''d say this was one of those, "and this is picture I took of myself" shots. 8</td>', 'If I didn''t know better I''d say this was one of those, "and this is picture I took of myself" shots. 8', '2004-05-10 19:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
