(709750, 75575, 17065, '<td valign="top">Since everything is lying still, I would consider not using a flash, but a tripod instead. Also a smaller aperture would keep everything in focus.</td>', 'Since everything is lying still, I would consider not using a flash, but a tripod instead. Also a smaller aperture would keep everything in focus.', '2004-05-10 19:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
