(709755, 75398, 17065, '<td valign="top">well... 10! <br/>Not much to add, really.</td>', 'well... 10! Not much to add, really.', '2004-05-10 19:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(709757, 74919, 20779, '<td valign="top">I like this type of composition. I think the only thing I might change is what looks like sepia-tone on my screen. I prefer very crisp, slightly contrasty B &amp; W''s. But very nice arrangement!!</td>', 'I like this type of composition. I think the only thing I might change is what looks like sepia-tone on my screen. I prefer very crisp, slightly contrasty B & W''s. But very nice arrangement!!', '2004-05-10 19:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(709758, 75573, 18191, '<td valign="top">I wish more detail was in this image...the left side dominates and I''d give it a higher numbe, but maybe i am missing the point...lemme stop arguing with myself and give you a score...</td>', 'I wish more detail was in this image...the left side dominates and I''d give it a higher numbe, but maybe i am missing the point...lemme stop arguing with myself and give you a score...', '2004-05-10 19:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(709760, 75602, 20779, '<td valign="top">Love it! Why can''t I think of these things!! Actually, your techinique is obviously superb and this is a great example. You cropped just the right amount for me and I like the monotone blues. Great shot!</td>', 'Love it! Why can''t I think of these things!! Actually, your techinique is obviously superb and this is a great example. You cropped just the right amount for me and I like the monotone blues. Great shot!', '2004-05-10 19:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(709761, 75208, 17065, '<td valign="top">Something new indeed. ;.) <br/>A wee bit more light on the strawberry would not have hurt. 7</td>', 'Something new indeed. ;.) A wee bit more light on the strawberry would not have hurt. 7', '2004-05-10 19:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(709763, 75501, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5. I felt it was a nice composition but it just didn''t wow me. It seems a bit bland. A scene like this would have been great if the fencepost had some flowers winding around the ivy or if there were some flowers in the meadow in the background  (I realize this isn''t something you can control ---  I just mean that a bit of color would have added more interest to this scene).</td>', 'I gave this a 5. I felt it was a nice composition but it just didn''t wow me. It seems a bit bland. A scene like this would have been great if the fencepost had some flowers winding around the ivy or if there were some flowers in the meadow in the background  (I realize this isn''t something you can control ---  I just mean that a bit of color would have added more interest to this scene).', '2004-05-10 19:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(709765, 75643, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very soothing picture. I might have liked to have seen a bit more central focus or subject, but very crisp, clean shot!</td>', 'Very soothing picture. I might have liked to have seen a bit more central focus or subject, but very crisp, clean shot!', '2004-05-10 19:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(709768, 75328, 20779, '<td valign="top">This is a WOW for me. The color is so rich and I love the composition.</td>', 'This is a WOW for me. The color is so rich and I love the composition.', '2004-05-10 19:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(709770, 75490, 20779, '<td valign="top">Cute and unique shot! Detail and color are wonderful!</td>', 'Cute and unique shot! Detail and color are wonderful!', '2004-05-10 19:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(709771, 75177, 7322, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I gave this a three. It just seems to be a snapshot you took out of a moving car. While that may be a place you''ve never taken pictures before, it doesn''t make this an interesting shot. The wierd angle serves no visual purpose.</td>', 'Sorry, I gave this a three. It just seems to be a snapshot you took out of a moving car. While that may be a place you''ve never taken pictures before, it doesn''t make this an interesting shot. The wierd angle serves no visual purpose.', '2004-05-10 19:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(709774, 75499, 20779, '<td valign="top">I like this idea and what you knew to catch. It would have been even better had you been able to create a slightly more balanced composition and a little more focus. But excellent bird shot.</td>', 'I like this idea and what you knew to catch. It would have been even better had you been able to create a slightly more balanced composition and a little more focus. But excellent bird shot.', '2004-05-10 19:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(709776, 74627, 7322, '<td valign="top">There are a few technical problems with this shot. It is overexposed so there is very little detail in the rune stones. At first I thought they were pills, in fact. There are far too many hot spots. The highlights in the fabric are over exposed and I can''t even figure out what that bright spot withteh cord dangling down in the corner is. The border just adds to the mess and distraction. Sorry, I gave this a four.</td>', 'There are a few technical problems with this shot. It is overexposed so there is very little detail in the rune stones. At first I thought they were pills, in fact. There are far too many hot spots. The highlights in the fabric are over exposed and I can''t even figure out what that bright spot withteh cord dangling down in the corner is. The border just adds to the mess and distraction. Sorry, I gave this a four.', '2004-05-10 19:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(709782, 75048, 20539, '<td valign="top">very original. i like how its done</td>', 'very original. i like how its done', '2004-05-10 19:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(709784, 74771, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty garden but this image is too small to appreciate the shot. I''m not sure it would be significantly better at a larger size. The colors are rather drab and washed out. The tulips aren''t really massed enough to warrent filling the frame with so many. Picking a single flower and finding a position that would show the light penetrating the translucent petals is one way to show flowers at their best in a photograph.I would classify this as a rather pedestrian snapshot.I gave it a four.</td>', 'This is a pretty garden but this image is too small to appreciate the shot. I''m not sure it would be significantly better at a larger size. The colors are rather drab and washed out. The tulips aren''t really massed enough to warrent filling the frame with so many. Picking a single flower and finding a position that would show the light penetrating the translucent petals is one way to show flowers at their best in a photograph.I would classify this as a rather pedestrian snapshot.I gave it a four.', '2004-05-10 19:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(709789, 75315, 20539, '<td valign="top">it would be nicer if you caught the animals with their heads up...</td>', 'it would be nicer if you caught the animals with their heads up...', '2004-05-10 19:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(709790, 75595, 18655, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of sepia toning</td>', 'Nice choice of sepia toning', '2004-05-10 19:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(709791, 75603, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice dog shot. The focus is crisp and there are good highlights in the dog''s eyes. It''s not an amazing shot though. I gave it a four because I''m sceptical that this is something you''ve never shot before. Otherwise, I would have given it a five.</td>', 'This is a nice dog shot. The focus is crisp and there are good highlights in the dog''s eyes. It''s not an amazing shot though. I gave it a four because I''m sceptical that this is something you''ve never shot before. Otherwise, I would have given it a five.', '2004-05-10 19:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(709793, 75616, 20539, '<td valign="top">its just way too blurry</td>', 'its just way too blurry', '2004-05-10 19:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(709795, 74763, 18655, '<td valign="top">I remember seeing this on the chat board...  hmmm... nice image though!</td>', 'I remember seeing this on the chat board...  hmmm... nice image though!', '2004-05-10 19:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(709796, 74371, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful...</td>', 'Very peaceful...', '2004-05-10 19:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(709797, 75527, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and contrast for a B&amp;W. You made something very common appear very special. I guess that is a key to photography! The tops of the containers are a tad bit messy looking against the tight crispness of the rest, but that is nit-picking!</td>', 'Very nice lighting and contrast for a B&W. You made something very common appear very special. I guess that is a key to photography! The tops of the containers are a tad bit messy looking against the tight crispness of the rest, but that is nit-picking!', '2004-05-10 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(709799, 75253, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great idea - and nice and crisp!</td>', 'Great idea - and nice and crisp!', '2004-05-10 19:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(709800, 75641, 18191, '<td valign="top">The lengthened exposure adds a lot here</td>', 'The lengthened exposure adds a lot here', '2004-05-10 19:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(709801, 75498, 16563, '<td valign="top">slanted, and it would be better if the background floor was a bit more blurred. Everything is in focus.</td>', 'slanted, and it would be better if the background floor was a bit more blurred. Everything is in focus.', '2004-05-10 19:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(709802, 75541, 18655, '<td valign="top">Nice effect but would have done better in the negative space challenges...</td>', 'Nice effect but would have done better in the negative space challenges...', '2004-05-10 19:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(709803, 75350, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five mostly because it is a nice point of view. I don''t really care for much else about the photograph. The color is boring and the details are washed out and at this size it''s really hard to appreciate the composition much. The landscape itself doesn''t have much ''wow'' factor. You''ve got a good eye for composition. I gave this a four.</td>', 'I gave this a five mostly because it is a nice point of view. I don''t really care for much else about the photograph. The color is boring and the details are washed out and at this size it''s really hard to appreciate the composition much. The landscape itself doesn''t have much ''wow'' factor. You''ve got a good eye for composition. I gave this a four.', '2004-05-10 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(709805, 74924, 16563, '<td valign="top">I think the sky is overexposed and blown out. Best if a graduated filter was used.</td>', 'I think the sky is overexposed and blown out. Best if a graduated filter was used.', '2004-05-10 19:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(709806, 75540, 18655, '<td valign="top">I love it - nice effect with sepia toning!</td>', 'I love it - nice effect with sepia toning!', '2004-05-10 19:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(709807, 75273, 16563, '<td valign="top">Strange color. Sepia or black and white would''ve worked better I think.</td>', 'Strange color. Sepia or black and white would''ve worked better I think.', '2004-05-10 19:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(709808, 75526, 20779, '<td valign="top">Photo really "pops" and has a lot of energy!</td>', 'Photo really "pops" and has a lot of energy!', '2004-05-10 19:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(709809, 75555, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great photo - nice use of foreground</td>', 'Great photo - nice use of foreground', '2004-05-10 19:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(709811, 75240, 16563, '<td valign="top">The middle leaf looks cut off, and the flower has too many distracting elements around it.</td>', 'The middle leaf looks cut off, and the flower has too many distracting elements around it.', '2004-05-10 19:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(709812, 75640, 20779, '<td valign="top">The lighting completely makes this one. And the foreground focus.</td>', 'The lighting completely makes this one. And the foreground focus.', '2004-05-10 19:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(709813, 75496, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a four. The colors seems drab and the composition isn''t particularly interesting. I can see what attracted you to the flowers but it doesn''t look like much time or thought was put into framing (or lighting) them to show them at their best.</td>', 'I gave this a four. The colors seems drab and the composition isn''t particularly interesting. I can see what attracted you to the flowers but it doesn''t look like much time or thought was put into framing (or lighting) them to show them at their best.', '2004-05-10 19:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(709817, 75204, 20779, '<td valign="top">This is a very fun, colorful shot. It appears a bit pasted in to me, giving it a slight detached look for my taste.</td>', 'This is a very fun, colorful shot. It appears a bit pasted in to me, giving it a slight detached look for my taste.', '2004-05-10 19:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(709820, 75641, 20779, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity here. I would have liked a little more focus on a subject to really draw me in, and perhaps a little more color/lighting to give a bit more energy.</td>', 'I like the simplicity here. I would have liked a little more focus on a subject to really draw me in, and perhaps a little more color/lighting to give a bit more energy.', '2004-05-10 20:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(709821, 75540, 16563, '<td valign="top">Nice soft colors, if the sky was more interesting it would''ve helped.</td>', 'Nice soft colors, if the sky was more interesting it would''ve helped.', '2004-05-10 20:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(709822, 75616, 16563, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it. There''s nothing in focus to draw the attention of the viewer.</td>', 'I don''t get it. There''s nothing in focus to draw the attention of the viewer.', '2004-05-10 20:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(709824, 75549, 16563, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and design, but the center of the flower should''ve been in focus and not the sides. And with advanced editing, the speck of black should''ve been removed, it is distracting.</td>', 'Nice colors and design, but the center of the flower should''ve been in focus and not the sides. And with advanced editing, the speck of black should''ve been removed, it is distracting.', '2004-05-10 20:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(709832, 75533, 18655, '<td valign="top">Cool! Crisp colours and nice focus</td>', 'Cool! Crisp colours and nice focus', '2004-05-10 20:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(709833, 75061, 18655, '<td valign="top">Sharp!</td>', 'Sharp!', '2004-05-10 20:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(709835, 75066, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2004-05-10 20:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(709836, 75494, 20539, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot. goes very well with the subject too, since you have probably not taken too many shots from that location! im giving it a 10</td>', 'beautiful shot. goes very well with the subject too, since you have probably not taken too many shots from that location! im giving it a 10', '2004-05-10 20:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(709840, 75436, 20539, '<td valign="top">nice play with colors.</td>', 'nice play with colors.', '2004-05-10 20:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(709842, 75635, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rainbow. I like the two depths of blue. The shot could use a bit more of a focal interest and sharpness, but an overall pleasing image!</td>', 'Beautiful rainbow. I like the two depths of blue. The shot could use a bit more of a focal interest and sharpness, but an overall pleasing image!', '2004-05-10 20:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(709845, 74635, 20779, '<td valign="top">Unusual shot and very crisp! I think I may have liked a little less cropping and a bit more color, but great focus and lighting.</td>', 'Unusual shot and very crisp! I think I may have liked a little less cropping and a bit more color, but great focus and lighting.', '2004-05-10 20:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(709848, 75568, 20779, '<td valign="top">I like the jewel-like tones in the frog. I wish there was a little more connectiveness between the high colors and the rest of the rusty tomes. He almost looks disembodied a bit, but a good idea.</td>', 'I like the jewel-like tones in the frog. I wish there was a little more connectiveness between the high colors and the rest of the rusty tomes. He almost looks disembodied a bit, but a good idea.', '2004-05-10 20:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(709852, 75360, 16563, '<td valign="top">I think too much post processing was done on this photo. Everything looks plastic like and the colors are fake. Use saturation wisely and if neat image was used, use that lightly also.</td>', 'I think too much post processing was done on this photo. Everything looks plastic like and the colors are fake. Use saturation wisely and if neat image was used, use that lightly also.', '2004-05-10 20:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(709854, 75508, 20779, '<td valign="top">I love the red dusky hues and the silhouettes. I think it might be improved with a little less black given to the bottom portion, but I enjoy it nevertheless!</td>', 'I love the red dusky hues and the silhouettes. I think it might be improved with a little less black given to the bottom portion, but I enjoy it nevertheless!', '2004-05-10 20:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(709857, 75460, 20779, '<td valign="top">The vivid colors and lighting are really making this shot! And what a contrast to the man we see here. Great one!</td>', 'The vivid colors and lighting are really making this shot! And what a contrast to the man we see here. Great one!', '2004-05-10 20:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(709858, 75341, 16563, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the sky is often times like this over there, but it would really be a much better photo had there been some clouds or even dark rain clouds giving it an ominious look. But good overall composition.</td>', 'I''m sure the sky is often times like this over there, but it would really be a much better photo had there been some clouds or even dark rain clouds giving it an ominious look. But good overall composition.', '2004-05-10 20:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(709863, 75492, 20779, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I think you were going for contrasty graininess here. I like the composition and the filtered light.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I think you were going for contrasty graininess here. I like the composition and the filtered light.', '2004-05-10 20:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(709867, 75094, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a four. The image is quite a bit tilted, as you''ll notice if you look at the steps and the podium (or whatever that structure is in the foreground).The podium thing itself is a big distraction in the foreground. The tree at the edge of the frame is very distracting. It would have been better to find a different position to eliminate unecessary objects in the frame. That glowing spot over the door keeps leading my eye right to it without a payoff. The real interest in this image is the contrast of color between the twilit sky and the architectural details at the top of the building.</td>', 'I gave this a four. The image is quite a bit tilted, as you''ll notice if you look at the steps and the podium (or whatever that structure is in the foreground).The podium thing itself is a big distraction in the foreground. The tree at the edge of the frame is very distracting. It would have been better to find a different position to eliminate unecessary objects in the frame. That glowing spot over the door keeps leading my eye right to it without a payoff. The real interest in this image is the contrast of color between the twilit sky and the architectural details at the top of the building.', '2004-05-10 20:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(709868, 75630, 20779, '<td valign="top">I think the color and crispness of the flowers is great. I think the background might be a little cluttered and the focus uneven.</td>', 'I think the color and crispness of the flowers is great. I think the background might be a little cluttered and the focus uneven.', '2004-05-10 20:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(709872, 74703, 20779, '<td valign="top">Too funny! And great color, focus and crop! Really good one for me!</td>', 'Too funny! And great color, focus and crop! Really good one for me!', '2004-05-10 20:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(709874, 74669, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a four. The mood is nice but the shot is blurry (a tripod would have been useful). Your title says Fire Water yet there is no evidence of fire, probably because of the blur.</td>', 'I gave this a four. The mood is nice but the shot is blurry (a tripod would have been useful). Your title says Fire Water yet there is no evidence of fire, probably because of the blur.', '2004-05-10 20:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(709877, 75177, 20779, '<td valign="top">I may not be getting what you wanted here, or perhaps not my taste. The reflections, tilt, blurs and muddiness hurt this for me.</td>', 'I may not be getting what you wanted here, or perhaps not my taste. The reflections, tilt, blurs and muddiness hurt this for me.', '2004-05-10 20:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(709879, 75588, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, breathtaking clarity and lighting!!!!! Excellent! One of the best to me!</td>', 'Beautiful, breathtaking clarity and lighting!!!!! Excellent! One of the best to me!', '2004-05-10 20:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(709882, 75583, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a four. A closer view might have helped if that was possible. The image is very high key and contrasty. It is difficult to see any detail between the overexposed reflections and sky and the underexposed shadows. The color is rather harsh and cold for this scene.</td>', 'I gave this a four. A closer view might have helped if that was possible. The image is very high key and contrasty. It is difficult to see any detail between the overexposed reflections and sky and the underexposed shadows. The color is rather harsh and cold for this scene.', '2004-05-10 20:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(709888, 75475, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an imcomprehensible still-life. If it''s meant to be an abstract, it isn''t working for me because the lines and shapes are too jumbled. There is no visual harmony. I gave it a four.</td>', 'This is an imcomprehensible still-life. If it''s meant to be an abstract, it isn''t working for me because the lines and shapes are too jumbled. There is no visual harmony. I gave it a four.', '2004-05-10 20:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(709897, 75090, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five. The subject is interesting and there''s nice use of shallow depth of field. I''m not sure a horizontal format was the best choice to show of this interesting plant. There isn''t quite enough detail in the spiral section of the plants. The lower one is a bit out of focus.</td>', 'I gave this a five. The subject is interesting and there''s nice use of shallow depth of field. I''m not sure a horizontal format was the best choice to show of this interesting plant. There isn''t quite enough detail in the spiral section of the plants. The lower one is a bit out of focus.', '2004-05-10 20:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(709910, 75098, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five. It is a nice composition and I like the reflections. It''s a bit too contrasty (the lights are too light and the darks too dark). Much of the detail is washed out.</td>', 'I gave this a five. It is a nice composition and I like the reflections. It''s a bit too contrasty (the lights are too light and the darks too dark). Much of the detail is washed out.', '2004-05-10 20:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(709911, 75500, 20779, '<td valign="top">I really love the set-up and idea here. I wish there wasn''t such a difference in focus and clarity between the background and the train. But great idea!!!</td>', 'I really love the set-up and idea here. I wish there wasn''t such a difference in focus and clarity between the background and the train. But great idea!!!', '2004-05-10 20:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(709914, 75253, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five. I don''t love the composition but the exposure is decent and it is an interesting subject which I can easily believe you''ve never photographed before.</td>', 'I gave this a five. I don''t love the composition but the exposure is decent and it is an interesting subject which I can easily believe you''ve never photographed before.', '2004-05-10 20:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(709917, 75369, 11518, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I can almost see the elves and leprechauns coming out...Very good lighting, shadows and highlights have good detail. 10</td>', 'Very nice, I can almost see the elves and leprechauns coming out...Very good lighting, shadows and highlights have good detail. 10', '2004-05-10 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(709920, 75360, 20779, '<td valign="top">What an eye-catcher! Looks very processed, but I love the old-time postcard look.</td>', 'What an eye-catcher! Looks very processed, but I love the old-time postcard look.', '2004-05-10 20:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(709922, 75417, 11518, '<td valign="top">perfect macro shot, very nice colours. 10</td>', 'perfect macro shot, very nice colours. 10', '2004-05-10 20:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(709924, 75528, 20779, '<td valign="top">Another WOW for me.</td>', 'Another WOW for me.', '2004-05-10 20:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(709926, 75632, 20779, '<td valign="top">I love this scene and the B &amp; W is done perfectly.</td>', 'I love this scene and the B & W is done perfectly.', '2004-05-10 20:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(709927, 75449, 7322, '<td valign="top">I thought you captured the details on the fly beautifully, right down to the irridescent colors but for some reason this shot just doesn''t wow me. For that reason I gave it a five. I don''t usually like to be vague but I think in this case it is just a matter of taste.</td>', 'I thought you captured the details on the fly beautifully, right down to the irridescent colors but for some reason this shot just doesn''t wow me. For that reason I gave it a five. I don''t usually like to be vague but I think in this case it is just a matter of taste.', '2004-05-10 20:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(709929, 74999, 20779, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2004-05-10 20:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(709931, 74763, 20779, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites! Great technique, color, lighting, composition; it has it all for me.</td>', 'One of my favorites! Great technique, color, lighting, composition; it has it all for me.', '2004-05-10 20:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(709933, 75636, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot of this cat''s face. Nice crisp details. The whiskers stand right out. Interesting perspective as well. I gave it a five because it doesn''t knock my socks off and I''m sceptical it''s a subject you''ve never photographed before.</td>', 'This is a nice shot of this cat''s face. Nice crisp details. The whiskers stand right out. Interesting perspective as well. I gave it a five because it doesn''t knock my socks off and I''m sceptical it''s a subject you''ve never photographed before.', '2004-05-10 20:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(709934, 75305, 20779, '<td valign="top">Pro quality and very velvetly -- matches the mood of the shot perfectly. Maybe a little more light? I''m not sure.</td>', 'Pro quality and very velvetly -- matches the mood of the shot perfectly. Maybe a little more light? I''m not sure.', '2004-05-10 20:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(709936, 75390, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five. It''s an interesting abstract but a lot of the details are blurred out because of really shallow depth of field. I have no idea what it is so the title is baffling to me. A new generation of what?</td>', 'I gave this a five. It''s an interesting abstract but a lot of the details are blurred out because of really shallow depth of field. I have no idea what it is so the title is baffling to me. A new generation of what?', '2004-05-10 20:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(709937, 75369, 18505, '<td valign="top">I like the mood, the subtle colors, and the composition.  I hope you decide to make it a print.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the mood, the subtle colors, and the composition.  I hope you decide to make it a print.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-05-10 20:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(709942, 75393, 20779, '<td valign="top">I love this kind of moody and dark take. Very high score from me. The fence is lit so finely, giving it the focus and crispness needed. Great one!</td>', 'I love this kind of moody and dark take. Very high score from me. The fence is lit so finely, giving it the focus and crispness needed. Great one!', '2004-05-10 20:44:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(709943, 75573, 20779, '<td valign="top">What beauty!!!! I adore the blues here. Crisp, sharp reflection, sky and distant hills. Excellent score for me!</td>', 'What beauty!!!! I adore the blues here. Crisp, sharp reflection, sky and distant hills. Excellent score for me!', '2004-05-10 20:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(709948, 75545, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and unique. Good clarity!</td>', 'Very interesting and unique. Good clarity!', '2004-05-10 20:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(709949, 75176, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five. I like the cat''s smug expression withhis slight wink. I like the framing. There could be a bit more detail in the cat''s face. I know this is difficult with a black cat. One of my cats is all black. I''m kind of sceptical that you''ve never photographed a cat before but I guess if you aren''t a cat lover it''s possible.  ^..^</td>', 'I gave this a five. I like the cat''s smug expression withhis slight wink. I like the framing. There could be a bit more detail in the cat''s face. I know this is difficult with a black cat. One of my cats is all black. I''m kind of sceptical that you''ve never photographed a cat before but I guess if you aren''t a cat lover it''s possible.  ^..^', '2004-05-10 20:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(709953, 75408, 7322, '<td valign="top">It took me two viewings over two days to realize what this was. I gave it a five. I think it has a lot of technical merit. I just didn''t love it that much.</td>', 'It took me two viewings over two days to realize what this was. I gave it a five. I think it has a lot of technical merit. I just didn''t love it that much.', '2004-05-10 20:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(709954, 75541, 10350, '<td valign="top">is this the blue lagoon??</td>', 'is this the blue lagoon??', '2004-05-10 20:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(709957, 74798, 20779, '<td valign="top">Just when I thought i had seen it all . . . . GREAT!</td>', 'Just when I thought i had seen it all . . . . GREAT!', '2004-05-10 20:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(709960, 75100, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five because overall it is pretty good technically. I didn''t like the clashing of colors in the rose and the wine. I know the title is meet me on the roof but I don''t like the asphault shingles as background.</td>', 'I gave this a five because overall it is pretty good technically. I didn''t like the clashing of colors in the rose and the wine. I know the title is meet me on the roof but I don''t like the asphault shingles as background.', '2004-05-10 20:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(709961, 75246, 20779, '<td valign="top">Would have been higher for me without the sticks (?) popping up, but the colors are very engaging! And I like the angle. A little fuzzy in the front.</td>', 'Would have been higher for me without the sticks (?) popping up, but the colors are very engaging! And I like the angle. A little fuzzy in the front.', '2004-05-10 20:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(709963, 75597, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five. It would have been a six but I felt that the few spots of green leaves poking through the mass of color detracted from the effect. I also really dislike the tacky thin red line in the border.</td>', 'I gave this a five. It would have been a six but I felt that the few spots of green leaves poking through the mass of color detracted from the effect. I also really dislike the tacky thin red line in the border.', '2004-05-10 20:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(709967, 74646, 20779, '<td valign="top">Such crisp and vibrant color and a great perspective!!!!!</td>', 'Such crisp and vibrant color and a great perspective!!!!!', '2004-05-10 20:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(709969, 75535, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five. I wanted to score higher because I generally like this type of image. Unfortunately, it was just too blurred and double exposed looking. There should have been one ''solid'' subject to focus on.</td>', 'I gave this a five. I wanted to score higher because I generally like this type of image. Unfortunately, it was just too blurred and double exposed looking. There should have been one ''solid'' subject to focus on.', '2004-05-10 20:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(709971, 75416, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five because it technically looks pretty good and it''s fairly original. Otherwise, it doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'I gave this a five because it technically looks pretty good and it''s fairly original. Otherwise, it doesn''t do much for me.', '2004-05-10 20:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(709977, 75513, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five for effort. It looks like you went out of your way to find something new to shoot. I don''t love the shot but technically there''s not a lot to complain about. Perhaps tighter framing on the central formation? The flash created quite a few overly hot highlights. The focus seems sharper onthat little turd shaped thing underneath the central formation.</td>', 'I gave this a five for effort. It looks like you went out of your way to find something new to shoot. I don''t love the shot but technically there''s not a lot to complain about. Perhaps tighter framing on the central formation? The flash created quite a few overly hot highlights. The focus seems sharper onthat little turd shaped thing underneath the central formation.', '2004-05-10 20:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(709978, 75483, 2223, '<td valign="top">I just want to squish it dead!</td>', 'I just want to squish it dead!', '2004-05-10 20:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(709981, 75042, 18191, '<td valign="top">The lighting could have been better here but of course you couldn''t control it.</td>', 'The lighting could have been better here but of course you couldn''t control it.', '2004-05-10 21:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(709982, 75305, 16479, '<td valign="top">I like this one very much...10 points</td>', 'I like this one very much...10 points', '2004-05-10 21:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(709984, 75254, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like the shot..but not the corny title, but i wont take off for that...this shot gives a feeling of serenity...but i wish someone was sitting on the bench, it would have added a lot to the composition.</td>', 'I like the shot..but not the corny title, but i wont take off for that...this shot gives a feeling of serenity...but i wish someone was sitting on the bench, it would have added a lot to the composition.', '2004-05-10 21:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(709987, 75181, 7560, '<td valign="top">Excellent texture, and sharpness.</td>', 'Excellent texture, and sharpness.', '2004-05-10 21:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(709988, 75307, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five. I like the overall perspective. I think waiting until the train was looming closer in the frame (or moving in closer if it''s not a moving train) would have created a more imposing subject. The overall seen is much too contrasty. I don''t think you need quite as much sky. If you can go back and do this again (lowering the contrast on your camera if you can) you have the makings of an excellent shot.</td>', 'I gave this a five. I like the overall perspective. I think waiting until the train was looming closer in the frame (or moving in closer if it''s not a moving train) would have created a more imposing subject. The overall seen is much too contrasty. I don''t think you need quite as much sky. If you can go back and do this again (lowering the contrast on your camera if you can) you have the makings of an excellent shot.', '2004-05-10 21:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(709991, 75307, 18191, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea but probably should have been cropped so as to include the train in the line of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'This was a good idea but probably should have been cropped so as to include the train in the line of the rule of thirds.', '2004-05-10 21:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(709992, 75523, 7560, '<td valign="top">Aww! How cute!  I like that almost all of them have their mouths open. Nice job.</td>', 'Aww! How cute!  I like that almost all of them have their mouths open. Nice job.', '2004-05-10 21:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(709994, 75583, 18191, '<td valign="top">Cool shot...but the vertical composition of the tree just doesnt click for me.</td>', 'Cool shot...but the vertical composition of the tree just doesnt click for me.', '2004-05-10 21:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(709999, 75583, 7560, '<td valign="top">Very striking. You might consider tinkering with the sky once this is out of the challenge. I think with a slightly darker sky this could be striking!</td>', 'Very striking. You might consider tinkering with the sky once this is out of the challenge. I think with a slightly darker sky this could be striking!', '2004-05-10 21:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(710000, 74430, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five. Technically it''s not bad. I think you could have put more effort into the framing device. Maybe if you had kept them all the same side up and paid more attention to keeping it symetrical. If you''ll notice, the top edge of the black space is much lareger than the bottom and the same goes for the right plane and the left.</td>', 'I gave this a five. Technically it''s not bad. I think you could have put more effort into the framing device. Maybe if you had kept them all the same side up and paid more attention to keeping it symetrical. If you''ll notice, the top edge of the black space is much lareger than the bottom and the same goes for the right plane and the left.', '2004-05-10 21:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(710003, 75523, 18191, '<td valign="top">How cute!...i wish the background was not so distracting though</td>', 'How cute!...i wish the background was not so distracting though', '2004-05-10 21:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(710007, 75616, 18191, '<td valign="top">I hope this was intended to be abtract because the focus is not on and the horizon is tilted.</td>', 'I hope this was intended to be abtract because the focus is not on and the horizon is tilted.', '2004-05-10 21:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(710008, 75412, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five. I think it has a lot of potential. I really like the composition for the most part. Unfortunately, the colors are rather drab where they should really be popping. There seems to be an awfully large expanse of overexposed sky taking up the top of the frame.</td>', 'I gave this a five. I think it has a lot of potential. I really like the composition for the most part. Unfortunately, the colors are rather drab where they should really be popping. There seems to be an awfully large expanse of overexposed sky taking up the top of the frame.', '2004-05-10 21:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(710009, 74670, 18191, '<td valign="top">I think that the focus should have been sharpest on the numbers rather than on a plane slightly in front of the radio...or you can try different depth of fields...</td>', 'I think that the focus should have been sharpest on the numbers rather than on a plane slightly in front of the radio...or you can try different depth of fields...', '2004-05-10 21:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(710010, 74665, 7560, '<td valign="top">beautiful! The soft feel really lends itself to the mood you are going for. Love the mist on the water. One of my top shots- 9</td>', 'beautiful! The soft feel really lends itself to the mood you are going for. Love the mist on the water. One of my top shots- 9', '2004-05-10 21:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(710014, 75418, 7560, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture! I like the use of black and white.</td>', 'Excellent capture! I like the use of black and white.', '2004-05-10 21:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(710016, 75279, 7560, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you captured the front protester''s eyes. It adds depth to the image that would not be there otherwise.</td>', 'I really like the way you captured the front protester''s eyes. It adds depth to the image that would not be there otherwise.', '2004-05-10 21:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(710017, 75417, 16479, '<td valign="top">very nice close-up shot of this butterfly....10 points</td>', 'very nice close-up shot of this butterfly....10 points', '2004-05-10 21:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(710019, 75500, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five. Mainly because I couldn''t tell if this is a real scene (I think it is) or a model train with a poster in the background. It was mostly just confusing to me because of the title. I don''t understand the choice of blurred background. The reason I gave it as high as a five is because I like the composition if the background wasn''t all blurred. Also, I''m guessing I''m missing some element that would enlighten me.</td>', 'I gave this a five. Mainly because I couldn''t tell if this is a real scene (I think it is) or a model train with a poster in the background. It was mostly just confusing to me because of the title. I don''t understand the choice of blurred background. The reason I gave it as high as a five is because I like the composition if the background wasn''t all blurred. Also, I''m guessing I''m missing some element that would enlighten me.', '2004-05-10 21:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(710024, 75542, 18505, '<td valign="top">Great combinatin of colors.  Compelling subject.  I love the combination of shapes and textures.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Great combinatin of colors.  Compelling subject.  I love the combination of shapes and textures.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-05-10 21:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
