(710028, 75494, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great shot from a plane window! I like the choice of B&amp;W.</td>', 'Great shot from a plane window! I like the choice of B&W.', '2004-05-10 21:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(710030, 75519, 18191, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get it...but the geometry works well here...i think you have a little moire effect here and the white dot in the deep sky is a little annoying</td>', 'I don''t quite get it...but the geometry works well here...i think you have a little moire effect here and the white dot in the deep sky is a little annoying', '2004-05-10 21:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(710032, 75176, 7560, '<td valign="top">He''s scruffy and looking a tad overexposed. But I got a soft spot for kitties. :)</td>', 'He''s scruffy and looking a tad overexposed. But I got a soft spot for kitties. :)', '2004-05-10 21:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(710033, 75349, 18505, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and DOF.  Beautiful image appropriately titled.</td>', 'Excellent composition and DOF.  Beautiful image appropriately titled.', '2004-05-10 21:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(710034, 75490, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a really nicely focused shot and that is some expression you''ve captured. I gave it a five though because, honestly, this image creeps me out and I don''t think it''s meant to. The baby''s head looks weirdly huge because of this perspective combined with the naturally disproportionate head infants have. The eyes make me think of those creepy CGI commercials using babies and animals in unatural ways. I''m sure this is a really cute baby. This shot just isn''t flattering him or her.</td>', 'This is a really nicely focused shot and that is some expression you''ve captured. I gave it a five though because, honestly, this image creeps me out and I don''t think it''s meant to. The baby''s head looks weirdly huge because of this perspective combined with the naturally disproportionate head infants have. The eyes make me think of those creepy CGI commercials using babies and animals in unatural ways. I''m sure this is a really cute baby. This shot just isn''t flattering him or her.', '2004-05-10 21:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(710036, 75492, 7560, '<td valign="top">I like the slight grain to this image along with the flair. Sets the mood nicely.</td>', 'I like the slight grain to this image along with the flair. Sets the mood nicely.', '2004-05-10 21:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(710037, 75551, 18191, '<td valign="top">At first glance i thought that this had a zoom burst effect...cool shot and interesting DOF.</td>', 'At first glance i thought that this had a zoom burst effect...cool shot and interesting DOF.', '2004-05-10 21:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(710039, 75204, 16479, '<td valign="top">wow! this is an awesome shot....1 of my favs in this challenge...10 points</td>', 'wow! this is an awesome shot....1 of my favs in this challenge...10 points', '2004-05-10 21:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(710043, 75527, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five because of the nice clean composition. It is bit to contrasty--the lights are really overexposed and high key. One way you can tell when this is the case is by looking at the highlights on the wood. The grain detail is completely washed out in that area. If your camera has a function allowing you to use a lower ISO rating, or a lower contrast, or a darken image---any of those---you would have a better exposure and a much more successful image.</td>', 'I gave this a five because of the nice clean composition. It is bit to contrasty--the lights are really overexposed and high key. One way you can tell when this is the case is by looking at the highlights on the wood. The grain detail is completely washed out in that area. If your camera has a function allowing you to use a lower ISO rating, or a lower contrast, or a darken image---any of those---you would have a better exposure and a much more successful image.', '2004-05-10 21:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(710044, 75597, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great job filling the frame. This makes this image stronger. I also like the complimentary colors.</td>', 'Great job filling the frame. This makes this image stronger. I also like the complimentary colors.', '2004-05-10 21:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(710045, 75573, 19184, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful photograph.  Wish I lived around there.  A little dark for me, I like photos with more color and light in them, but it is still a wonderful photo.</td>', 'Very beautiful photograph.  Wish I lived around there.  A little dark for me, I like photos with more color and light in them, but it is still a wonderful photo.', '2004-05-10 21:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(710047, 75036, 7560, '<td valign="top">Wow! I love the soft feel of the water due to the long exposure. The texture of the beach really plays off the soft water. And then there''s just a hint of moon. Beautiful.</td>', 'Wow! I love the soft feel of the water due to the long exposure. The texture of the beach really plays off the soft water. And then there''s just a hint of moon. Beautiful.', '2004-05-10 21:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(710051, 75327, 18191, '<td valign="top">What a lovely and powerful image! The blue temperature is great and makes me cold! I like the DOF and the spherical shape of the water droplets...amazing...</td>', 'What a lovely and powerful image! The blue temperature is great and makes me cold! I like the DOF and the spherical shape of the water droplets...amazing...', '2004-05-10 21:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(710054, 75540, 7322, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition. Good use of sepia. It''s a bit overexposed. Notice the lack of details in the shadows. It would be nice to see more of that tractor, for instance. The sky is blown way out. I gave it a six.</td>', 'Really nice composition. Good use of sepia. It''s a bit overexposed. Notice the lack of details in the shadows. It would be nice to see more of that tractor, for instance. The sky is blown way out. I gave it a six.', '2004-05-10 21:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(710055, 75400, 7560, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. I think some color might have given it more pop for me.</td>', 'Interesting concept. I think some color might have given it more pop for me.', '2004-05-10 21:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(710059, 75528, 19184, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph, took this at the perfect time, the clouds do very well for the picture....don''t think it would have been as good a photograph on a clear day.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very nice photograph, took this at the perfect time, the clouds do very well for the picture....don''t think it would have been as good a photograph on a clear day.  Nicely done.', '2004-05-10 21:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(710060, 75163, 7322, '<td valign="top">Cool looking bug. Nice color and detail. Nice background blurring. I gave it a six because I didn''t really love it.</td>', 'Cool looking bug. Nice color and detail. Nice background blurring. I gave it a six because I didn''t really love it.', '2004-05-10 21:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(710065, 75603, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great expression. He looks like he has alot of personality.</td>', 'Great expression. He looks like he has alot of personality.', '2004-05-10 21:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
