(710071, 75619, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is bar none my top image of the challenge. The color choice is great, but what makes this shot is the child on tip toe doing something most of us have or would have done. The balance is great,  The little boy also gives a sense of perspective to the shot. Great job, A solid 10.</td>', 'This is bar none my top image of the challenge. The color choice is great, but what makes this shot is the child on tip toe doing something most of us have or would have done. The balance is great,  The little boy also gives a sense of perspective to the shot. Great job, A solid 10.', '2004-05-10 21:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(710072, 74919, 18191, '<td valign="top">Wonderful repitition.</td>', 'Wonderful repitition.', '2004-05-10 21:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(710075, 75460, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a powerful image. It''s certainly an all to common site in Providence, where I live. It''s extremeley high key which is why I gave it only a six. It looks like you got an exposure reading from the wall instead of the guy''s skin so the great colors (like that red wheel and his blue blanket) got a bit washed out looking and we really aren''t seeing enough detail in his face.The yellow blanket on top of the carriage is so overexposed it almost seemlessly blends into the wall behind it.</td>', 'This is a powerful image. It''s certainly an all to common site in Providence, where I live. It''s extremeley high key which is why I gave it only a six. It looks like you got an exposure reading from the wall instead of the guy''s skin so the great colors (like that red wheel and his blue blanket) got a bit washed out looking and we really aren''t seeing enough detail in his face.The yellow blanket on top of the carriage is so overexposed it almost seemlessly blends into the wall behind it.', '2004-05-10 21:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(710076, 75640, 18191, '<td valign="top">Lol...I immediately thought of the out of place challeng when i saw this image...cool shot and nice capture...i especially like the lighting :)</td>', 'Lol...I immediately thought of the out of place challeng when i saw this image...cool shot and nice capture...i especially like the lighting :)', '2004-05-10 21:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
