(710374, 74259, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is exceptional and I certainly hope it does well in the challenge.  The field of blue is technically beautifully done.</td>', 'This is exceptional and I certainly hope it does well in the challenge.  The field of blue is technically beautifully done.', '2004-05-10 23:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(710376, 74979, 14476, '<td valign="top">The little guy could be in slightly better focus, but it''s a charming picture.</td>', 'The little guy could be in slightly better focus, but it''s a charming picture.', '2004-05-10 23:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(710378, 75641, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field on this one!  Good composition as well.</td>', 'Nice depth of field on this one!  Good composition as well.', '2004-05-10 23:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(710382, 75407, 14476, '<td valign="top">Beautiful approach to a difficult subject.  Tripods in Notre Dame?  Probably you hand held.  Hope you tell us in your photographer''s notes.  Interpretation and composition work well.</td>', 'Beautiful approach to a difficult subject.  Tripods in Notre Dame?  Probably you hand held.  Hope you tell us in your photographer''s notes.  Interpretation and composition work well.', '2004-05-10 23:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(710385, 75640, 14476, '<td valign="top">A tad busy, but still a cute image.</td>', 'A tad busy, but still a cute image.', '2004-05-10 23:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(710389, 75501, 14476, '<td valign="top">Since this is his house, I''d hope to see more detail on the house.  The foreground, however, is well done.</td>', 'Since this is his house, I''d hope to see more detail on the house.  The foreground, however, is well done.', '2004-05-10 23:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(710391, 75368, 14476, '<td valign="top">...all in a row.  Charming, and technically excellent.  Good find.</td>', '...all in a row.  Charming, and technically excellent.  Good find.', '2004-05-10 23:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(710393, 75576, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, very good!  Nice find and well photographed!   10</td>', 'Oh, very good!  Nice find and well photographed!   10', '2004-05-10 23:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(710395, 75517, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great abstract!</td>', 'Great abstract!', '2004-05-10 23:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(710396, 75575, 14476, '<td valign="top">Quite a bit of information in this image.  If it was mine, I''d probably eliminate about 2/3rds and then make everything  extremely sharp.  But it is yours and it looks as if you assembled some nice memories here.</td>', 'Quite a bit of information in this image.  If it was mine, I''d probably eliminate about 2/3rds and then make everything  extremely sharp.  But it is yours and it looks as if you assembled some nice memories here.', '2004-05-10 23:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(710398, 75536, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good find.  He sure does look like a clump of dirt!</td>', 'Good find.  He sure does look like a clump of dirt!', '2004-05-10 23:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(710401, 75189, 14476, '<td valign="top">Yum, yum!  Nicely composed and photographed.  Good luck with this one.</td>', 'Yum, yum!  Nicely composed and photographed.  Good luck with this one.', '2004-05-10 23:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(710403, 75417, 14476, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, Excellent!  No nits to pick with this photograph.  Hope you do well with it.</td>', 'Ohhh, Excellent!  No nits to pick with this photograph.  Hope you do well with it.', '2004-05-10 23:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(710407, 75508, 19184, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, color is nice...but the orange clothes hanger or whatever that is on the top right is kind of distracting.  Other than that I like the photo.</td>', 'Nice shot, color is nice...but the orange clothes hanger or whatever that is on the top right is kind of distracting.  Other than that I like the photo.', '2004-05-10 23:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(710408, 75418, 20115, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, but it is too dark.</td>', 'Love the shot, but it is too dark.', '2004-05-10 23:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(710411, 74703, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, what an appealing image. Wish he had both ears in the shot!  Despite that it''s a charmer.  Like your point of view.</td>', 'Oh, what an appealing image. Wish he had both ears in the shot!  Despite that it''s a charmer.  Like your point of view.', '2004-05-10 23:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(710412, 75543, 14476, '<td valign="top">Not quite sharp on my screen, but glorious composition.  Good seeing.</td>', 'Not quite sharp on my screen, but glorious composition.  Good seeing.', '2004-05-10 23:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(710413, 75532, 19184, '<td valign="top">I like the photograph, looks very good in black and white...just wish the front of the train wasnt cropped off...would have been much better imo unless of course there was something really distracting there.</td>', 'I like the photograph, looks very good in black and white...just wish the front of the train wasnt cropped off...would have been much better imo unless of course there was something really distracting there.', '2004-05-10 23:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(710416, 75494, 14476, '<td valign="top">Yep, that''s where you get the best pictures!  Nice one.</td>', 'Yep, that''s where you get the best pictures!  Nice one.', '2004-05-10 23:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(710418, 75640, 20115, '<td valign="top">Background is way to distracting.  Now if you took a picture of them at the beach in the surf that would have been very interesting.</td>', 'Background is way to distracting.  Now if you took a picture of them at the beach in the surf that would have been very interesting.', '2004-05-10 23:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(710422, 75115, 20115, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2004-05-10 23:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(710423, 75417, 19184, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is a great macro...very detailed.  Good job.  Those things seem to fly away on me everytime I try.</td>', 'Wow, that is a great macro...very detailed.  Good job.  Those things seem to fly away on me everytime I try.', '2004-05-10 23:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(710424, 74765, 20115, '<td valign="top">Where you out climbing trees.  Nice.</td>', 'Where you out climbing trees.  Nice.', '2004-05-10 23:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(710425, 75288, 20115, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset--great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset--great shot.', '2004-05-10 23:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(710426, 75533, 20115, '<td valign="top">Crazy shot.  I''m never fast enough to catch something like this.</td>', 'Crazy shot.  I''m never fast enough to catch something like this.', '2004-05-10 23:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(710427, 75494, 18403, '<td valign="top">Pretty good for an aircraft shot!</td>', 'Pretty good for an aircraft shot!', '2004-05-10 23:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(710428, 75553, 20115, '<td valign="top">Very nice siloutte.</td>', 'Very nice siloutte.', '2004-05-10 23:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(710429, 74645, 14476, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and execution.  Looks otherworldly from this angle and that gives it the wow factor we look for.  Good one.  10</td>', 'Excellent composition and execution.  Looks otherworldly from this angle and that gives it the wow factor we look for.  Good one.  10', '2004-05-10 23:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(710432, 75490, 18403, '<td valign="top">Best baby picture I''ve seen yet!</td>', 'Best baby picture I''ve seen yet!', '2004-05-10 23:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(710433, 75555, 14476, '<td valign="top">There are so many good images in this Challenge.  This is just lovely with the bright foreground framing the castle.  Just lovely.  9</td>', 'There are so many good images in this Challenge.  This is just lovely with the bright foreground framing the castle.  Just lovely.  9', '2004-05-10 23:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(710434, 75494, 20115, '<td valign="top">Wow--I want to go there too.</td>', 'Wow--I want to go there too.', '2004-05-10 23:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(710435, 75398, 20115, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh--great patience and then a great shot.</td>', 'Made me laugh--great patience and then a great shot.', '2004-05-10 23:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(710437, 75193, 20115, '<td valign="top">bugs are beautiful--good shot</td>', 'bugs are beautiful--good shot', '2004-05-10 23:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(710438, 75089, 14476, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you used everyday objects to creat an interesting and amusing composition.  Good technicals too.   I *might* have cropped a bit more from the bottom,  but of course it''s good the way it is.  9</td>', 'I really like the way you used everyday objects to creat an interesting and amusing composition.  Good technicals too.   I *might* have cropped a bit more from the bottom,  but of course it''s good the way it is.  9', '2004-05-10 23:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(710439, 75098, 19184, '<td valign="top">The boats seem a bit out of focus to me.  Great shot other than that.  The subject is good and I love the reflection on the calm water.</td>', 'The boats seem a bit out of focus to me.  Great shot other than that.  The subject is good and I love the reflection on the calm water.', '2004-05-10 23:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(710440, 75515, 20115, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2004-05-10 23:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(710441, 75204, 14476, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of the moment.  I expect we''ll see this again on the front page soon.</td>', 'Excellent capture of the moment.  I expect we''ll see this again on the front page soon.', '2004-05-10 23:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(710443, 74635, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good capture of these birds.  HOpe you tell us more in your photographer''s notes.  Meanwhile, technicals are fine and composition is delightful.</td>', 'Good capture of these birds.  HOpe you tell us more in your photographer''s notes.  Meanwhile, technicals are fine and composition is delightful.', '2004-05-10 23:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(710446, 74259, 20115, '<td valign="top">Looks like a magical land.</td>', 'Looks like a magical land.', '2004-05-11 00:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(710448, 75568, 19184, '<td valign="top">Good color and detail.  Don''t know how you got him though, everytime I try to get some of these guys in the pond out back at work they jump away..guess you gotta be really sneaky.</td>', 'Good color and detail.  Don''t know how you got him though, everytime I try to get some of these guys in the pond out back at work they jump away..guess you gotta be really sneaky.', '2004-05-11 00:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(710457, 75349, 20115, '<td valign="top">I agree.</td>', 'I agree.', '2004-05-11 00:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(710470, 75555, 20115, '<td valign="top">Beautiful--I''m going there--looking it up right now.</td>', 'Beautiful--I''m going there--looking it up right now.', '2004-05-11 00:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(710488, 75555, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Great composition too.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Great composition too.', '2004-05-11 00:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(710492, 75599, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the way you composed this here; the leaves seem to be "projecting" out of the image (I mean it seems almost to be in motion!)  I wish that the background were somehow darker though to provide more contrast with the green.  Perhaps if shot in lower light.</td>', 'I like the way you composed this here; the leaves seem to be "projecting" out of the image (I mean it seems almost to be in motion!)  I wish that the background were somehow darker though to provide more contrast with the green.  Perhaps if shot in lower light.', '2004-05-11 00:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(710493, 75498, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well I''m sure this meets the challenge (gee two toilet shots in the same challenge), but it''s not very creative or aesthetically pleasing.  It is at least sharp and exposed well.  But not much there for perspective and composition.  The other toilet shot is better in that regard (I think)</td>', 'Well I''m sure this meets the challenge (gee two toilet shots in the same challenge), but it''s not very creative or aesthetically pleasing.  It is at least sharp and exposed well.  But not much there for perspective and composition.  The other toilet shot is better in that regard (I think)', '2004-05-11 00:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(710502, 75480, 12253, '<td valign="top">For some reason it doesn''t look like it was shot at a gym--take that as a compliment if it was.  It has an interesting symmetry, but somehow I just don''t see it as flattering to the sport or the girl, or to the tone of her body.  Maybe it''s just too straight up and down.  Don''t get me wrong, it''s alright--just not a strong composition IMHO (pun intended!).</td>', 'For some reason it doesn''t look like it was shot at a gym--take that as a compliment if it was.  It has an interesting symmetry, but somehow I just don''t see it as flattering to the sport or the girl, or to the tone of her body.  Maybe it''s just too straight up and down.  Don''t get me wrong, it''s alright--just not a strong composition IMHO (pun intended!).', '2004-05-11 00:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(710504, 75185, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast you''ve achieved here--both in the tones, and in the contrast of the sharp burrs and the OOF background.</td>', 'I like the contrast you''ve achieved here--both in the tones, and in the contrast of the sharp burrs and the OOF background.', '2004-05-11 00:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(710505, 74646, 19184, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph....think it would have looked better on a clear day, but cant help that, clouds seem to have a mind of their own :)  No place like that around here :( well not that I know of anyway.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph....think it would have looked better on a clear day, but cant help that, clouds seem to have a mind of their own :)  No place like that around here :( well not that I know of anyway.', '2004-05-11 00:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(710508, 75602, 16790, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting, tones, and sharpness on this.   Nice job.</td>', 'Love the lighting, tones, and sharpness on this.   Nice job.', '2004-05-11 00:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(710511, 75490, 16790, '<td valign="top">If this doesn''t win a ribbon, something''s wrong!  What a perfect picture...</td>', 'If this doesn''t win a ribbon, something''s wrong!  What a perfect picture...', '2004-05-11 00:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(710512, 74646, 12253, '<td valign="top">This has all the elements of a great photo, and good composition.  I''ve scored it well, but am teetering: there still seems to be something missing.  Perhaps it just misses the beginning or end--there''s neither a starting point or an end to the bridge.  And if the bridge isn''t the focal point, what is?</td>', 'This has all the elements of a great photo, and good composition.  I''ve scored it well, but am teetering: there still seems to be something missing.  Perhaps it just misses the beginning or end--there''s neither a starting point or an end to the bridge.  And if the bridge isn''t the focal point, what is?', '2004-05-11 00:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(710513, 75494, 16790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, I love this in black and white.  The mountains are so sharp and crisp, and the clouds look fantastic.  I like the way the photo is divided diagonally between sky and earth (or so it appears because of the clouds).</td>', 'Beautiful, I love this in black and white.  The mountains are so sharp and crisp, and the clouds look fantastic.  I like the way the photo is divided diagonally between sky and earth (or so it appears because of the clouds).', '2004-05-11 00:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(710515, 75490, 20115, '<td valign="top">Now here is something new!</td>', 'Now here is something new!', '2004-05-11 00:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(710516, 75541, 16790, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites... how beautiful.  The smooth immensity of the water and the small people in the lower righthand corner... perfect.  Great job!</td>', 'One of my favourites... how beautiful.  The smooth immensity of the water and the small people in the lower righthand corner... perfect.  Great job!', '2004-05-11 00:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(710517, 75288, 16790, '<td valign="top">Half Moon Bay is a beautiful place, and this is a lovely capture.  The colours are beautiful, and the sun is relatively muted without sacrificing detail on the water.</td>', 'Half Moon Bay is a beautiful place, and this is a lovely capture.  The colours are beautiful, and the sun is relatively muted without sacrificing detail on the water.', '2004-05-11 00:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(710520, 75204, 16790, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Amazing how clear this is.  I like the white/cloudy background for this, I think it adds to the drama of the shot.</td>', 'Wow!  Amazing how clear this is.  I like the white/cloudy background for this, I think it adds to the drama of the shot.', '2004-05-11 00:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(710522, 75163, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good capture of the insect, enhanced by the colorful background OOF.  Nice work.</td>', 'Very good capture of the insect, enhanced by the colorful background OOF.  Nice work.', '2004-05-11 00:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(710524, 75210, 5792, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally well done capture of an ant. Good use of DOF and the ROT. Nice job.</td>', 'Exceptionally well done capture of an ant. Good use of DOF and the ROT. Nice job.', '2004-05-11 00:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(710525, 75515, 16790, '<td valign="top">Lovely photograph of a beautiful little girl!  Focus is perfect, and you caught this at just the right time to see her hair flying out and such a great smile on her face!</td>', 'Lovely photograph of a beautiful little girl!  Focus is perfect, and you caught this at just the right time to see her hair flying out and such a great smile on her face!', '2004-05-11 00:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(710529, 75496, 16790, '<td valign="top">The colour on this seems very cool/blue-ish... a little warming would do a lot for this photo, I think.  It might also look a bit better if it the three main flowers were more centered (or more off center).</td>', 'The colour on this seems very cool/blue-ish... a little warming would do a lot for this photo, I think.  It might also look a bit better if it the three main flowers were more centered (or more off center).', '2004-05-11 00:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(710530, 75616, 16790, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but it''s very difficult to really see anything in this photograph.  Too bad this one wasn''t in Abstract, it probably would have done very well :)</td>', 'Interesting idea, but it''s very difficult to really see anything in this photograph.  Too bad this one wasn''t in Abstract, it probably would have done very well :)', '2004-05-11 00:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(710531, 75382, 16790, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, with a good show of texture and a nice focus, but it''s not very interesting in itself.</td>', 'Interesting idea, with a good show of texture and a nice focus, but it''s not very interesting in itself.', '2004-05-11 00:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(710533, 75625, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is a unique subject to choose... the colours are good, but the black background in this case I think takes away from the composition; it''s impossible to tell that it''s a lamp, and there''s nothing very interesting about it with no.. context.  The reflection is also very distracting.</td>', 'This is a unique subject to choose... the colours are good, but the black background in this case I think takes away from the composition; it''s impossible to tell that it''s a lamp, and there''s nothing very interesting about it with no.. context.  The reflection is also very distracting.', '2004-05-11 00:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(710535, 75500, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice motiion blur.  I think it would have been better to have  more of the train though, and perhaps to adjust a bit for the up perspective.</td>', 'Nice motiion blur.  I think it would have been better to have  more of the train though, and perhaps to adjust a bit for the up perspective.', '2004-05-11 00:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(710537, 75543, 16790, '<td valign="top">The softness of this, which I''m assuming is intentional, detracts from what is otherwise a pretty and interesting scene, in my opinion.  I like the balance in this picture, but crisper edges against the sky would really have improved the overall appeal of the shot.</td>', 'The softness of this, which I''m assuming is intentional, detracts from what is otherwise a pretty and interesting scene, in my opinion.  I like the balance in this picture, but crisper edges against the sky would really have improved the overall appeal of the shot.', '2004-05-11 00:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(710540, 74866, 16790, '<td valign="top">Awww!  What a beautiful photograph.  I have a cockatiel and he never sits still long enough to take a decent photograph of him!  The colours and focus on this are absolutely stunning, and the composition itself is fantastic.  Nice job!</td>', 'Awww!  What a beautiful photograph.  I have a cockatiel and he never sits still long enough to take a decent photograph of him!  The colours and focus on this are absolutely stunning, and the composition itself is fantastic.  Nice job!', '2004-05-11 00:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(710542, 75588, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is a very intriguing view.. so sharp and clear, and I love the subtle sepia toning of the photograph.  Beautiful work.</td>', 'This is a very intriguing view.. so sharp and clear, and I love the subtle sepia toning of the photograph.  Beautiful work.', '2004-05-11 00:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(710597, 75492, 8229, '<td valign="top">this is breathtaking!</td>', 'this is breathtaking!', '2004-05-11 02:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(710598, 75490, 8229, '<td valign="top">bright eyes!</td>', 'bright eyes!', '2004-05-11 02:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(710599, 75541, 8229, '<td valign="top">simply awesome!!</td>', 'simply awesome!!', '2004-05-11 02:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(710600, 75045, 8229, '<td valign="top">such detail!</td>', 'such detail!', '2004-05-11 02:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(710602, 75494, 8229, '<td valign="top">an ansel adams look-a-like for sure!</td>', 'an ansel adams look-a-like for sure!', '2004-05-11 02:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(710603, 75635, 8229, '<td valign="top">not man made ... for sure! awesome !</td>', 'not man made ... for sure! awesome !', '2004-05-11 02:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(710605, 75515, 8229, '<td valign="top">such an awesome shot! i simply love the depth of field here and of course, her hair!</td>', 'such an awesome shot! i simply love the depth of field here and of course, her hair!', '2004-05-11 02:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(710615, 75526, 14499, '<td valign="top">Cute and Fun, nice shot...looks setup was it?</td>', 'Cute and Fun, nice shot...looks setup was it?', '2004-05-11 02:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(710652, 75508, 4625, '<td valign="top">I really like the tone of the orange, looks great.</td>', 'I really like the tone of the orange, looks great.', '2004-05-11 04:34:17.000000', NULL, 1);
