(710653, 75526, 4625, '<td valign="top">Nice Crisp photograph, but the water doesn''t resemble rain enough, if it did this would look better.</td>', 'Nice Crisp photograph, but the water doesn''t resemble rain enough, if it did this would look better.', '2004-05-11 04:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
