(710727, 75643, 17233, '<td valign="top">Nice  shot - could also try zooming in a little closer to the breaking water and lengthening your shutter speed to smooth out and accentuate the movement in the water. A polarising filter would have added some colour to the sky.</td>', 'Nice  shot - could also try zooming in a little closer to the breaking water and lengthening your shutter speed to smooth out and accentuate the movement in the water. A polarising filter would have added some colour to the sky.', '2004-05-11 05:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(710728, 75277, 17233, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - try increasing the contrast (maybe play with curves) a little. Just seems a little washed out. May need to check the calibration on your monitor.</td>', 'Beautiful shot - try increasing the contrast (maybe play with curves) a little. Just seems a little washed out. May need to check the calibration on your monitor.', '2004-05-11 05:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(710736, 75542, 12802, '<td valign="top">My girlfriends'' told me I have to give this one a high score, she thinks it''s cute!<br/>I agree though, very nice shot, great DOF, good seeing the other dog in the background, it''s as if it''s wanting to look too but the other one is getting in the way.</td>', 'My girlfriends'' told me I have to give this one a high score, she thinks it''s cute!I agree though, very nice shot, great DOF, good seeing the other dog in the background, it''s as if it''s wanting to look too but the other one is getting in the way.', '2004-05-11 06:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(710738, 74259, 10170, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  Hapy memories for me growing up, a very different climate than here in Australia.  I still miss bluebells.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  Hapy memories for me growing up, a very different climate than here in Australia.  I still miss bluebells.', '2004-05-11 06:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(710766, 75328, 21132, '<td valign="top">Such a PERFECT sense of peace!</td>', 'Such a PERFECT sense of peace!', '2004-05-11 08:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(710770, 75515, 21132, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!!!</td>', 'Wonderful!!!', '2004-05-11 08:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(710790, 75517, 16636, '<td valign="top">would have been a good entry for abstract, like the pic a lot</td>', 'would have been a good entry for abstract, like the pic a lot', '2004-05-11 08:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(710818, 75289, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like this, like the simplicity of it, and the progression of light across the wall''s bricks. On thing I would change would be to sorrect the perspective distortion, or to shoot head-on in the first place - that slight coming together of the lines of bricks across the frame produces an odd feeling of unevenness across the image, and it isn''t what i sense this shot is about.</td>', 'Like this, like the simplicity of it, and the progression of light across the wall''s bricks. On thing I would change would be to sorrect the perspective distortion, or to shoot head-on in the first place - that slight coming together of the lines of bricks across the frame produces an odd feeling of unevenness across the image, and it isn''t what i sense this shot is about.', '2004-05-11 08:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(710826, 74271, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is, not that it matters, but those ''extra'' lines, the less geometric ones, kind of upset the fluidity of the image for me - it''s otherwise so perfectly abstract, and I''m not convinced that they add much. Not that you could just have popped up and removed them of course, but nevertheless ...</td>', 'Not sure what this is, not that it matters, but those ''extra'' lines, the less geometric ones, kind of upset the fluidity of the image for me - it''s otherwise so perfectly abstract, and I''m not convinced that they add much. Not that you could just have popped up and removed them of course, but nevertheless ...', '2004-05-11 08:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(710836, 74665, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene, although I think I would have at least cropped out the corners - you''d lose the light drop-off (which can be useful, but is so very localised in this shot as to be unhelpful), and the twigs in the bottom right corner.</td>', 'Wonderful scene, although I think I would have at least cropped out the corners - you''d lose the light drop-off (which can be useful, but is so very localised in this shot as to be unhelpful), and the twigs in the bottom right corner.', '2004-05-11 09:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(710846, 75506, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your lighting makes this shot.  Well seen, composed and shot.</td>', 'Your lighting makes this shot.  Well seen, composed and shot.', '2004-05-11 09:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(710847, 75526, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very well done indeed.  There''s nothing I would suggest you do differently!</td>', 'Very well done indeed.  There''s nothing I would suggest you do differently!', '2004-05-11 09:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(710849, 75539, 19608, '<td valign="top">A painting with your camera.  Superb!  Way high in the challenge.</td>', 'A painting with your camera.  Superb!  Way high in the challenge.', '2004-05-11 09:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(710850, 75360, 19608, '<td valign="top">Stunning image.  The flat lihting was really your friend on this day.</td>', 'Stunning image.  The flat lihting was really your friend on this day.', '2004-05-11 09:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(710851, 75523, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent catch!  Should finish high.</td>', 'Excellent catch!  Should finish high.', '2004-05-11 09:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(710855, 75542, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful feeling!  Perfect exposure and great catchlight in the closer dog''s eyes.  The only problem I see with it is that the rear dog should be kess sharp - or not there at all.  The merger of the closer dog''s head with the same colors in the rear dog detract just a bit,  Having said that - it''s still VERY high in this challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful feeling!  Perfect exposure and great catchlight in the closer dog''s eyes.  The only problem I see with it is that the rear dog should be kess sharp - or not there at all.  The merger of the closer dog''s head with the same colors in the rear dog detract just a bit,  Having said that - it''s still VERY high in this challenge.', '2004-05-11 09:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(710857, 75533, 19608, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing!  Great composition, exposure nailed.  The wisp of smoke from the exhaust falling above the shadowed area adds a special touch.  Should finish very high.</td>', 'Perfect timing!  Great composition, exposure nailed.  The wisp of smoke from the exhaust falling above the shadowed area adds a special touch.  Should finish very high.', '2004-05-11 09:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(710860, 75094, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your choice of time of day took an "average" subject and propelled it into a work of art.  The late sky along with the glowing orangy building really sing.  And the green statue on the top is icing on the cake.  How can you improve it?  The only thing that comes to mind is a person in colorful garb sitting on the platform to the left of the door, but that''s not that important.  What is important is that your image should finish way up there.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Your choice of time of day took an "average" subject and propelled it into a work of art.  The late sky along with the glowing orangy building really sing.  And the green statue on the top is icing on the cake.  How can you improve it?  The only thing that comes to mind is a person in colorful garb sitting on the platform to the left of the door, but that''s not that important.  What is important is that your image should finish way up there.  Congratulations.', '2004-05-11 09:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(710863, 74866, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great composition coupled with super lighting make this image a true winner.  The textures in the bark and feathers are great as well - with the small patches of moss/lichen adding some additional impact.  Finally the model has a nice look of "curiousity."  Well done indeed.</td>', 'Great composition coupled with super lighting make this image a true winner.  The textures in the bark and feathers are great as well - with the small patches of moss/lichen adding some additional impact.  Finally the model has a nice look of "curiousity."  Well done indeed.', '2004-05-11 09:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(710867, 75616, 19608, '<td valign="top">The colors of this image are superb - nice pastels.  But, there''s not much else there for me.  Feels like the song, "It that all there is, my friend?"</td>', 'The colors of this image are superb - nice pastels.  But, there''s not much else there for me.  Feels like the song, "It that all there is, my friend?"', '2004-05-11 09:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(710868, 75498, 19608, '<td valign="top">I doubt if anyone questions whether this is something new you''ve never shot before.</td>', 'I doubt if anyone questions whether this is something new you''ve never shot before.', '2004-05-11 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(710873, 75637, 19608, '<td valign="top">The mysteriousness of the image - due to the underexposure - makes you study it.   Unfortunately, there not much going on in the bottom half of the frame.</td>', 'The mysteriousness of the image - due to the underexposure - makes you study it.   Unfortunately, there not much going on in the bottom half of the frame.', '2004-05-11 09:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(710874, 75642, 19608, '<td valign="top">Straight forward - nice placement of the apple.</td>', 'Straight forward - nice placement of the apple.', '2004-05-11 09:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(710876, 75174, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional capture of the motion.  The horse''s feet and the wheel PERFECT!  Exposure appears right on.  It would be a bit more dynamic if there was less space behind the rider''s back - and more space in from of the horse.  The horizontal dashes right at the jocky''s eye level detract just a bit.  But having said all that - it''s a great image that should finish high.</td>', 'Exceptional capture of the motion.  The horse''s feet and the wheel PERFECT!  Exposure appears right on.  It would be a bit more dynamic if there was less space behind the rider''s back - and more space in from of the horse.  The horizontal dashes right at the jocky''s eye level detract just a bit.  But having said all that - it''s a great image that should finish high.', '2004-05-11 09:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(710877, 75189, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, exposed.  The high-key effect makes the little green monster almost attractive.</td>', 'Nicely composed, exposed.  The high-key effect makes the little green monster almost attractive.', '2004-05-11 09:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(710878, 75396, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective makes this image interesting to study.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice perspective makes this image interesting to study.  Well done.', '2004-05-11 10:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(710880, 74627, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great crisp whites, strong blacks - and with a great tonal range in between.  What else can you expect from a black and white image?  This studio shot shows great creativity and imagination.  Expect to finish high!</td>', 'Great crisp whites, strong blacks - and with a great tonal range in between.  What else can you expect from a black and white image?  This studio shot shows great creativity and imagination.  Expect to finish high!', '2004-05-11 10:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(710883, 75490, 19608, '<td valign="top">What eyes!  The dialated pupils make this image really unique.  Exposure perfect.  Deoth of field perfect.  Not too sure it needs the border - but that''s a very minor point!  Overall - a real "wow"!</td>', 'What eyes!  The dialated pupils make this image really unique.  Exposure perfect.  Deoth of field perfect.  Not too sure it needs the border - but that''s a very minor point!  Overall - a real "wow"!', '2004-05-11 10:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(710885, 74919, 19608, '<td valign="top">Sepia was the right choice for this image.  Nice repeating shapes and shadows.  Composition well thought out.</td>', 'Sepia was the right choice for this image.  Nice repeating shapes and shadows.  Composition well thought out.', '2004-05-11 10:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(710910, 75460, 15129, '<td valign="top">Have you also tried this in black and white? I think it would be even more effective.</td>', 'Have you also tried this in black and white? I think it would be even more effective.', '2004-05-11 10:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(710915, 74866, 15129, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and composition. Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful detail and composition. Good luck!', '2004-05-11 10:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(710924, 75498, 15129, '<td valign="top">Next time, try flushing it (with clean water in it) as you take the picture--some neat effects on the water . . . Unfortunately, here a toilet is just a toilet.</td>', 'Next time, try flushing it (with clean water in it) as you take the picture--some neat effects on the water . . . Unfortunately, here a toilet is just a toilet.', '2004-05-11 10:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
