(711011, 75490, 9821, '<td valign="top">LOL! Looks like he''s taking the picture himself.</td>', 'LOL! Looks like he''s taking the picture himself.', '2004-05-11 10:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(711028, 74798, 20395, '<td valign="top">I love the color and the sky, but the top half of the photo is a little too busy for me. I might have cropped in below the light fixture.</td>', 'I love the color and the sky, but the top half of the photo is a little too busy for me. I might have cropped in below the light fixture.', '2004-05-11 10:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(711032, 75573, 20395, '<td valign="top">The stumps on the right are a bit too dark, so it''s hard to make out exactly what they are. Otherwise a very nice shot!</td>', 'The stumps on the right are a bit too dark, so it''s hard to make out exactly what they are. Otherwise a very nice shot!', '2004-05-11 11:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(711034, 75586, 20395, '<td valign="top">Love the stop motion, contrast and texture. Excellent.</td>', 'Love the stop motion, contrast and texture. Excellent.', '2004-05-11 11:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(711037, 75042, 20395, '<td valign="top">A nice crisp image, but it just doesn''t work for me. Maybe off centering the subject would have added interest.</td>', 'A nice crisp image, but it just doesn''t work for me. Maybe off centering the subject would have added interest.', '2004-05-11 11:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(711041, 75193, 20395, '<td valign="top">It''s a little too grainy and out of focus. Very nice color though!</td>', 'It''s a little too grainy and out of focus. Very nice color though!', '2004-05-11 11:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(711043, 75588, 20395, '<td valign="top">Could be construed as over-exposed, but I like it. Nice composition.</td>', 'Could be construed as over-exposed, but I like it. Nice composition.', '2004-05-11 11:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(711046, 74290, 20395, '<td valign="top">The top-down shooting makes the image very flat. Perhaps another angle would have given it more depth and cut down on your reflection.</td>', 'The top-down shooting makes the image very flat. Perhaps another angle would have given it more depth and cut down on your reflection.', '2004-05-11 11:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(711050, 75302, 20395, '<td valign="top">Nice expression on the guy''s face and good sense of action. It is perhaps a little grainy and over-sharp.</td>', 'Nice expression on the guy''s face and good sense of action. It is perhaps a little grainy and over-sharp.', '2004-05-11 11:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(711055, 75513, 20395, '<td valign="top">It looks as if that center column/focal point is out of focus. An interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'It looks as if that center column/focal point is out of focus. An interesting take on the challenge.', '2004-05-11 11:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(711061, 75350, 20395, '<td valign="top">It''s a very grainy shot, and it needs a center of interest- right now I''m not sure what you want me to look at. Try increasing the size of the photo you submit- that will help cut down on pixelation.</td>', 'It''s a very grainy shot, and it needs a center of interest- right now I''m not sure what you want me to look at. Try increasing the size of the photo you submit- that will help cut down on pixelation.', '2004-05-11 11:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(711064, 75531, 20395, '<td valign="top">The lighting is kind of flat, but definetely a new subject matter!</td>', 'The lighting is kind of flat, but definetely a new subject matter!', '2004-05-11 11:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(711070, 75537, 20395, '<td valign="top">There are a few strange specs in the sky that I might have cleaned up, but I like the color and the off-center subject a lot. The scene is a bit... static for me though. 7</td>', 'There are a few strange specs in the sky that I might have cleaned up, but I like the color and the off-center subject a lot. The scene is a bit... static for me though. 7', '2004-05-11 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(711072, 75315, 20395, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see one of their faces! Moreover, it''s not quite in focus and a bit over-exposed. Keep trying!</td>', 'I wish I could see one of their faces! Moreover, it''s not quite in focus and a bit over-exposed. Keep trying!', '2004-05-11 11:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(711075, 75625, 20395, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tighter crop? It would eliminate the red patch at the bottom. Right now, it just doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'Maybe a tighter crop? It would eliminate the red patch at the bottom. Right now, it just doesn''t do much for me.', '2004-05-11 11:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(711077, 75174, 20395, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.</td>', 'Excellent capture.', '2004-05-11 11:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(711079, 74627, 20395, '<td valign="top">Runes? Ruins? The image is a little too grainy, and the light in the bag is too hot. I like the idea though- certainly the first time I''ve seen a photo of runes!<br/></td>', 'Runes? Ruins? The image is a little too grainy, and the light in the bag is too hot. I like the idea though- certainly the first time I''ve seen a photo of runes!', '2004-05-11 11:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(711080, 75036, 6008, '<td valign="top">At first look there was a distinct ''wow'' but then I also love eclipses. I like the tone of blue and the diagonal shoreline. But the more I look at it the less I''m liking the detail-less water. I''m assuming it was neatimaged to make it look smooth, but I think it''s a little overdone and has taken away most of the characteristics that an ocean has.</td>', 'At first look there was a distinct ''wow'' but then I also love eclipses. I like the tone of blue and the diagonal shoreline. But the more I look at it the less I''m liking the detail-less water. I''m assuming it was neatimaged to make it look smooth, but I think it''s a little overdone and has taken away most of the characteristics that an ocean has.', '2004-05-11 11:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(711090, 75630, 20395, '<td valign="top">I might have cropped in tighter, as the brown bottom left corner detracts from the image for me. I like contrast of the bright pink and green- so I''d rather have the image focus on that. The image also seems rather grainy.</td>', 'I might have cropped in tighter, as the brown bottom left corner detracts from the image for me. I like contrast of the bright pink and green- so I''d rather have the image focus on that. The image also seems rather grainy.', '2004-05-11 11:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(711092, 75360, 20395, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color, nice composition.</td>', 'Beautiful color, nice composition.', '2004-05-11 11:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(711093, 75535, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is more a particular style that appeals to some and not to others. I wouldnt know where to begin to try and critique it as it is not really a style I am familiar with or particularly care for. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This is more a particular style that appeals to some and not to others. I wouldnt know where to begin to try and critique it as it is not really a style I am familiar with or particularly care for. Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-05-11 11:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(711097, 75436, 20395, '<td valign="top">Without the selective desaturation, the idea of the image would be lost. The feet seem almost super saturated. I can''t decide if I like it our not... 7</td>', 'Without the selective desaturation, the idea of the image would be lost. The feet seem almost super saturated. I can''t decide if I like it our not... 7', '2004-05-11 11:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(711100, 75306, 20395, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity and the texture! I might have cropped in just a little tighter to show it off.</td>', 'I love the clarity and the texture! I might have cropped in just a little tighter to show it off.', '2004-05-11 11:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(711103, 75543, 20395, '<td valign="top">A little too hazy and the sky is very noisy. That''s a very vibrant blue!</td>', 'A little too hazy and the sky is very noisy. That''s a very vibrant blue!', '2004-05-11 11:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(711108, 75634, 6008, '<td valign="top">The first thing I notice is that the boy sticks out from the background as his toning/contrast is quite different from the rest of the image. It almost looks like he was pasted into the shot. The composition is good, and the detail on the branches are good with the mix of light and shadow. The boy looks too light and could probably do with some more contrast so to blend in a little more.</td>', 'The first thing I notice is that the boy sticks out from the background as his toning/contrast is quite different from the rest of the image. It almost looks like he was pasted into the shot. The composition is good, and the detail on the branches are good with the mix of light and shadow. The boy looks too light and could probably do with some more contrast so to blend in a little more.', '2004-05-11 11:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(711112, 74635, 20395, '<td valign="top">Creepy eyes! I would have gotten rid of the door behind the right bird''s head for a more unified picture, and given the bird on the left a little more beak room. You did a good job capturing the texture of the bird''s feathers.</td>', 'Creepy eyes! I would have gotten rid of the door behind the right bird''s head for a more unified picture, and given the bird on the left a little more beak room. You did a good job capturing the texture of the bird''s feathers.', '2004-05-11 11:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(711115, 75246, 20395, '<td valign="top">I would have pulled out the copper garden ornaments and cropped in closer for a more unified image. Perhaps a little more DOF to include those front pink tulips. The color is very nice though!</td>', 'I would have pulled out the copper garden ornaments and cropped in closer for a more unified image. Perhaps a little more DOF to include those front pink tulips. The color is very nice though!', '2004-05-11 11:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(711117, 75089, 6008, '<td valign="top">The use of DOF to give the image depth with the two pairs of clothespins. is excellent. The detail on the foreground pegs are great and the light on them is good too. I''m not sure about the composition as the image doesnt really grab me, but not sure if another composition would improve it any better than this either.</td>', 'The use of DOF to give the image depth with the two pairs of clothespins. is excellent. The detail on the foreground pegs are great and the light on them is good too. I''m not sure about the composition as the image doesnt really grab me, but not sure if another composition would improve it any better than this either.', '2004-05-11 11:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(711120, 75533, 20395, '<td valign="top">10- Excellent. The best part of this photo is the buildings behind. They add a great solid, heavy, serious contrast to the fun action in front. Super impressed.</td>', '10- Excellent. The best part of this photo is the buildings behind. They add a great solid, heavy, serious contrast to the fun action in front. Super impressed.', '2004-05-11 11:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(711124, 75597, 13136, '<td valign="top">Looks like a plant riot. Wild picture.</td>', 'Looks like a plant riot. Wild picture.', '2004-05-11 11:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(711126, 75267, 20395, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice lion capture, but the noise and pixelation of the image is very distracting.</td>', 'It''s a nice lion capture, but the noise and pixelation of the image is very distracting.', '2004-05-11 11:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(711128, 75036, 20395, '<td valign="top">Sureal and beautiful. Very nice.</td>', 'Sureal and beautiful. Very nice.', '2004-05-11 11:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(711133, 75480, 20395, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting. The sidelight really adds definition to her muscles. The earrings look a little out of place, but that''s a minor criticism.</td>', 'Excellent lighting. The sidelight really adds definition to her muscles. The earrings look a little out of place, but that''s a minor criticism.', '2004-05-11 11:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(711135, 75360, 13136, '<td valign="top">This is a strange looking picture. The foam on the water almost seems to be glowing and the grass is so green, like when I look through my polarized sunglasses.This shot is almost overpowering in it''s intensity. Very eye catching. Might be from a bit too much stauration.</td>', 'This is a strange looking picture. The foam on the water almost seems to be glowing and the grass is so green, like when I look through my polarized sunglasses.This shot is almost overpowering in it''s intensity. Very eye catching. Might be from a bit too much stauration.', '2004-05-11 11:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(711136, 75267, 6008, '<td valign="top">Something strikes me as odd about her head but it could be because her ears are down. I wonder if this is a crop of a larger image as there seems to be some low quality to the shot. The composition is good, as is the background. The lioness seems to be a little soft and also some slight noise in her coat, which is why I thought it may be cropped and size increased. It certainly has all the elements of a good shot, just a little lacking in quality.</td>', 'Something strikes me as odd about her head but it could be because her ears are down. I wonder if this is a crop of a larger image as there seems to be some low quality to the shot. The composition is good, as is the background. The lioness seems to be a little soft and also some slight noise in her coat, which is why I thought it may be cropped and size increased. It certainly has all the elements of a good shot, just a little lacking in quality.', '2004-05-11 11:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(711137, 75500, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good example of panning to motion blur the unmoving and clarify the moving. I really does look like a toy train.</td>', 'Good example of panning to motion blur the unmoving and clarify the moving. I really does look like a toy train.', '2004-05-11 11:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(711138, 75189, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good clarity on the caterpillar, but the shot is a bit too bright for my taste.</td>', 'Good clarity on the caterpillar, but the shot is a bit too bright for my taste.', '2004-05-11 11:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(711139, 75231, 20395, '<td valign="top">A very cool idea! The strawberry gets muddy on top of the kiwi''s though. It would have been nice to have it overlap them instead of sitting on top. 7</td>', 'A very cool idea! The strawberry gets muddy on top of the kiwi''s though. It would have been nice to have it overlap them instead of sitting on top. 7', '2004-05-11 11:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(711140, 75535, 20395, '<td valign="top">Super creepy. I can''t decide if the grain works for me or not. I''ll vote as if it does.</td>', 'Super creepy. I can''t decide if the grain works for me or not. I''ll vote as if it does.', '2004-05-11 11:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(711141, 75595, 6008, '<td valign="top">The toning is good and ages it well to go with the title. The textures of the silos with the peeling paint is also great and adds to the whole mood of the shot. I like the perspective, it makes them towering and intimidating, which is what I usually feel when I see these huge constructs. It certainly looks like it has a few stories to tell.</td>', 'The toning is good and ages it well to go with the title. The textures of the silos with the peeling paint is also great and adds to the whole mood of the shot. I like the perspective, it makes them towering and intimidating, which is what I usually feel when I see these huge constructs. It certainly looks like it has a few stories to tell.', '2004-05-11 11:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(711143, 75619, 20395, '<td valign="top">Ooh, menacing. Innocence of youth stuff. Good composition, I like the sepia a lot. Your whites seem a little hot.</td>', 'Ooh, menacing. Innocence of youth stuff. Good composition, I like the sepia a lot. Your whites seem a little hot.', '2004-05-11 11:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(711148, 75640, 20395, '<td valign="top">The background is a little cluttered. I like the lighting a lot.</td>', 'The background is a little cluttered. I like the lighting a lot.', '2004-05-11 11:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(711152, 74633, 20395, '<td valign="top">Nothing is in focus, but it''s a nice composition. As your first macro flower shot, you''ve got a good starting point. Keep trying.</td>', 'Nothing is in focus, but it''s a nice composition. As your first macro flower shot, you''ve got a good starting point. Keep trying.', '2004-05-11 11:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(711154, 75636, 20395, '<td valign="top">Love the tilt and DOF</td>', 'Love the tilt and DOF', '2004-05-11 11:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(711159, 75575, 20395, '<td valign="top">More focus on the elements in front. The flash also flattens out your objects a lot.</td>', 'More focus on the elements in front. The flash also flattens out your objects a lot.', '2004-05-11 11:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(711160, 75277, 6008, '<td valign="top">This definitely comes across as a springtime shot. The mix of white fence, green grass, and tan horses compliment each other well. The detail and exposure of the horses are good. The composition is good, although I''d be tempted to try a different crop - a little off the right side to get rid of the black pole and the top until the gap above the fence is gone, and the faded line at the bottom - which I think would center in on the horses more.</td>', 'This definitely comes across as a springtime shot. The mix of white fence, green grass, and tan horses compliment each other well. The detail and exposure of the horses are good. The composition is good, although I''d be tempted to try a different crop - a little off the right side to get rid of the black pole and the top until the gap above the fence is gone, and the faded line at the bottom - which I think would center in on the horses more.', '2004-05-11 11:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(711165, 75543, 20662, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s me -- but this seems slightly out of focus</td>', 'Maybe it''s me -- but this seems slightly out of focus', '2004-05-11 11:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(711166, 75483, 20662, '<td valign="top">Great colors</td>', 'Great colors', '2004-05-11 11:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(711168, 75573, 20662, '<td valign="top">What happens if you lighten up the photo? Seems a little dark. Love the reflection</td>', 'What happens if you lighten up the photo? Seems a little dark. Love the reflection', '2004-05-11 11:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(711169, 75208, 20395, '<td valign="top">It''s grainy, and the lefthand towel buckle is a bit distracting, but I had to give you a 10, just for the idea. This is the stuff I had hoped to see more of in the challenge!</td>', 'It''s grainy, and the lefthand towel buckle is a bit distracting, but I had to give you a 10, just for the idea. This is the stuff I had hoped to see more of in the challenge!', '2004-05-11 11:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(711170, 75539, 20662, '<td valign="top">I love this -- colors are wonderful</td>', 'I love this -- colors are wonderful', '2004-05-11 11:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(711171, 75279, 6008, '<td valign="top">OK I admit it, I had to chuckle when I saw ''Hotel Borg'' - it''s the nerd in me. The grayscale could prolly do with a little more contrast, especially on the background. I''m not sure I particularly like the cropped head at the front either, looks a little odd to me. Stepping back some and getting a little more of the crowd may have helped. I''m not sure what the signs say, but it''s an interesting photojournalistic shot.</td>', 'OK I admit it, I had to chuckle when I saw ''Hotel Borg'' - it''s the nerd in me. The grayscale could prolly do with a little more contrast, especially on the background. I''m not sure I particularly like the cropped head at the front either, looks a little odd to me. Stepping back some and getting a little more of the crowd may have helped. I''m not sure what the signs say, but it''s an interesting photojournalistic shot.', '2004-05-11 11:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(711172, 75327, 20662, '<td valign="top">Colors are beautiful</td>', 'Colors are beautiful', '2004-05-11 11:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(711179, 75515, 20662, '<td valign="top">Great expression on her face! Nothing distracting in the background -- beautiful</td>', 'Great expression on her face! Nothing distracting in the background -- beautiful', '2004-05-11 11:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(711188, 75490, 9581, '<td valign="top">wow look at those green eyes! Cute baby and well done photo!</td>', 'wow look at those green eyes! Cute baby and well done photo!', '2004-05-11 11:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(711191, 74627, 10332, '<td valign="top">Great word play!</td>', 'Great word play!', '2004-05-11 11:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(711210, 75189, 10332, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!</td>', 'Hilarious!', '2004-05-11 11:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(711224, 75528, 10149, '<td valign="top">Looks like the winner to me, this shot is gorgeous</td>', 'Looks like the winner to me, this shot is gorgeous', '2004-05-11 12:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(711228, 75417, 10332, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous detail and color!</td>', 'Gorgeous detail and color!', '2004-05-11 12:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(711237, 75492, 10332, '<td valign="top">poignant, but beautiful</td>', 'poignant, but beautiful', '2004-05-11 12:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(711281, 74979, 14805, '<td valign="top">a little soft</td>', 'a little soft', '2004-05-11 12:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(711284, 75565, 14805, '<td valign="top">the top right is over-exposed<br/></td>', 'the top right is over-exposed', '2004-05-11 12:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(711355, 74627, 16834, '<td valign="top">Should have been called My Life In Runes...   ;-)</td>', 'Should have been called My Life In Runes...   ;-)', '2004-05-11 12:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(711379, 75327, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and clarity on the drops.. Not completely sure about the blue tinge to the picture, but it looks cool (as in temperature).</td>', 'Very nice composition and clarity on the drops.. Not completely sure about the blue tinge to the picture, but it looks cool (as in temperature).', '2004-05-11 12:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(711383, 74290, 13136, '<td valign="top">Maybe with a little Blue Tidy Bowl and less reflection of the photographer.</td>', 'Maybe with a little Blue Tidy Bowl and less reflection of the photographer.', '2004-05-11 12:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(711390, 74665, 13136, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. Lighting in your capture is very good. The only downside is the darkening in the corners (from a wide angle lense?). You might have wanted to crop those out.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. Lighting in your capture is very good. The only downside is the darkening in the corners (from a wide angle lense?). You might have wanted to crop those out.', '2004-05-11 12:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(711393, 74627, 10047, '<td valign="top">A little soft on the focus. The bright light on the right and the fancy frame are distracting.</td>', 'A little soft on the focus. The bright light on the right and the fancy frame are distracting.', '2004-05-11 12:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(711399, 75565, 10047, '<td valign="top">The sun or lighting washed out the color and definition.</td>', 'The sun or lighting washed out the color and definition.', '2004-05-11 13:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(711401, 74763, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have tried for a closer crop, or less dead space on the left.</td>', 'I might have tried for a closer crop, or less dead space on the left.', '2004-05-11 13:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(711403, 75418, 10047, '<td valign="top">Would like to have seen more contrast. Its sort of a dull gray.</td>', 'Would like to have seen more contrast. Its sort of a dull gray.', '2004-05-11 13:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(711405, 74979, 10047, '<td valign="top">Neat photo. Excellent DOF. A little soft on the focus.</td>', 'Neat photo. Excellent DOF. A little soft on the focus.', '2004-05-11 13:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(711424, 75189, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalism of the shot and the basic white and green color combo also gives it a nice simplistic look. The lack of reflections on the glass is good, but I''m glad there are some marks so you still know that it is indeed a glass. The composition is great, and the detail in the caterpillar is excellent.  Wonderful shot!</td>', 'I like the minimalism of the shot and the basic white and green color combo also gives it a nice simplistic look. The lack of reflections on the glass is good, but I''m glad there are some marks so you still know that it is indeed a glass. The composition is great, and the detail in the caterpillar is excellent.  Wonderful shot!', '2004-05-11 13:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(711427, 75565, 6008, '<td valign="top">The top right corner is very bright in comparison to the rest of the shot, specifically the sign, and I''m not too sure about the composition but also not sure how you could ''better'' it either. The color combo of blue and yellow go well together, and the tear and the overall weathered appearance of the sign adds interest.</td>', 'The top right corner is very bright in comparison to the rest of the shot, specifically the sign, and I''m not too sure about the composition but also not sure how you could ''better'' it either. The color combo of blue and yellow go well together, and the tear and the overall weathered appearance of the sign adds interest.', '2004-05-11 13:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(711430, 74798, 2764, '<td valign="top">I think if you cut off the bottom row of windows, leaving only the mountains the picture will be more powerfull and inigmatic.  The maaontains look a bit like waves ad the wonderful reflections drift off to nowhere.  The city anchors the image that ought to float. 8</td>', 'I think if you cut off the bottom row of windows, leaving only the mountains the picture will be more powerfull and inigmatic.  The maaontains look a bit like waves ad the wonderful reflections drift off to nowhere.  The city anchors the image that ought to float. 8', '2004-05-11 13:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(711433, 75045, 6008, '<td valign="top">Great details in the features and the beak. Very sharp and good exposure. Good composition too. The lower right corner looks a little odd to me, although not exactly sure why. It looks like it has the green of the background where the body should be, and an odd OOF section of gray. Even so, it''s a good bird portrait.</td>', 'Great details in the features and the beak. Very sharp and good exposure. Good composition too. The lower right corner looks a little odd to me, although not exactly sure why. It looks like it has the green of the background where the body should be, and an odd OOF section of gray. Even so, it''s a good bird portrait.', '2004-05-11 13:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(711446, 75488, 6008, '<td valign="top">It has a somewhat surreal look to it. The dappled lighting on the wall is good, and the mix of color and black and white is interesting. Having him sit in the hallway is good, but the tilted line of the step gives the image a skewered look (unless that was your intention). The focus is a little soft, possibly due to low light and/or him moving when the shot was taken.</td>', 'It has a somewhat surreal look to it. The dappled lighting on the wall is good, and the mix of color and black and white is interesting. Having him sit in the hallway is good, but the tilted line of the step gives the image a skewered look (unless that was your intention). The focus is a little soft, possibly due to low light and/or him moving when the shot was taken.', '2004-05-11 13:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(711460, 75231, 6008, '<td valign="top">The backlighting really brings out the great color and detail of the kiwis. Although the red of the strawberry is muted a little because of it being on top of the green kiwi I think having it there adds interest and breaks up the repetition of the other fruit. I would be curious to see the strawberry being backlit directly amid the kiwis so that it was a lot stronger and vibrant like the others but that''s mostly out of curiosity. And well done for cutting the slices so thin!</td>', 'The backlighting really brings out the great color and detail of the kiwis. Although the red of the strawberry is muted a little because of it being on top of the green kiwi I think having it there adds interest and breaks up the repetition of the other fruit. I would be curious to see the strawberry being backlit directly amid the kiwis so that it was a lot stronger and vibrant like the others but that''s mostly out of curiosity. And well done for cutting the slices so thin!', '2004-05-11 13:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(711470, 74437, 6008, '<td valign="top">An interesting contradiction, especially coupled with the title. It is usual to see cemetery pics in black and white or a dark sepia tone and this shot is a bright sunny day with vibrant green. The clouds are great, and I love the grass. The building makes it stand out from just another image with lots of headstones. I also like the shadows of the tree branches on the stones and the areas of light and shadow in the scene.</td>', 'An interesting contradiction, especially coupled with the title. It is usual to see cemetery pics in black and white or a dark sepia tone and this shot is a bright sunny day with vibrant green. The clouds are great, and I love the grass. The building makes it stand out from just another image with lots of headstones. I also like the shadows of the tree branches on the stones and the areas of light and shadow in the scene.', '2004-05-11 13:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(711472, 74645, 20779, '<td valign="top">Another wow for me. Perfect symetry. Hopefully no one will mark you down for the signs being out of focus. I think you wanted that, and I like it that they don''t pull you away. 9.</td>', 'Another wow for me. Perfect symetry. Hopefully no one will mark you down for the signs being out of focus. I think you wanted that, and I like it that they don''t pull you away. 9.', '2004-05-11 13:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(711479, 75036, 20779, '<td valign="top">That one pearl in the sky gives this just the right focus.</td>', 'That one pearl in the sky gives this just the right focus.', '2004-05-11 13:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(711485, 75539, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very colorful, like an oil painting effect. I would have liked to pull back more and see more of the whole so I would have a focal  point of interest.</td>', 'Very colorful, like an oil painting effect. I would have liked to pull back more and see more of the whole so I would have a focal  point of interest.', '2004-05-11 13:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(711492, 75048, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very nice experimentation and very streamlined. I think I would like to see it less closely cropped and maybe a little sharper contrast.</td>', 'Very nice experimentation and very streamlined. I think I would like to see it less closely cropped and maybe a little sharper contrast.', '2004-05-11 13:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(711497, 74290, 20779, '<td valign="top">I am not drawn in to want to view this. For me, it lacks interest or composition. I guess not my taste.</td>', 'I am not drawn in to want to view this. For me, it lacks interest or composition. I guess not my taste.', '2004-05-11 13:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(711508, 75066, 10785, '<td valign="top">Weird, but it looks like you have some chromatic abberation at the near end of the log. (The magenta halo...) It typically happens when there is a highly varied contrast in the lights and darks on my camera. This doesn''t seem to be a situation that would merit the C.A. result. But to counter that effect in P.S. you can turn down the magenta tones.<br/> <br/>I give a 6 for a good capture. It can use some color and a different point of view.</td>', 'Weird, but it looks like you have some chromatic abberation at the near end of the log. (The magenta halo...) It typically happens when there is a highly varied contrast in the lights and darks on my camera. This doesn''t seem to be a situation that would merit the C.A. result. But to counter that effect in P.S. you can turn down the magenta tones. I give a 6 for a good capture. It can use some color and a different point of view.', '2004-05-11 14:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(711523, 75289, 10785, '<td valign="top">You took something ordinary and made it extraordinary. Nicely done.</td>', 'You took something ordinary and made it extraordinary. Nicely done.', '2004-05-11 14:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(711571, 74633, 19608, '<td valign="top">Subtle and relaxing.  The black background is just right for your subjects.  I like the way the lighings goes from shady at the back to a bit brighter on the right-most petals.  It could use a bit more DoF.  Not sure that the white border is needed.</td>', 'Subtle and relaxing.  The black background is just right for your subjects.  I like the way the lighings goes from shady at the back to a bit brighter on the right-most petals.  It could use a bit more DoF.  Not sure that the white border is needed.', '2004-05-11 14:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(711575, 75231, 10785, '<td valign="top">This would have been made much better with a thicker slice of strawberry so the light wasn''t shining through it. The non-translucent red color would have stuck out way better.</td>', 'This would have been made much better with a thicker slice of strawberry so the light wasn''t shining through it. The non-translucent red color would have stuck out way better.', '2004-05-11 14:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(711582, 75568, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors and exposure.  Nice composition too, but the lighest area in the bottom left corner is a bit distracting, mostly since it''s out-of-focus. <br/></td>', 'Great colors and exposure.  Nice composition too, but the lighest area in the bottom left corner is a bit distracting, mostly since it''s out-of-focus. ', '2004-05-11 14:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(711586, 75048, 10785, '<td valign="top">The rotation you did was good, but the crop was bad. The leading line is the kneck of the lamp. Half of the kneck is cut off.</td>', 'The rotation you did was good, but the crop was bad. The leading line is the kneck of the lamp. Half of the kneck is cut off.', '2004-05-11 14:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(711593, 75208, 19608, '<td valign="top">Well, it certainly is not something I shoot all the time - interesting combination.  Composition is fine - the "layering" of the onion on the right adds a nice touch.  Exposure is good, but better front lighting on the strawberry would help pop the red out.</td>', 'Well, it certainly is not something I shoot all the time - interesting combination.  Composition is fine - the "layering" of the onion on the right adds a nice touch.  Exposure is good, but better front lighting on the strawberry would help pop the red out.', '2004-05-11 14:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(711601, 75630, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors!  Composition is pretty much dead-centered - but I think that''s ok for this image.  I''d like to see more of the clover leaves under the left side of the image, instead of the busy stick like things.</td>', 'Wonderful colors!  Composition is pretty much dead-centered - but I think that''s ok for this image.  I''d like to see more of the clover leaves under the left side of the image, instead of the busy stick like things.', '2004-05-11 14:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(711609, 75573, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very peaceful image - that lake is so still.  Colors are nice but you''ve lost a lot of detail in the shadows on the right side.</td>', 'A very peaceful image - that lake is so still.  Colors are nice but you''ve lost a lot of detail in the shadows on the right side.', '2004-05-11 14:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(711617, 75616, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a three for major technical problems. I''m not sure if you actually took this under water (with your camera in a plastic bag, maybe?) or just through glass. At any rate, it is really blurry and uninteresting. Three-fourths of the frame are taken up with fuzzy neutral color and absolutely no detail to speak of. The top fourth of the frame  has a bit more variation in terms of texture and color but it is still too blurry to be of any real visual interest (beyond trying to figure out what it is.</td>', 'I gave this a three for major technical problems. I''m not sure if you actually took this under water (with your camera in a plastic bag, maybe?) or just through glass. At any rate, it is really blurry and uninteresting. Three-fourths of the frame are taken up with fuzzy neutral color and absolutely no detail to speak of. The top fourth of the frame  has a bit more variation in terms of texture and color but it is still too blurry to be of any real visual interest (beyond trying to figure out what it is.', '2004-05-11 14:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(711625, 75494, 15495, '<td valign="top">Very Nice.</td>', 'Very Nice.', '2004-05-11 14:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(711627, 75417, 3697, '<td valign="top">What a superb example of insect macro photography. The colors pop off my screen and your use of depth of field really draws the viewer''s eye to the body of the bug. Nicely done.</td>', 'What a superb example of insect macro photography. The colors pop off my screen and your use of depth of field really draws the viewer''s eye to the body of the bug. Nicely done.', '2004-05-11 14:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(711630, 75533, 3697, '<td valign="top">You managed to capture this action moment at the perfect time.. and the buildings in the background make me wonder where exactly was this guy riding? lol. Nice stuff.</td>', 'You managed to capture this action moment at the perfect time.. and the buildings in the background make me wonder where exactly was this guy riding? lol. Nice stuff.', '2004-05-11 14:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(711631, 74676, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. Overcropping the 40 works well with this image. Red and blue are always good colors in photography. Overall the image appears to be slightly soft focused to my taste and reduces its technical merit for me. There is nothing special about the lighting either.  If possible, taking the shot from much further to the left or right to change the perspective and point of view would improve this image immensely. In that case shallow DOF might also be good, but I am unsure of that. Esthetics is important too. This image leaves the viewer asking, "What is the significance of the 40?" but does not provide an answer or make it seem more mysterious which would make it more interesting. Rating - 5</td>', 'Interesting concept. Overcropping the 40 works well with this image. Red and blue are always good colors in photography. Overall the image appears to be slightly soft focused to my taste and reduces its technical merit for me. There is nothing special about the lighting either.  If possible, taking the shot from much further to the left or right to change the perspective and point of view would improve this image immensely. In that case shallow DOF might also be good, but I am unsure of that. Esthetics is important too. This image leaves the viewer asking, "What is the significance of the 40?" but does not provide an answer or make it seem more mysterious which would make it more interesting. Rating - 5', '2004-05-11 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(711634, 75642, 7322, '<td valign="top">The thought that comes to mind when looking at this photo is,"How desperate do you have to be for subject matter before you turn to something as dull as this?"  Technically, I guess it''s not too bad a shot but it is very very boring in terms of color, texture, tonal contrast, and topical interest (I like my Macs too but, jeesh!)  You could have possibly added interest to this by framing the Apple log in one of the lower corners rather than at the center edge. I gave this a three.</td>', 'The thought that comes to mind when looking at this photo is,"How desperate do you have to be for subject matter before you turn to something as dull as this?"  Technically, I guess it''s not too bad a shot but it is very very boring in terms of color, texture, tonal contrast, and topical interest (I like my Macs too but, jeesh!)  You could have possibly added interest to this by framing the Apple log in one of the lower corners rather than at the center edge. I gave this a three.', '2004-05-11 14:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(711635, 75490, 15495, '<td valign="top">Great angle.  Are the kids eyes really that big or is that a photoshop enhcnacment?</td>', 'Great angle.  Are the kids eyes really that big or is that a photoshop enhcnacment?', '2004-05-11 14:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(711639, 75640, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the whales in terms of topical interest, color, and shape. However, by placing them in this visually distracting environment you''ve reduced them to  just one more aspect of the clutter. Better to have isolated them against a simple background. This looks like it was taken in the office of an antique dealer or eBay seller (from one who knows ;D). I gave it a four.</td>', 'I like the whales in terms of topical interest, color, and shape. However, by placing them in this visually distracting environment you''ve reduced them to  just one more aspect of the clutter. Better to have isolated them against a simple background. This looks like it was taken in the office of an antique dealer or eBay seller (from one who knows ;D). I gave it a four.', '2004-05-11 14:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(711643, 75498, 7322, '<td valign="top">I get that this is a place you''ve never taken photos, etc, but you could have put a bit more thought and care into the composition. This looks like you stood over the toilet and snapped. It''s very tilted ,for one thing, and there is zero visual interest. I believe any subject has potential to be a good photo but this isn''t showing us a toilet in a new way. We''ve all seen this view of the loo. I gave it a four.</td>', 'I get that this is a place you''ve never taken photos, etc, but you could have put a bit more thought and care into the composition. This looks like you stood over the toilet and snapped. It''s very tilted ,for one thing, and there is zero visual interest. I believe any subject has potential to be a good photo but this isn''t showing us a toilet in a new way. We''ve all seen this view of the loo. I gave it a four.', '2004-05-11 14:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(711644, 75501, 13610, '<td valign="top">The composition is good. Unfortunately, the house is tilted and the focus draw attention to the plant and the fence in the foreground wich, according to your title is not the subject of you image. (5)</td>', 'The composition is good. Unfortunately, the house is tilted and the focus draw attention to the plant and the fence in the foreground wich, according to your title is not the subject of you image. (5)', '2004-05-11 14:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(711650, 75436, 5792, '<td valign="top">The technique to desaturate all but one object or color is OK to know but it is way overdone and there really is not much call to use it anywhere really. However, you have done an EXCEPTIONAL job with it in this image. The technical quality here is about the best I have ever seen at this site. This is one of the best images in this challenge.<br/> <br/>It is one of my top three choices.</td>', 'The technique to desaturate all but one object or color is OK to know but it is way overdone and there really is not much call to use it anywhere really. However, you have done an EXCEPTIONAL job with it in this image. The technical quality here is about the best I have ever seen at this site. This is one of the best images in this challenge. It is one of my top three choices.', '2004-05-11 14:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(711652, 75506, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the light shining through the trees and on the pavilion but I gave this a four because the rest just doesn''t add up to much. I''m referring to the boring sidewalk, the fence with the its blah brick column and the equally blah stacks of concrete pavers. One stack of pavers that is particulalry well lit draws the eye straight to the truck in the background. A suggestion would be to try again with a vertical format  so that you put the interest where it is supposed to be -- on your subject.</td>', 'I like the light shining through the trees and on the pavilion but I gave this a four because the rest just doesn''t add up to much. I''m referring to the boring sidewalk, the fence with the its blah brick column and the equally blah stacks of concrete pavers. One stack of pavers that is particulalry well lit draws the eye straight to the truck in the background. A suggestion would be to try again with a vertical format  so that you put the interest where it is supposed to be -- on your subject.', '2004-05-11 14:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(711657, 75490, 5792, '<td valign="top">I might recognize this little guy, Jacko. You certainly have one of the most photogenic babies and you do a tremendous job with those images. This should get the blue ribbon. If this is not a jacko entry I apologize. Either way I just gave you very high praise.  The image, however, speaks for itself.</td>', 'I might recognize this little guy, Jacko. You certainly have one of the most photogenic babies and you do a tremendous job with those images. This should get the blue ribbon. If this is not a jacko entry I apologize. Either way I just gave you very high praise.  The image, however, speaks for itself.', '2004-05-11 14:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(711658, 74798, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a four. The scenery beyond the bars of the window is nice but those bars really aren''t working hard as a visual element. For one thing, the main vertical bars have very distracting reflections. The roof also creates a very large, very distracting reflection. The simple monochromatic color scheme, one thing this shot had going for it, is interrupted by the section of rusty roof supports in the top left corner.</td>', 'I gave this a four. The scenery beyond the bars of the window is nice but those bars really aren''t working hard as a visual element. For one thing, the main vertical bars have very distracting reflections. The roof also creates a very large, very distracting reflection. The simple monochromatic color scheme, one thing this shot had going for it, is interrupted by the section of rusty roof supports in the top left corner.', '2004-05-11 14:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(711662, 75278, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a four. The pig sculpture is whimsical enough without the hat, which reduces it to ''cutesy pie-ness" (a matter of taste, I know). In terms of technical details, the framing is good and keeps the subject simple. The depth of field needs to be shallower to blur the background which is very busy looking in terms of texture. The pig is a bit overexposed. The textural details of the concrete are quite washed out except for the part of it that received less sunlight. The lighting has an overall harsh quality.</td>', 'I gave this a four. The pig sculpture is whimsical enough without the hat, which reduces it to ''cutesy pie-ness" (a matter of taste, I know). In terms of technical details, the framing is good and keeps the subject simple. The depth of field needs to be shallower to blur the background which is very busy looking in terms of texture. The pig is a bit overexposed. The textural details of the concrete are quite washed out except for the part of it that received less sunlight. The lighting has an overall harsh quality.', '2004-05-11 15:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(711663, 75177, 5792, '<td valign="top">This tree makes a wonderful study for photography. It has great, huge branches that could be photographed an infinite variety of ways. The angle you are taking it from here is fine. The image itself has sky noise. Noise reduction software, like NeatImage, could be applied across the whole image to easily remove that or you could apply gaussian blur just to the selected sky. The view from inside the car does not work well for me. The refections in the glass distracts me. Though the angle is OK I would crop out the horizon completely and get much close to the tree if I were taking this shot.</td>', 'This tree makes a wonderful study for photography. It has great, huge branches that could be photographed an infinite variety of ways. The angle you are taking it from here is fine. The image itself has sky noise. Noise reduction software, like NeatImage, could be applied across the whole image to easily remove that or you could apply gaussian blur just to the selected sky. The view from inside the car does not work well for me. The refections in the glass distracts me. Though the angle is OK I would crop out the horizon completely and get much close to the tree if I were taking this shot.', '2004-05-11 15:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(711666, 75602, 16930, '<td valign="top">This picture is so clear with so much detail.  I love water pictures and the capturing of splashes.  The coloring is perfect, shadowing and the bubbles.  Very nice job.</td>', 'This picture is so clear with so much detail.  I love water pictures and the capturing of splashes.  The coloring is perfect, shadowing and the bubbles.  Very nice job.', '2004-05-11 15:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(711667, 74979, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is such a nice capture and you have used nice DOF and framed the bird well. I am unsure if there is something that could be done about that in the original but the overal focus of the image is not very good. That is too bad for such a  nice capture. There is some noise in the background but you could easily get rid of that with noise reduction software such as NeatImage.</td>', 'This is such a nice capture and you have used nice DOF and framed the bird well. I am unsure if there is something that could be done about that in the original but the overal focus of the image is not very good. That is too bad for such a  nice capture. There is some noise in the background but you could easily get rid of that with noise reduction software such as NeatImage.', '2004-05-11 15:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(711668, 75634, 13610, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, a little bit more contrast could improve it a lot</td>', 'Interesting shot, a little bit more contrast could improve it a lot', '2004-05-11 15:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(711670, 75409, 7322, '<td valign="top">That pink, thin border within the image plane is really distracting. The image itself is rather poor in terms of technical quality. The bud is very overexposed, washing out all the details that make close-ups of flowers beautiful; the texture of the petals (you need to almost be able to ''feel'' the silkiness of the petals), the translucent color from light shining through the petals, the subtle variations in color (in this case from deep pink to nearly white), and the separateness of the individual petals in relation to the overal form of the flower. In this instance, the bud is so overexposed that the petals blend into each other nearly invisibly creating a blob of white, losing all the qualities I just mentioned.  <br/>In terms of composition, you need to get much closer to such a small, delicate flower, isolating it  from a visually overwhelming background. The overexposure was likely due to your camera''s meter adjusting for the dark background rather than the pale bud.  Tighter framing will help in this case also. If your camera allows for manual shutter speed or aperature settings, you can try using a large aperature with a fast shutter speed (the large aperature to create shallow depth of field, the fast shutter speed to make up for the extra light that the larger aperature will let in).</td>', 'That pink, thin border within the image plane is really distracting. The image itself is rather poor in terms of technical quality. The bud is very overexposed, washing out all the details that make close-ups of flowers beautiful; the texture of the petals (you need to almost be able to ''feel'' the silkiness of the petals), the translucent color from light shining through the petals, the subtle variations in color (in this case from deep pink to nearly white), and the separateness of the individual petals in relation to the overal form of the flower. In this instance, the bud is so overexposed that the petals blend into each other nearly invisibly creating a blob of white, losing all the qualities I just mentioned.  In terms of composition, you need to get much closer to such a small, delicate flower, isolating it  from a visually overwhelming background. The overexposure was likely due to your camera''s meter adjusting for the dark background rather than the pale bud.  Tighter framing will help in this case also. If your camera allows for manual shutter speed or aperature settings, you can try using a large aperature with a fast shutter speed (the large aperature to create shallow depth of field, the fast shutter speed to make up for the extra light that the larger aperature will let in).', '2004-05-11 15:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(711671, 75231, 7322, '<td valign="top">This may have been better with just the kiwi slices. The strawberry is just kind of sitting there detracting from the simple composition. I gave this a four.</td>', 'This may have been better with just the kiwi slices. The strawberry is just kind of sitting there detracting from the simple composition. I gave this a four.', '2004-05-11 15:14:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(711679, 75565, 5792, '<td valign="top">The mark of a good photographer is to be able to see something and present it to the viewer from a different perspective as you have done here. However, the technical implementation of it could be improved. Overall the focus is softer than it should be. You might be able to saturate the colors to make them more vibrant and increase the contrast of the image to make it stand out more. Above and to the right of the sign is overexposed and I do not know what you might be able to do with that. I sometimes use darkening within a greyscale layer applied to the overexposed area to tone it down, but I don''t think that would work with this image. The best thing, I think, is to take it at a different time of day so that the lighting is not a problem.</td>', 'The mark of a good photographer is to be able to see something and present it to the viewer from a different perspective as you have done here. However, the technical implementation of it could be improved. Overall the focus is softer than it should be. You might be able to saturate the colors to make them more vibrant and increase the contrast of the image to make it stand out more. Above and to the right of the sign is overexposed and I do not know what you might be able to do with that. I sometimes use darkening within a greyscale layer applied to the overexposed area to tone it down, but I don''t think that would work with this image. The best thing, I think, is to take it at a different time of day so that the lighting is not a problem.', '2004-05-11 15:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(711683, 75643, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a four.  You are too far away from your subject, the breaking waves, to make a strong visual statement about it.  What remains is a decent snapshot but not a great photo. You might try  to get as close as you can on your belly to capture the waves in a visually exciting way. I live in a state surrounded by ocean (Rhode Island -- the Ocean State, natch) and this isn''t giving me a visual sense of the power of waves breaking over huge rocks.</td>', 'I gave this a four.  You are too far away from your subject, the breaking waves, to make a strong visual statement about it.  What remains is a decent snapshot but not a great photo. You might try  to get as close as you can on your belly to capture the waves in a visually exciting way. I live in a state surrounded by ocean (Rhode Island -- the Ocean State, natch) and this isn''t giving me a visual sense of the power of waves breaking over huge rocks.', '2004-05-11 15:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(711686, 75382, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a four. There just wasn''t enough visual interest in this compostion to grab me. You had an interesting start with the folds of the hose but that one section in the middle just detracts from the <br/>pleasingness of the design.</td>', 'I gave this a four. There just wasn''t enough visual interest in this compostion to grab me. You had an interesting start with the folds of the hose but that one section in the middle just detracts from the pleasingness of the design.', '2004-05-11 15:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(711689, 75575, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a four. It''s a nice idea in terms of a theme but the lighting is very poor  (looks like you relied soley on flash) and a great deal of the foreground is blurry. It looks like the sharp focus begins at the furthermost arm of the starfish. More care could have gone into arranging the still life. For instance, that book on Sea Star does not hold much visual interest. Nor does the souvenir Footprints sack. the starfish, a few shells, pebbles, and perhaps the painted sand dollar (to represent the souvenir aspect) would have been a much more pleasing arrangment.</td>', 'I gave this a four. It''s a nice idea in terms of a theme but the lighting is very poor  (looks like you relied soley on flash) and a great deal of the foreground is blurry. It looks like the sharp focus begins at the furthermost arm of the starfish. More care could have gone into arranging the still life. For instance, that book on Sea Star does not hold much visual interest. Nor does the souvenir Footprints sack. the starfish, a few shells, pebbles, and perhaps the painted sand dollar (to represent the souvenir aspect) would have been a much more pleasing arrangment.', '2004-05-11 15:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(711692, 75565, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a four. This isn''t a great perspective. Much of the visual impact of the blue and yellow sign is lost because of poor focus.That large section of overexposed sky creates a huge hot spot. The lower right corner has some distracting clutter going on also.</td>', 'I gave this a four. This isn''t a great perspective. Much of the visual impact of the blue and yellow sign is lost because of poor focus.That large section of overexposed sky creates a huge hot spot. The lower right corner has some distracting clutter going on also.', '2004-05-11 15:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(711695, 75496, 5792, '<td valign="top">Flowers will always be great subjects for photography. I believe yours was taken in overcast or shaded conditions and that is always best for flowers. I have some suggestions for improvement. I might choose a specific flower as the main subject for my composition and use framing and depth of field to highlight it. I would saturate the colors and increase contrast to make the flowers really stand out more. A shallower depth of field would work nicely for you with this image. Sometimes I even apply sharpening just to the main flower to highlight it more. Though this is not exactly like your situation here I have an example of some of these thoughts with images of the same type flower you can see here:<br/>//www.pbase.com/image/27005610 or<br/>//www.pbase.com/image/27005611<br/></td>', 'Flowers will always be great subjects for photography. I believe yours was taken in overcast or shaded conditions and that is always best for flowers. I have some suggestions for improvement. I might choose a specific flower as the main subject for my composition and use framing and depth of field to highlight it. I would saturate the colors and increase contrast to make the flowers really stand out more. A shallower depth of field would work nicely for you with this image. Sometimes I even apply sharpening just to the main flower to highlight it more. Though this is not exactly like your situation here I have an example of some of these thoughts with images of the same type flower you can see here://www.pbase.com/image/27005610 or//www.pbase.com/image/27005611', '2004-05-11 15:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(711696, 75510, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five. The composition is nice. I like the line her jawline creates in contrast with the black background. I would have given it a higher score but most of the image is unfocused looking.</td>', 'I gave this a five. The composition is nice. I like the line her jawline creates in contrast with the black background. I would have given it a higher score but most of the image is unfocused looking.', '2004-05-11 15:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(711698, 74771, 5792, '<td valign="top">The tulips bending in the breeze on a spring day is great. The fence makes a great background. The size of this image hurts it for voters. This is such a pretty picture it begs to be bigger on the screen. You are allowed to have images up to 640 pixels on a side and you should always try to use all of it if you can.</td>', 'The tulips bending in the breeze on a spring day is great. The fence makes a great background. The size of this image hurts it for voters. This is such a pretty picture it begs to be bigger on the screen. You are allowed to have images up to 640 pixels on a side and you should always try to use all of it if you can.', '2004-05-11 15:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(711699, 75634, 7322, '<td valign="top">I gave this a five. The framing is decent (although without the title, I would have problems with the subject looking away from the camera at a boring shrub). It is a bit overexposed. I don''t think black and white helps this image. For instance, if the boy had been wearing a colorful t-shirt it might have made a nice visual contrast with the neutral colors of the shrubs, walk, and bench.</td>', 'I gave this a five. The framing is decent (although without the title, I would have problems with the subject looking away from the camera at a boring shrub). It is a bit overexposed. I don''t think black and white helps this image. For instance, if the boy had been wearing a colorful t-shirt it might have made a nice visual contrast with the neutral colors of the shrubs, walk, and bench.', '2004-05-11 15:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(711704, 75377, 21183, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love this!  I like the perspective and the way the focus shifts from the purple petals down to the ''softness'' of the blue vase.  Nice clean contrast against the white background. This makes me want to reach out and touch the petals.</td>', 'Wow, I love this!  I like the perspective and the way the focus shifts from the purple petals down to the ''softness'' of the blue vase.  Nice clean contrast against the white background. This makes me want to reach out and touch the petals.', '2004-05-11 15:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(711710, 75626, 5792, '<td valign="top">What a nice idea for Mother''s Day! You choice of subject and quality are good. Framing is well balanced on the frame. I would use noise reduction to smooth out the background noise a little bit. I think a little more contrast weould make this image even more vibrant. However, I would NOT use brightness/contrast adjustments for that. That is because increasing contrast would lose some of the flower''s marvelous detail. Instead, in photoshop anyway, I would use "selective color" to deepen black more. This has the effect of increasing contrast without losing image detail.  In any case this is a very nice image.</td>', 'What a nice idea for Mother''s Day! You choice of subject and quality are good. Framing is well balanced on the frame. I would use noise reduction to smooth out the background noise a little bit. I think a little more contrast weould make this image even more vibrant. However, I would NOT use brightness/contrast adjustments for that. That is because increasing contrast would lose some of the flower''s marvelous detail. Instead, in photoshop anyway, I would use "selective color" to deepen black more. This has the effect of increasing contrast without losing image detail.  In any case this is a very nice image.', '2004-05-11 15:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(711715, 75349, 14603, '<td valign="top">The number of islands here makes me think of Loch Lomond ?<br/>Nice image with good clarity</td>', 'The number of islands here makes me think of Loch Lomond ?Nice image with good clarity', '2004-05-11 15:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(711721, 75586, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good use of light and shade to produce a very atmospheric image.<br/>The droplets of water add an extra dimension to this shot.<br/>good work</td>', 'Good use of light and shade to produce a very atmospheric image.The droplets of water add an extra dimension to this shot.good work', '2004-05-11 15:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(711723, 75583, 5792, '<td valign="top">The setting for this image is wonderful and a good photo choice. This reminds me of the problem I always have photographing cactus because they are generally much taller than the things that surround them like you have with your subject here. I try to offset it to one side or the other with something of interest on the other side of the frame to balance the image better. Don''t know if that can be done here but centering images generally gives them more of a snapshot quality then an artistic nature photograph.</td>', 'The setting for this image is wonderful and a good photo choice. This reminds me of the problem I always have photographing cactus because they are generally much taller than the things that surround them like you have with your subject here. I try to offset it to one side or the other with something of interest on the other side of the frame to balance the image better. Don''t know if that can be done here but centering images generally gives them more of a snapshot quality then an artistic nature photograph.', '2004-05-11 15:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(711726, 75598, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely done with a good mix of colour to add interest</td>', 'Nicely done with a good mix of colour to add interest', '2004-05-11 15:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
