(712127, 74665, 18838, '<td valign="top">nice mood with the soft light and the fog ... 7 ... there is some vignetting at the edges (guess you probably noticed) ... maybe a tighter crop with only the trees/reflection on the left and the foggy landscape on the right would have made it better</td>', 'nice mood with the soft light and the fog ... 7 ... there is some vignetting at the edges (guess you probably noticed) ... maybe a tighter crop with only the trees/reflection on the left and the foggy landscape on the right would have made it better', '2004-05-11 18:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
