(712149, 75436, 3697, '<td valign="top">I really like this, the selective saturation works very well here drawing the viewer''s attention to the student''s feet. VERY well done.</td>', 'I really like this, the selective saturation works very well here drawing the viewer''s attention to the student''s feet. VERY well done.', '2004-05-11 18:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
