(714002, 74765, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the eggs against the neutral nest. I find the out of focus leaves in the foreground very distracting. I don''t know whether you would get into trouble removing them (are they weeds or intentional plants?). If so, better depth of field could be a solution, or a higher camera positon to drop them below the angle of view.</td>', 'I like the color of the eggs against the neutral nest. I find the out of focus leaves in the foreground very distracting. I don''t know whether you would get into trouble removing them (are they weeds or intentional plants?). If so, better depth of field could be a solution, or a higher camera positon to drop them below the angle of view.', '2004-05-12 12:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(714007, 75598, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great shot for a first try. I really like the detail, the color and the out-of-focus background that makes the flower stand out. This could be an entry in the Centered Subject challenge. Good choice of crop and beautiful colors. Take more flower pictures by all means.<br/></td>', 'Great shot for a first try. I really like the detail, the color and the out-of-focus background that makes the flower stand out. This could be an entry in the Centered Subject challenge. Good choice of crop and beautiful colors. Take more flower pictures by all means.', '2004-05-12 12:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(714010, 75328, 12733, '<td valign="top">A lovely composition; I like the water and the building that shows only enough to create questions as to its nature without answering them. The colors are great, and the path adds to the interest. The only quibble is that the path gets cut off in the foreground, making it less identifiable as a path.</td>', 'A lovely composition; I like the water and the building that shows only enough to create questions as to its nature without answering them. The colors are great, and the path adds to the interest. The only quibble is that the path gets cut off in the foreground, making it less identifiable as a path.', '2004-05-12 12:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(714013, 74763, 9821, '<td valign="top">Didn''t we already have a discussion about this photo on the forums? I see you went with the lighter version :)</td>', 'Didn''t we already have a discussion about this photo on the forums? I see you went with the lighter version :)', '2004-05-12 12:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(714015, 75515, 6008, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot! It''s full of energy and action and certainly a different perspective. The only obvious negative is the highlight on the left side of her face and shoulder that is a little blown and so a little distracting. But the energy of the shot really wins out.</td>', 'What a fun shot! It''s full of energy and action and certainly a different perspective. The only obvious negative is the highlight on the left side of her face and shoulder that is a little blown and so a little distracting. But the energy of the shot really wins out.', '2004-05-12 12:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(714020, 74371, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of the path receeding off into the distance, and the cathedral of tree branches hanging over it.</td>', 'I like the sense of the path receeding off into the distance, and the cathedral of tree branches hanging over it.', '2004-05-12 12:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(714025, 75105, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting viewpoint for a very interesting-looking building. It seems that the sky is perfectly exposed to the detriment of the forebround, losing most of the color in the plants and the details of the building. I think a little brightening in levels or curves coujld have improved this.</td>', 'This is an interesting viewpoint for a very interesting-looking building. It seems that the sky is perfectly exposed to the detriment of the forebround, losing most of the color in the plants and the details of the building. I think a little brightening in levels or curves coujld have improved this.', '2004-05-12 12:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(714028, 74780, 6008, '<td valign="top">Hrm, to be honest this doesnt really do much for me. The lighting is fairly flat and the subject doesnt hold much interest for me. The machine is in the center of the image and although the dirt road kinda curves toward the center it doesnt really lead the eye there. I would imagine there would be some good textures in the various piles of sand and rock and so maybe going at a different time and playing with light and shadow on those surfaces could yield some interesting studies.</td>', 'Hrm, to be honest this doesnt really do much for me. The lighting is fairly flat and the subject doesnt hold much interest for me. The machine is in the center of the image and although the dirt road kinda curves toward the center it doesnt really lead the eye there. I would imagine there would be some good textures in the various piles of sand and rock and so maybe going at a different time and playing with light and shadow on those surfaces could yield some interesting studies.', '2004-05-12 12:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(714029, 75327, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty - nice catch. Is it the early morning lighting that makes the leaf appear blue, rather than green?</td>', 'Very pretty - nice catch. Is it the early morning lighting that makes the leaf appear blue, rather than green?', '2004-05-12 12:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(714033, 75341, 9821, '<td valign="top">Seems to me this picture is missing the EnCon building (and the Hudson River Way), but maybe it''s just a bit farther up river. The striped bass are running, every morning on the way to work I see tons of boats out fishing :)</td>', 'Seems to me this picture is missing the EnCon building (and the Hudson River Way), but maybe it''s just a bit farther up river. The striped bass are running, every morning on the way to work I see tons of boats out fishing :)', '2004-05-12 12:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(714034, 75639, 12733, '<td valign="top">What a great point of view for this picture. It turns the bridge into a near-abstract and gives details that would be completely hidden in the ordinary view. The large extent of dead black underside detracts a bit.</td>', 'What a great point of view for this picture. It turns the bridge into a near-abstract and gives details that would be completely hidden in the ordinary view. The large extent of dead black underside detracts a bit.', '2004-05-12 12:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(714036, 75368, 6008, '<td valign="top">Love the green, it''s very vibrant and lush and the blend of yellow flowers makes it very springtime. The sheep are interesting being in a line such as they are, and I like how most of them are not paying attention but the one in the center seems to be staring this way. I''m torn between liking the crop and not liking the crop. A lot can be said for having negative space to give expanse, but I think because it''s not just a field and it has bushes/trees and such that I might have preferred to have seen a cropped version with just the field/sheep, which could have helped bring out some of the character and detail of the animals as well.</td>', 'Love the green, it''s very vibrant and lush and the blend of yellow flowers makes it very springtime. The sheep are interesting being in a line such as they are, and I like how most of them are not paying attention but the one in the center seems to be staring this way. I''m torn between liking the crop and not liking the crop. A lot can be said for having negative space to give expanse, but I think because it''s not just a field and it has bushes/trees and such that I might have preferred to have seen a cropped version with just the field/sheep, which could have helped bring out some of the character and detail of the animals as well.', '2004-05-12 12:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(714037, 75064, 9821, '<td valign="top">I know more than am I am ... who''s am I am?  just kidding ... very creative</td>', 'I know more than am I am ... who''s am I am?  just kidding ... very creative', '2004-05-12 12:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(714041, 75515, 12733, '<td valign="top">Seriously, you''ve never taken pictures of this kid before? It''s a great shot, she shows the joy of youth and its simple pleasures. I guess in a few years, she''ll probably quit enjoying activities that mess up her hair, but for now she''s obviously happy with life.</td>', 'Seriously, you''ve never taken pictures of this kid before? It''s a great shot, she shows the joy of youth and its simple pleasures. I guess in a few years, she''ll probably quit enjoying activities that mess up her hair, but for now she''s obviously happy with life.', '2004-05-12 12:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(714042, 75635, 6008, '<td valign="top">Neat mix of blues before and after the rainbow! I''ve tried shooting rainbows in the past and found them very hard to get just right. The colors here are pretty strong.</td>', 'Neat mix of blues before and after the rainbow! I''ve tried shooting rainbows in the past and found them very hard to get just right. The colors here are pretty strong.', '2004-05-12 12:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(714046, 75163, 12733, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s what you call a closeup. It may be nitpicky, but I''d like to have seen enough DOF to bring the whole dandelion into focus. What kind of a bug is that, anyway?</td>', 'Wow, that''s what you call a closeup. It may be nitpicky, but I''d like to have seen enough DOF to bring the whole dandelion into focus. What kind of a bug is that, anyway?', '2004-05-12 12:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(714048, 75417, 6008, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s pretty close! Butterflies tend to fly off when I get too close so you did a great job getting in there. I like the composition too. The colors are great, and the body of the butterfly is very sharp. I''m a fan of shallow dof but I cant decide whether I like the majority of the wings being OOF or not. In some ways they make the body details stand more a lot, but on the other they lose the texture and detail of the wings. Even so, a very cool shot!</td>', 'Wow, that''s pretty close! Butterflies tend to fly off when I get too close so you did a great job getting in there. I like the composition too. The colors are great, and the body of the butterfly is very sharp. I''m a fan of shallow dof but I cant decide whether I like the majority of the wings being OOF or not. In some ways they make the body details stand more a lot, but on the other they lose the texture and detail of the wings. Even so, a very cool shot!', '2004-05-12 12:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(714050, 75539, 12733, '<td valign="top">Should this have gone into the Rusted challenge? The colors are amazing, is it rust or grafitti? By coming in so close, you''ve created a great abstract effect. Great shot.</td>', 'Should this have gone into the Rusted challenge? The colors are amazing, is it rust or grafitti? By coming in so close, you''ve created a great abstract effect. Great shot.', '2004-05-12 12:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(714056, 75595, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting study in shapes and textures.</td>', 'An interesting study in shapes and textures.', '2004-05-12 12:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(714061, 75499, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute, a nice collection of birds posed to make a nice composition. It looks as though it might be more effective turned upside-down, so the birds are looking up instead of down.</td>', 'Very cute, a nice collection of birds posed to make a nice composition. It looks as though it might be more effective turned upside-down, so the birds are looking up instead of down.', '2004-05-12 12:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(714063, 75368, 2780, '<td valign="top">Sheep rock :)</td>', 'Sheep rock :)', '2004-05-12 12:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(714065, 74771, 12733, '<td valign="top">The tulips are pretty, and the fence makes a nice background, but the detail gets lost in the number of flowers and the distance you''re working from I think coming in close and getting four or five flowers in closeup detail would make a better shot.</td>', 'The tulips are pretty, and the fence makes a nice background, but the detail gets lost in the number of flowers and the distance you''re working from I think coming in close and getting four or five flowers in closeup detail would make a better shot.', '2004-05-12 12:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(714066, 75541, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Everything is spot on. 10</td>', 'Excellent shot. Everything is spot on. 10', '2004-05-12 12:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(714070, 75398, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute, nice action. Seems a bit underexposed, and the cygnet on the right''s head  is completely obscured by the splash. Or is it under water?</td>', 'Very cute, nice action. Seems a bit underexposed, and the cygnet on the right''s head  is completely obscured by the splash. Or is it under water?', '2004-05-12 12:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(714071, 75061, 15495, '<td valign="top">NIce shot.</td>', 'NIce shot.', '2004-05-12 12:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(714072, 75368, 9821, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2004-05-12 12:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(714073, 75508, 15495, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2004-05-12 12:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(714074, 75533, 9821, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2004-05-12 12:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(714079, 75588, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice  composition, attractive texture. Black and white works well, but the picture seems very contrasty, with no detail in the shadows.</td>', 'Nice  composition, attractive texture. Black and white works well, but the picture seems very contrasty, with no detail in the shadows.', '2004-05-12 12:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(714081, 74726, 15495, '<td valign="top">not very sharp.</td>', 'not very sharp.', '2004-05-12 12:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(714089, 75278, 12733, '<td valign="top">Could this be Miss Piggy of Sesame Street fame? I like the contrast of the colorful hat and the monochrome pig. A cloudier day, or another time of day, might have helped to reduce the harsh shadows and bring out more detail in the pig''s face.</td>', 'Could this be Miss Piggy of Sesame Street fame? I like the contrast of the colorful hat and the monochrome pig. A cloudier day, or another time of day, might have helped to reduce the harsh shadows and bring out more detail in the pig''s face.', '2004-05-12 12:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(714096, 74726, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice moon shot. Good detail, and I like the use of color. The color is unusual, most moon shots look like black and white even when shot in color. I think placing the moon off-center on a rectangular, rather than square, background would make a more effective composition.</td>', 'Nice moon shot. Good detail, and I like the use of color. The color is unusual, most moon shots look like black and white even when shot in color. I think placing the moon off-center on a rectangular, rather than square, background would make a more effective composition.', '2004-05-12 12:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(714102, 75550, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty rendition. I like the subtle colors and the capture of so many shades. The shape of the flower comes across beautifully, and the background is nicely blurred to make the flower stand out.</td>', 'Very pretty rendition. I like the subtle colors and the capture of so many shades. The shape of the flower comes across beautifully, and the background is nicely blurred to make the flower stand out.', '2004-05-12 12:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(714106, 75061, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great shot. You can see every hair, and the expression on its face is priceless. This squirrel seems to be studying you, and not liking what it sees. Tracking down an albino squirrel must difficult to start with, and getting this good a shot even more so.</td>', 'Great shot. You can see every hair, and the expression on its face is priceless. This squirrel seems to be studying you, and not liking what it sees. Tracking down an albino squirrel must difficult to start with, and getting this good a shot even more so.', '2004-05-12 12:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(714112, 75531, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and textures. The black bacground makes it almost glow.</td>', 'I really like the colors and textures. The black bacground makes it almost glow.', '2004-05-12 13:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(714117, 75586, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice statue for a subject, and nicely composed. Seems too contrasty to me.</td>', 'Nice statue for a subject, and nicely composed. Seems too contrasty to me.', '2004-05-12 13:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(714127, 75368, 12733, '<td valign="top">What a great mob of sheep? How much did you have to pay them to pose for you like that? I like the picture a lot, but I can imagine it cropped to a panorama format, making the sheep stand out better.</td>', 'What a great mob of sheep? How much did you have to pay them to pose for you like that? I like the picture a lot, but I can imagine it cropped to a panorama format, making the sheep stand out better.', '2004-05-12 13:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(714129, 75390, 12733, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this means something, and the narrow DOF has a point, but you''ve completely lost me.</td>', 'I''m sure this means something, and the narrow DOF has a point, but you''ve completely lost me.', '2004-05-12 13:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(714132, 75180, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors, and the way the flowers pick up the red of the woman''s pants. I also like the texture of the wall. I wish the shot had been taken at a point where the path coujld be seen heading off into the distance - it would have made a better composition.</td>', 'I really like the colors, and the way the flowers pick up the red of the woman''s pants. I also like the texture of the wall. I wish the shot had been taken at a point where the path coujld be seen heading off into the distance - it would have made a better composition.', '2004-05-12 13:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(714133, 75189, 17166, '<td valign="top">Title made me laugh.  Wish the glass was a bit darker or more well defined.</td>', 'Title made me laugh.  Wish the glass was a bit darker or more well defined.', '2004-05-12 13:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(714137, 75488, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the use of black and white with a spot of color - it really emphasizes the ball and somehow makes the black-and-white even more so by contrast.</td>', 'I like the use of black and white with a spot of color - it really emphasizes the ball and somehow makes the black-and-white even more so by contrast.', '2004-05-12 13:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(714140, 75412, 12733, '<td valign="top">These bikes give the impression of a junkyard marring a beautiful river scene. On closer inspection, they are clearly not junk, and the picture takes on a jarring discontinuity.</td>', 'These bikes give the impression of a junkyard marring a beautiful river scene. On closer inspection, they are clearly not junk, and the picture takes on a jarring discontinuity.', '2004-05-12 13:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(714144, 75573, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty scene, and the boat gives it a focal point that really makes the composition.</td>', 'This is a very pretty scene, and the boat gives it a focal point that really makes the composition.', '2004-05-12 13:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(714149, 75500, 12733, '<td valign="top">The thing about motion blur is that it has to be enough to be clearly deliberate, not to look like the background is just out of focus. Very nice try, but IMHO it just misses the mark.</td>', 'The thing about motion blur is that it has to be enough to be clearly deliberate, not to look like the background is just out of focus. Very nice try, but IMHO it just misses the mark.', '2004-05-12 13:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(714151, 75538, 12733, '<td valign="top">An unusual view, beautifully exposed and sharp. It looks almost like a model, though it clearly isn''t. Where was it take from - it seems too clear to be through an airplane window.</td>', 'An unusual view, beautifully exposed and sharp. It looks almost like a model, though it clearly isn''t. Where was it take from - it seems too clear to be through an airplane window.', '2004-05-12 13:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(714156, 75246, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty array of colors and shapes. IMHO it needs either more DOF or cropping those first foreground flowers that are out of focus; part of this picture''s charm is its overall impression of sharp clarity.</td>', 'Very pretty array of colors and shapes. IMHO it needs either more DOF or cropping those first foreground flowers that are out of focus; part of this picture''s charm is its overall impression of sharp clarity.', '2004-05-12 13:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(714159, 75204, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great sense of motion, brilliant colors and enough sharpness to capture some great expressions. But this day is more than cloudy - it looks like the background was isolated and replaced with plain white.</td>', 'Great sense of motion, brilliant colors and enough sharpness to capture some great expressions. But this day is more than cloudy - it looks like the background was isolated and replaced with plain white.', '2004-05-12 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(714160, 75635, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty capture of a rainbow with an interesting sky for background. Why is it so much bluer above the rainbow that below?</td>', 'Very pretty capture of a rainbow with an interesting sky for background. Why is it so much bluer above the rainbow that below?', '2004-05-12 13:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(714162, 75066, 12733, '<td valign="top">Shades of Dr. Seuss and Yertle the Turtle. Very cute and nicely exposed and composed. Possibly focusing tighter on about half the turtles might have provided better detail on what an individual turtle looks like.</td>', 'Shades of Dr. Seuss and Yertle the Turtle. Very cute and nicely exposed and composed. Possibly focusing tighter on about half the turtles might have provided better detail on what an individual turtle looks like.', '2004-05-12 13:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(714164, 75519, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and colors. This looks more like a painting than a photo. The angle takes it out of the mundane building shot.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and colors. This looks more like a painting than a photo. The angle takes it out of the mundane building shot.', '2004-05-12 13:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(714168, 75632, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness lifts this somewhat mundane subject out of its surroundings and makes it pop. I can almost feel the texture of those bricks and weathered wood. I imagine lunches that are better than anything currently on the market, though I cannot imagine what might be in them.</td>', 'Great sharpness lifts this somewhat mundane subject out of its surroundings and makes it pop. I can almost feel the texture of those bricks and weathered wood. I imagine lunches that are better than anything currently on the market, though I cannot imagine what might be in them.', '2004-05-12 13:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(714170, 74361, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great creatures, great shot. You''ve got their shaggy hair sharp enough to pick out the strands, and the colors are great. The blurred out background keeps the focus where it belongs - on the critters. One nitpicking detail, that headless beast in the background is distracting. I think cloning it out is legal in the advanced editing rules.</td>', 'Great creatures, great shot. You''ve got their shaggy hair sharp enough to pick out the strands, and the colors are great. The blurred out background keeps the focus where it belongs - on the critters. One nitpicking detail, that headless beast in the background is distracting. I think cloning it out is legal in the advanced editing rules.', '2004-05-12 13:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(714171, 75639, 12827, '<td valign="top">I really like the symmetry!  People really seem to be hung up on rule of thirds<br/>and that is too bad because they miss awesome shots like this!<br/>9</td>', 'I really like the symmetry!  People really seem to be hung up on rule of thirdsand that is too bad because they miss awesome shots like this!9', '2004-05-12 13:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(714172, 75181, 12827, '<td valign="top">great detail!  I would like to see a little more contrast, not much! just a little</td>', 'great detail!  I would like to see a little more contrast, not much! just a little', '2004-05-12 13:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(714173, 75526, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great capture on the water drops, and having an attractive model helps. But what a way to treat a book!</td>', 'Great capture on the water drops, and having an attractive model helps. But what a way to treat a book!', '2004-05-12 13:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(714176, 75115, 12733, '<td valign="top">They look like pussycats. Great capture - I especially like the sticking out tonge.</td>', 'They look like pussycats. Great capture - I especially like the sticking out tonge.', '2004-05-12 13:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(714177, 74670, 2336, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I love the texture of the wood and the way the light falls off around the corners.  Definately a 10!</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I love the texture of the wood and the way the light falls off around the corners.  Definately a 10!', '2004-05-12 13:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(714180, 74646, 12733, '<td valign="top">A lovely rendition of the the curves of the bridge, the plants at its base and the blue water. Also, the textures of stone and plants are great. It won''t affect the score for the picture - but what a cornball title!</td>', 'A lovely rendition of the the curves of the bridge, the plants at its base and the blue water. Also, the textures of stone and plants are great. It won''t affect the score for the picture - but what a cornball title!', '2004-05-12 13:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(714182, 74763, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great colors, strong composition and interesting lighting - though there has to be a source other than the torch. One of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Great colors, strong composition and interesting lighting - though there has to be a source other than the torch. One of the best in the challenge.', '2004-05-12 13:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(714184, 74670, 18194, '<td valign="top">Not at all a bad photo, it could use just a bit more depth of field.</td>', 'Not at all a bad photo, it could use just a bit more depth of field.', '2004-05-12 13:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
