(714663, 75306, 15403, '<td valign="top">he looks like he thinks he''s somebody, eh?  Nice photo!</td>', 'he looks like he thinks he''s somebody, eh?  Nice photo!', '2004-05-12 16:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
