(714799, 75368, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice spring foliage, nice sheep.  cropping about 15 to 20 pixels off the top reduces the distraction at the very top.  I guess it is just in the nature of sheep to flock closely together.  It would have been nice if they had formed a more aesthetic grouping.</td>', 'Nice spring foliage, nice sheep.  cropping about 15 to 20 pixels off the top reduces the distraction at the very top.  I guess it is just in the nature of sheep to flock closely together.  It would have been nice if they had formed a more aesthetic grouping.', '2004-05-12 18:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(714800, 75588, 19480, '<td valign="top">This is something old but set up very nice.  good job!</td>', 'This is something old but set up very nice.  good job!', '2004-05-12 18:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(714801, 75598, 21202, '<td valign="top">The colors in the background really help, although even smaller aperture and even more diffusion provides a really nice counterpoint to the chosen flower.</td>', 'The colors in the background really help, although even smaller aperture and even more diffusion provides a really nice counterpoint to the chosen flower.', '2004-05-12 18:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(714805, 75496, 21202, '<td valign="top">Is this bee balm?  I had a red one I loved as did the bumblebees.  Very nice picture although there is a lot of competition between the two closest blooms for being the focal point.</td>', 'Is this bee balm?  I had a red one I loved as did the bumblebees.  Very nice picture although there is a lot of competition between the two closest blooms for being the focal point.', '2004-05-12 18:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(714807, 75506, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  I assume you climbed the tree and placed the lamp.</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  I assume you climbed the tree and placed the lamp.', '2004-05-12 18:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(714808, 75550, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture of Magnolia.</td>', 'Very nice picture of Magnolia.', '2004-05-12 18:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(714814, 75412, 21202, '<td valign="top">Bicycle Marina?  Nice foliage and river.</td>', 'Bicycle Marina?  Nice foliage and river.', '2004-05-12 18:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(714835, 75208, 21202, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I find more here I want to change than I want to leave as is.  I want the side of the strawberry I am looking at more well lit, I want a fresher strawberry. I want a different color towel.   I want the strawberry lifted off the onion with a toothpick, preferably silver, and I want less glare on the surface of the onion.</td>', 'Sorry, I find more here I want to change than I want to leave as is.  I want the side of the strawberry I am looking at more well lit, I want a fresher strawberry. I want a different color towel.   I want the strawberry lifted off the onion with a toothpick, preferably silver, and I want less glare on the surface of the onion.', '2004-05-12 18:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(714844, 75626, 21202, '<td valign="top">How lovely.  There is something on the bottom leaf on the left that coudlhave been removed.</td>', 'How lovely.  There is something on the bottom leaf on the left that coudlhave been removed.', '2004-05-12 18:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(714849, 75632, 21202, '<td valign="top">This would have been even more striking if the geraniums were left in color.  Great photo as it stands.</td>', 'This would have been even more striking if the geraniums were left in color.  Great photo as it stands.', '2004-05-12 18:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(714852, 75180, 21202, '<td valign="top">The red pants and red sandals really work well.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'The red pants and red sandals really work well.  Very nice shot.', '2004-05-12 18:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(714864, 74924, 21202, '<td valign="top">Although it is hard to find a real horizontal or vertical here, the swamp appears to me a little tilted to the right as if it is being drained.  Nice amount of light coming down through the leaves, nice reflections, nice natural composition plus good framing.</td>', 'Although it is hard to find a real horizontal or vertical here, the swamp appears to me a little tilted to the right as if it is being drained.  Nice amount of light coming down through the leaves, nice reflections, nice natural composition plus good framing.', '2004-05-12 18:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(714874, 75400, 21202, '<td valign="top">The vapor ring really helps.  The lighting is very nice for illluminating the rising vapors and providing a glow to the beaker itself.  The dark background is achieved well. An even faster shutter would have helped to reduce the blur on teh side of the beaker.  I actually would have liked the full beaker in this picture.</td>', 'The vapor ring really helps.  The lighting is very nice for illluminating the rising vapors and providing a glow to the beaker itself.  The dark background is achieved well. An even faster shutter would have helped to reduce the blur on teh side of the beaker.  I actually would have liked the full beaker in this picture.', '2004-05-12 18:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(714879, 75069, 21202, '<td valign="top">The yellows of the spring greens work very well with the dead grasses from the previous year.  Nice trail, nice picture.  Easy to hang on a wall as a remembrance throughout the year of a fragrant walk in spring.</td>', 'The yellows of the spring greens work very well with the dead grasses from the previous year.  Nice trail, nice picture.  Easy to hang on a wall as a remembrance throughout the year of a fragrant walk in spring.', '2004-05-12 18:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(714884, 75641, 21202, '<td valign="top">The head looks like it just pushed its way into the marble just as if the marble were a thin sheet of rubber.  It would be nice if your lens were capable of opening wider, giving more overall brightness, and allowing a shorter exposure time as well.</td>', 'The head looks like it just pushed its way into the marble just as if the marble were a thin sheet of rubber.  It would be nice if your lens were capable of opening wider, giving more overall brightness, and allowing a shorter exposure time as well.', '2004-05-12 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(714890, 74763, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but lighting seems very unnatural.</td>', 'Nice colors, but lighting seems very unnatural.', '2004-05-12 18:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(714903, 75539, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is really a fire hydrant? If so, amazing colors! They''re so rich and bright. I wish I could see the whole hydrant, though.</td>', 'This is really a fire hydrant? If so, amazing colors! They''re so rich and bright. I wish I could see the whole hydrant, though.', '2004-05-12 18:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(714907, 75210, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice desaturation as it really directs focus to the ant. Nice sharp focus and textures. I might have cropped the right side a bit tighter to eliminate the lower right corner. 7</td>', 'Nice desaturation as it really directs focus to the ant. Nice sharp focus and textures. I might have cropped the right side a bit tighter to eliminate the lower right corner. 7', '2004-05-12 18:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(714912, 75490, 11518, '<td valign="top">LMAOOOOOO.  Fantastic capture! 10...I`m still LMAO<br/> <br/>1 day later and I''m still coming back to look at this pic!<br/> <br/>It must be the eyes!  Hypnotic!  LOL</td>', 'LMAOOOOOO.  Fantastic capture! 10...I`m still LMAO 1 day later and I''m still coming back to look at this pic! It must be the eyes!  Hypnotic!  LOL', '2004-05-12 18:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(714913, 74798, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky!  Heida?</td>', 'Beautiful sky!  Heida?', '2004-05-12 18:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(714914, 75500, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good job with the pan-and-shoot (or did you just select the background and blur?). Nice colors and saturation. Contrast could use a slight boost, IMO.</td>', 'Good job with the pan-and-shoot (or did you just select the background and blur?). Nice colors and saturation. Contrast could use a slight boost, IMO.', '2004-05-12 18:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(714915, 75306, 11518, '<td valign="top">A tad over-exposed...-1/3 of a stop would be perfect.</td>', 'A tad over-exposed...-1/3 of a stop would be perfect.', '2004-05-12 18:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(714916, 75540, 6999, '<td valign="top">The burnt-out sky is such an obvious problem here - and seems to be a simple case of dynamic range being unable to cope with the scene you wanted to capture - and the only solution? A different time of day, or different weather ... Also, I''m not completely certain about your framing of the image - those buildings to the left, cutting them off - perhaps you could have afforded to include more of the context here, rather than so blatantly concentrating on the barn alone? The cut off of those sheds unbalances the image a bit, for me.</td>', 'The burnt-out sky is such an obvious problem here - and seems to be a simple case of dynamic range being unable to cope with the scene you wanted to capture - and the only solution? A different time of day, or different weather ... Also, I''m not completely certain about your framing of the image - those buildings to the left, cutting them off - perhaps you could have afforded to include more of the context here, rather than so blatantly concentrating on the barn alone? The cut off of those sheds unbalances the image a bit, for me.', '2004-05-12 18:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(714919, 74645, 8054, '<td valign="top">Interesting symmetry. Very industrial and modern. Photo suffers from focusing problems as I cannot read the signs.</td>', 'Interesting symmetry. Very industrial and modern. Photo suffers from focusing problems as I cannot read the signs.', '2004-05-12 18:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(714921, 75483, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what the problem is (light prbably, it usually is), but there''s a lack of detail in the little monster - and even, to a lesser extent in the leaf. Perhaps a sligh camera movement? Cunningly reduced with sharpening perhaps, but there isn''t that pop of definition that one would look for.</td>', 'Not quite sure what the problem is (light prbably, it usually is), but there''s a lack of detail in the little monster - and even, to a lesser extent in the leaf. Perhaps a sligh camera movement? Cunningly reduced with sharpening perhaps, but there isn''t that pop of definition that one would look for.', '2004-05-12 18:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(714923, 75501, 11518, '<td valign="top">House is out of focus.  If you wanted both the fence and the house to be in focus you needed to use a smaller aperture like f/16 or higher.</td>', 'House is out of focus.  If you wanted both the fence and the house to be in focus you needed to use a smaller aperture like f/16 or higher.', '2004-05-12 18:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(714925, 75201, 6999, '<td valign="top">Kind of like this, for its sheer oddness and mood. I like the composition, the fact that it makes the image as much about the location as about the figure - provides a nice balance, a nice dichotomy in the scene. I''m sure a different frmaing would have fared better on dpc - balance the figure with the light on the wall that you''ve half cropped-out to right, and you''d have a much more orthodoxly composed (and equally, more immediately eye-catching) image. I''m glad you haven''t - glad there are people submitting not just for the prizes.</td>', 'Kind of like this, for its sheer oddness and mood. I like the composition, the fact that it makes the image as much about the location as about the figure - provides a nice balance, a nice dichotomy in the scene. I''m sure a different frmaing would have fared better on dpc - balance the figure with the light on the wall that you''ve half cropped-out to right, and you''d have a much more orthodoxly composed (and equally, more immediately eye-catching) image. I''m glad you haven''t - glad there are people submitting not just for the prizes.', '2004-05-12 18:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(714927, 75393, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice overall composition although I would have liked to see more of the road and less fence.</td>', 'Nice overall composition although I would have liked to see more of the road and less fence.', '2004-05-12 18:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(714928, 74665, 11518, '<td valign="top">There is significant vignetting.  A tad overexposed, -1/3 stop and it would be better. Nice capture otherwise.</td>', 'There is significant vignetting.  A tad overexposed, -1/3 stop and it would be better. Nice capture otherwise.', '2004-05-12 18:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(714929, 75490, 1717, '<td valign="top">well, this is certainly not a new face to DPC but who could ever take points away from an image like this?!?!  it looks like Sam is holding the camera up and taking his own pic...lol...what a little doll he is!</td>', 'well, this is certainly not a new face to DPC but who could ever take points away from an image like this?!?!  it looks like Sam is holding the camera up and taking his own pic...lol...what a little doll he is!', '2004-05-12 18:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(714931, 75550, 8054, '<td valign="top">Subject is too centered. You did capture nice details of the petals and I can see nice, albeit subtle, texturing.</td>', 'Subject is too centered. You did capture nice details of the petals and I can see nice, albeit subtle, texturing.', '2004-05-12 18:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(714932, 75555, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  A polarizer would have brought out the colours in the sky.</td>', 'Beautiful.  A polarizer would have brought out the colours in the sky.', '2004-05-12 18:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(714940, 75189, 1717, '<td valign="top">i love this...the lighting and composition is perfect and the green looks so crisp.  such a fun, cheerful shot.  i love those little ''feet'' clinging to the glass.  well done!</td>', 'i love this...the lighting and composition is perfect and the green looks so crisp.  such a fun, cheerful shot.  i love those little ''feet'' clinging to the glass.  well done!', '2004-05-12 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(714941, 75636, 8765, '<td valign="top">Very cool! 10</td>', 'Very cool! 10', '2004-05-12 19:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(714943, 74765, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great job cropping and use of DOF. Some might think the leaves are distracting but I think they frame the bottom and right side well. Nice color of the eggs even though I have no idea what kind of bird would lay blue eggs.</td>', 'Great job cropping and use of DOF. Some might think the leaves are distracting but I think they frame the bottom and right side well. Nice color of the eggs even though I have no idea what kind of bird would lay blue eggs.', '2004-05-12 19:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(714944, 75279, 6999, '<td valign="top">Shows some of the difficultire of photo-journalism - too many peculiarities in these people (looking at camera, weird cropping, weird expressions). Positioning of the statue is weird. Prominence of the Hotel name almost makes the shot about that, rather than whatever the subject of the demonstration is.  Almost weird enough to be about that weirdness itself - but your title, and the concentration of the image suggests otherwise.</td>', 'Shows some of the difficultire of photo-journalism - too many peculiarities in these people (looking at camera, weird cropping, weird expressions). Positioning of the statue is weird. Prominence of the Hotel name almost makes the shot about that, rather than whatever the subject of the demonstration is.  Almost weird enough to be about that weirdness itself - but your title, and the concentration of the image suggests otherwise.', '2004-05-12 19:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(714949, 75180, 1717, '<td valign="top">this is just stunning.  i love the desaturation of the greens and yellows.  the composition is wonderful and it makes me want to follow along to see what lies beyond the bend of the path.  excellent work!</td>', 'this is just stunning.  i love the desaturation of the greens and yellows.  the composition is wonderful and it makes me want to follow along to see what lies beyond the bend of the path.  excellent work!', '2004-05-12 19:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(714952, 75490, 13772, '<td valign="top">Very cute picture! Looks like it would go on one of those baby greeting cards. The only thing I can see wrong that would make this a perfect picture to me is that the lighting is more even so you would not see the hard shadows.</td>', 'Very cute picture! Looks like it would go on one of those baby greeting cards. The only thing I can see wrong that would make this a perfect picture to me is that the lighting is more even so you would not see the hard shadows.', '2004-05-12 19:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(714954, 75305, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nothing quite matches the embarrassment of a typo in the title (I''ve done it myself - even more embarrassingly, two weeks in a row). Rest assured, it can be corrected later :-)<br/> <br/>Other than that, a beautiful capture of a good scene ... Perhaps a bit, er, orthodox for me - a bit too much a standard imae, a stock image perhaps. What I personally think it cries out for is some foreground, to add a greater sense of depth to that recession of hills. Technically however, it''s evidently competent.</td>', 'Nothing quite matches the embarrassment of a typo in the title (I''ve done it myself - even more embarrassingly, two weeks in a row). Rest assured, it can be corrected later :-) Other than that, a beautiful capture of a good scene ... Perhaps a bit, er, orthodox for me - a bit too much a standard imae, a stock image perhaps. What I personally think it cries out for is some foreground, to add a greater sense of depth to that recession of hills. Technically however, it''s evidently competent.', '2004-05-12 19:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(714957, 75277, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good light, finally - so many people seem to think its enough to just get a shot of an animal, with no thought to other elements of the scene. Not sure about the moment you''ve chosen though - mother seems more interested in food than her offspring, and the crossing of the two seems a little awkward, compositionally.</td>', 'Good light, finally - so many people seem to think its enough to just get a shot of an animal, with no thought to other elements of the scene. Not sure about the moment you''ve chosen though - mother seems more interested in food than her offspring, and the crossing of the two seems a little awkward, compositionally.', '2004-05-12 19:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(714958, 75636, 8054, '<td valign="top">Cute kitty! I''m impressed that you got the kitty to stay focused on the camera long enough to take the picture. Nice and sharp details of the face and DOF directs focus.</td>', 'Cute kitty! I''m impressed that you got the kitty to stay focused on the camera long enough to take the picture. Nice and sharp details of the face and DOF directs focus.', '2004-05-12 19:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(714960, 75541, 1717, '<td valign="top">wonderful, wonderful composition.  i love the use of negative space to isolate the couple and enhance the impression that they are alone together.  very romantic feeling to this image.  well done!</td>', 'wonderful, wonderful composition.  i love the use of negative space to isolate the couple and enhance the impression that they are alone together.  very romantic feeling to this image.  well done!', '2004-05-12 19:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(714961, 75535, 13772, '<td valign="top">I like the creativity of this one. If it was not so dark and the boy on the outside was more in focus but that might of been out of your control. You might play around with this in B&amp;W. Nice job!</td>', 'I like the creativity of this one. If it was not so dark and the boy on the outside was more in focus but that might of been out of your control. You might play around with this in B&W. Nice job!', '2004-05-12 19:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(714964, 75189, 13772, '<td valign="top">Looks alfully tasty. Nice capture!</td>', 'Looks alfully tasty. Nice capture!', '2004-05-12 19:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(714970, 75045, 13772, '<td valign="top">Emu? Good use of DOF and nice crisp photo. Good Job!</td>', 'Emu? Good use of DOF and nice crisp photo. Good Job!', '2004-05-12 19:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(714974, 75494, 1717, '<td valign="top">wow...breathtaking!  the b&amp;w tone is a great choice and makes the image very dramatic.  well done!</td>', 'wow...breathtaking!  the b&w tone is a great choice and makes the image very dramatic.  well done!', '2004-05-12 19:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(714977, 74798, 6999, '<td valign="top">Perhaps they wouldn''t accuse my shots of looking like yours if I could ever compose an image like this - they''d just be absolutely certain :-) <br/> <br/>There is something affecting in these partial/diagonal compositions - though that blurred and over-reflected lanscape/cityscape adds a new element for this one.</td>', 'Perhaps they wouldn''t accuse my shots of looking like yours if I could ever compose an image like this - they''d just be absolutely certain :-)  There is something affecting in these partial/diagonal compositions - though that blurred and over-reflected lanscape/cityscape adds a new element for this one.', '2004-05-12 19:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(714994, 75089, 1717, '<td valign="top">excellent DOF and composition.  love the soft feel and muted colors.  i have plenty of laundry to be done...lol...you''re welcome to help. :)</td>', 'excellent DOF and composition.  love the soft feel and muted colors.  i have plenty of laundry to be done...lol...you''re welcome to help. :)', '2004-05-12 19:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(714995, 75278, 8054, '<td valign="top">Lighting works for the flowers but it makes the pig appear flat from the neck down.</td>', 'Lighting works for the flowers but it makes the pig appear flat from the neck down.', '2004-05-12 19:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(714998, 74633, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good composition and cropping. Contrast needs work or increase the DOF and really blur the background flower. Also appears to be a lot of compression.</td>', 'Good composition and cropping. Contrast needs work or increase the DOF and really blur the background flower. Also appears to be a lot of compression.', '2004-05-12 19:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(714999, 75201, 1717, '<td valign="top">great mood and lighting and i love the motion.  well done!</td>', 'great mood and lighting and i love the motion.  well done!', '2004-05-12 19:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(715001, 74670, 8054, '<td valign="top">Subject is blurry. Either lens has severe vignetting issues or just odd lighting. The duotone works well to depict age.</td>', 'Subject is blurry. Either lens has severe vignetting issues or just odd lighting. The duotone works well to depict age.', '2004-05-12 19:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(715003, 75306, 1717, '<td valign="top">amazing detail and texture.  well done!</td>', 'amazing detail and texture.  well done!', '2004-05-12 19:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(715007, 75602, 8054, '<td valign="top">Background enhances the water and its movement. I would like to see the object that you froze or at least more of it and less of the top. Maybe even convert to b/w.</td>', 'Background enhances the water and its movement. I would like to see the object that you froze or at least more of it and less of the top. Maybe even convert to b/w.', '2004-05-12 19:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(715010, 75253, 8054, '<td valign="top">Not the most exciting composition but it has excellent focus, contrast and colors. With the reflections on the vats, you''ve captured the smooth textures.</td>', 'Not the most exciting composition but it has excellent focus, contrast and colors. With the reflections on the vats, you''ve captured the smooth textures.', '2004-05-12 19:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(715012, 75603, 8054, '<td valign="top">Contrast looks a bit dark and color balance is a bit off as I can see a slight tint of red in the white areas on the Dalmation (not counting the area around the mouth). Subject is in nice focus.</td>', 'Contrast looks a bit dark and color balance is a bit off as I can see a slight tint of red in the white areas on the Dalmation (not counting the area around the mouth). Subject is in nice focus.', '2004-05-12 19:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(715017, 75538, 8054, '<td valign="top">No kidding, this is WAY up. Nice vantage point and surprising details in the buildings. Contrast seems a bit bright but acceptable. I like how you included enough water to really enhance the feeling of distance.</td>', 'No kidding, this is WAY up. Nice vantage point and surprising details in the buildings. Contrast seems a bit bright but acceptable. I like how you included enough water to really enhance the feeling of distance.', '2004-05-12 19:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(715023, 75176, 8054, '<td valign="top">I would have rated this higher if the foreground was cropped a bit more enhancing the rule of thirds and focus point. Colors, saturation and focus are all excellent. I really like the look you captured of the cat.</td>', 'I would have rated this higher if the foreground was cropped a bit more enhancing the rule of thirds and focus point. Colors, saturation and focus are all excellent. I really like the look you captured of the cat.', '2004-05-12 19:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(715027, 74627, 8054, '<td valign="top">I think you meant runes not ruins. Anywho, interesting subject but it has some issues with focus, noise and/or compression.</td>', 'I think you meant runes not ruins. Anywho, interesting subject but it has some issues with focus, noise and/or compression.', '2004-05-12 19:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(715028, 75483, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good application of DOF. Does the leaf really look like that? It looks like it''s out of focus but the mosquito isn''t.</td>', 'Good application of DOF. Does the leaf really look like that? It looks like it''s out of focus but the mosquito isn''t.', '2004-05-12 19:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(715029, 75174, 8054, '<td valign="top">"What did you do this weekend, Bob?"<br/>"Oh, not much. Just kicked back."<br/> <br/>Sorry, just had to do that. :)  Great action shot but it''s too centered. If you left some negative space in front of the horse it would make a huge improvement.</td>', '"What did you do this weekend, Bob?""Oh, not much. Just kicked back." Sorry, just had to do that. :)  Great action shot but it''s too centered. If you left some negative space in front of the horse it would make a huge improvement.', '2004-05-12 19:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(715030, 75541, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lots of stuff to like here, especially the hint of mist on the water. Good composition. A touch too blatantly romantic for me - highly marketable no doubt, and I would suggest highly successful here. kind of advertising industry aspirational, and I personally like a more complex, deeper image. But everso well done, whatever.</td>', 'Lots of stuff to like here, especially the hint of mist on the water. Good composition. A touch too blatantly romantic for me - highly marketable no doubt, and I would suggest highly successful here. kind of advertising industry aspirational, and I personally like a more complex, deeper image. But everso well done, whatever.', '2004-05-12 19:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(715031, 74669, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good application of negative space. The bird in the foreground is blurry. I assumed that was the main focus point and if so, it should be sharply focused.</td>', 'Good application of negative space. The bird in the foreground is blurry. I assumed that was the main focus point and if so, it should be sharply focused.', '2004-05-12 19:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(715032, 74703, 8054, '<td valign="top">LOL! This is a great shot of a cow. Looks a bit oversharpened. There also seems to be a purple tint to the image.</td>', 'LOL! This is a great shot of a cow. Looks a bit oversharpened. There also seems to be a purple tint to the image.', '2004-05-12 19:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(715071, 74633, 13772, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but the purple fringing is distracting to me.</td>', 'I like this photo but the purple fringing is distracting to me.', '2004-05-12 20:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(715105, 74430, 9763, '<td valign="top">The money is way too bright.  The money borders (corners) aren''t perfectly aligned.  This throws the photo off a bit.  The background is crisp, but the photo still lacks something, not sure what.  It would be cool to see this with fun colored lighting or tons of old 20s lying around with the new one on top, off center or something.</td>', 'The money is way too bright.  The money borders (corners) aren''t perfectly aligned.  This throws the photo off a bit.  The background is crisp, but the photo still lacks something, not sure what.  It would be cool to see this with fun colored lighting or tons of old 20s lying around with the new one on top, off center or something.', '2004-05-12 20:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(715110, 74763, 9763, '<td valign="top">Didn''t we get to see the photo in a forum recently?  I like the concept and lighting.  I think the bottom is a little distracting though.  Perhaps you could try to darken it to take it out of focus or something so that our eyes aren''t drawn to it (for future reference of course)  :)</td>', 'Didn''t we get to see the photo in a forum recently?  I like the concept and lighting.  I think the bottom is a little distracting though.  Perhaps you could try to darken it to take it out of focus or something so that our eyes aren''t drawn to it (for future reference of course)  :)', '2004-05-12 20:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(715112, 75588, 9763, '<td valign="top">Wow, a glass door to nowhere!  I love it.  The horizon line seems a tad off, and the lighting is a bit bright.  The tones are beautiful (sepia) and the subject is fascinating.  The composition is also very nice.</td>', 'Wow, a glass door to nowhere!  I love it.  The horizon line seems a tad off, and the lighting is a bit bright.  The tones are beautiful (sepia) and the subject is fascinating.  The composition is also very nice.', '2004-05-12 20:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(715116, 75542, 9763, '<td valign="top">Ridiculously cute!!!!  I love the expression, colors, composition, focus and interest!  Great shot.  It''d be perfect if the fence were completely straight or both of the planks were 100% parallel.  But that''s not your doing.  From a technical standpoint, it''s a great shot!</td>', 'Ridiculously cute!!!!  I love the expression, colors, composition, focus and interest!  Great shot.  It''d be perfect if the fence were completely straight or both of the planks were 100% parallel.  But that''s not your doing.  From a technical standpoint, it''s a great shot!', '2004-05-12 20:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(715119, 75277, 9763, '<td valign="top">Completely adorable.  I would have adjusted the levels on the entire photo to darken it a bit though.</td>', 'Completely adorable.  I would have adjusted the levels on the entire photo to darken it a bit though.', '2004-05-12 20:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(715131, 75526, 9763, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome photo!  I love the expression, the raindrops, the idea, the composition, everything.  Perfect 10.</td>', 'This is an awesome photo!  I love the expression, the raindrops, the idea, the composition, everything.  Perfect 10.', '2004-05-12 20:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(715138, 75598, 9763, '<td valign="top">For your first, you did an excellent job.  I take pictures of flowers every day and rarely do I get something as nice as this.  Your color and composition are beautiful.  Your DOF is perfect and overall feel is very very nice.  The only thing I''d change is the pink distraction to the left and show a tiny bit more of the main flower''s stem.</td>', 'For your first, you did an excellent job.  I take pictures of flowers every day and rarely do I get something as nice as this.  Your color and composition are beautiful.  Your DOF is perfect and overall feel is very very nice.  The only thing I''d change is the pink distraction to the left and show a tiny bit more of the main flower''s stem.', '2004-05-12 20:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(715172, 75556, 18403, '<td valign="top">Nice shades of brown in the eyes!</td>', 'Nice shades of brown in the eyes!', '2004-05-12 20:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
