(715611, 75490, 2336, '<td valign="top">LOL  This shot is GREAT..  What a happy baby... The colors and exposure are deadon and it is so nice and crispy and clean. 10!</td>', 'LOL  This shot is GREAT..  What a happy baby... The colors and exposure are deadon and it is so nice and crispy and clean. 10!', '2004-05-12 23:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
