(716279, 75048, 6999, '<td valign="top">Arguably more about the presentation than the photograph, which I''m sure will hurt your score here. Tonality of the lampshade itself is very well done, great movement in the shading, though personally I would have tried to take it a little further, or perhaps even to lose the stalk and switch, so that the black point could be set even darker and emphasise more that shading. Not an easy subject to get so clean - especially shot in natural light (the rflections in the light-bulb are pretty revealing)</td>', 'Arguably more about the presentation than the photograph, which I''m sure will hurt your score here. Tonality of the lampshade itself is very well done, great movement in the shading, though personally I would have tried to take it a little further, or perhaps even to lose the stalk and switch, so that the black point could be set even darker and emphasise more that shading. Not an easy subject to get so clean - especially shot in natural light (the rflections in the light-bulb are pretty revealing)', '2004-05-13 08:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(716281, 75360, 6999, '<td valign="top">Well composed shot a rather bland subject - a sense of over-neatening too, as though noise reduction has removed too mich detail whilst going about its business. It''s an effect that can be very useful, and it leands an eerie model-like feel to the finished image. Highly competent shot, subject matter does little for me. 6</td>', 'Well composed shot a rather bland subject - a sense of over-neatening too, as though noise reduction has removed too mich detail whilst going about its business. It''s an effect that can be very useful, and it leands an eerie model-like feel to the finished image. Highly competent shot, subject matter does little for me. 6', '2004-05-13 08:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(716283, 75632, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intriguing. Has a sense of stillness, a sense of closed-for-lunch (strangely, given the sign). Evidence of heavy over-sharpening, especially around those letters in the sign, and the jaggies on the plant-pot. But I do like tthe composition very much, and that sense of grain. 7</td>', 'Intriguing. Has a sense of stillness, a sense of closed-for-lunch (strangely, given the sign). Evidence of heavy over-sharpening, especially around those letters in the sign, and the jaggies on the plant-pot. But I do like tthe composition very much, and that sense of grain. 7', '2004-05-13 08:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(716284, 75418, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good detail, though I can''t see that the centred framing does much for this one. My main gripe would be with your greyscale though - the poor thing looks grey rather than any shade of white, which works against your title, certainly.</td>', 'Good detail, though I can''t see that the centred framing does much for this one. My main gripe would be with your greyscale though - the poor thing looks grey rather than any shade of white, which works against your title, certainly.', '2004-05-13 08:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(716311, 75576, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great focus, good depth of field. It must be Spring.</td>', 'Great focus, good depth of field. It must be Spring.', '2004-05-13 09:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(716312, 75555, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great scene, good framing, decent color and lighting. Focus seems a little soft but a terrific vista.</td>', 'Great scene, good framing, decent color and lighting. Focus seems a little soft but a terrific vista.', '2004-05-13 09:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(716313, 75537, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space, nice level horizon. Good capture.</td>', 'Good use of negative space, nice level horizon. Good capture.', '2004-05-13 09:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(716317, 75307, 5792, '<td valign="top">Classic train image taken at exactly the right moment. Even the tilt of the first engine works well. The overall quality of this image is not as good as it might be. Above just to the right of the engine the rocks appear smudged and out of focus different from the rest of the image. That is an effect I sometimes get from NeatImage for noise reduction. The rest if the image seems to suffere from that but to a lesser extent. That is too bad. This is an otherwise good setting and a nice capture.</td>', 'Classic train image taken at exactly the right moment. Even the tilt of the first engine works well. The overall quality of this image is not as good as it might be. Above just to the right of the engine the rocks appear smudged and out of focus different from the rest of the image. That is an effect I sometimes get from NeatImage for noise reduction. The rest if the image seems to suffere from that but to a lesser extent. That is too bad. This is an otherwise good setting and a nice capture.', '2004-05-13 09:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(716319, 75543, 5792, '<td valign="top">Concept, framing, and use of the rule of thirds are all good in  this image. The image quality is not good and that is a major distraction. The tree, your main subject, is not well focused and there appears to be noise in the sky background. I don''t know if it is true for this case but a scene like this sometimes is best taken near sunrise of sunset to give it more vibrant lighting and dramatic shadows. The idea of this image is definitely good.</td>', 'Concept, framing, and use of the rule of thirds are all good in  this image. The image quality is not good and that is a major distraction. The tree, your main subject, is not well focused and there appears to be noise in the sky background. I don''t know if it is true for this case but a scene like this sometimes is best taken near sunrise of sunset to give it more vibrant lighting and dramatic shadows. The idea of this image is definitely good.', '2004-05-13 09:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(716321, 75350, 5792, '<td valign="top">Your concept for this image is good. It has an intersting perspective and is framed well. The bight sky is washed out and it would be better if that were not true. Focus seems too much on the soft side. This is also resized much smaller than 640 pixels and that loses detail. Reshoot this image with a "better" sky, resized to 640 pixels on the horizontal side and judicious aplication of USM and you will be much happier with the result.</td>', 'Your concept for this image is good. It has an intersting perspective and is framed well. The bight sky is washed out and it would be better if that were not true. Focus seems too much on the soft side. This is also resized much smaller than 640 pixels and that loses detail. Reshoot this image with a "better" sky, resized to 640 pixels on the horizontal side and judicious aplication of USM and you will be much happier with the result.', '2004-05-13 09:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(716324, 75498, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nothing wrong with the idea of photographing a toilet. If the idea here was to present it at an angle it was not successful. This just looks like it is not level. Tilting the image closer to 45 degrees would have been a better perspective. A shallower front view with some sexy multicolored women''s underwear draped over it would add more interest.</td>', 'Nothing wrong with the idea of photographing a toilet. If the idea here was to present it at an angle it was not successful. This just looks like it is not level. Tilting the image closer to 45 degrees would have been a better perspective. A shallower front view with some sexy multicolored women''s underwear draped over it would add more interest.', '2004-05-13 10:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(716338, 74670, 20395, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia a lot, but the image is very out of focus. Also, I''m not sure about the lighting. The dark bottom corners bother me.</td>', 'I like the sepia a lot, but the image is very out of focus. Also, I''m not sure about the lighting. The dark bottom corners bother me.', '2004-05-13 10:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(716342, 74798, 5792, '<td valign="top">An absolutely gorgeous image. This could have won the window challenge and certainly is a top image in this challenge. The perspective and reflection make this an awesome capture. The blue tones are the finishing touch. Congrats on a stunning image.</td>', 'An absolutely gorgeous image. This could have won the window challenge and certainly is a top image in this challenge. The perspective and reflection make this an awesome capture. The blue tones are the finishing touch. Congrats on a stunning image.', '2004-05-13 10:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(716343, 75181, 16790, '<td valign="top">Stunning photograph.  The focus is excellent, and the texture and detail here are incredible.  Excellent composition!</td>', 'Stunning photograph.  The focus is excellent, and the texture and detail here are incredible.  Excellent composition!', '2004-05-13 10:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(716347, 74361, 16790, '<td valign="top">What a unique and adorable photograph... the out of focus background is a little distracting for some reason (I think it''s just the colours), but the important area of the picture is very crisp and clean, and you snapped this photo at just the right time.  Aptly named and beautifully captured.  Nice job!</td>', 'What a unique and adorable photograph... the out of focus background is a little distracting for some reason (I think it''s just the colours), but the important area of the picture is very crisp and clean, and you snapped this photo at just the right time.  Aptly named and beautifully captured.  Nice job!', '2004-05-13 10:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(716348, 74646, 16790, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clear, and beautiful.  Excellent job keeping so much detail in the shadowed areas without overexposing the sky.  The colour is superb, and the composition is well balanced.</td>', 'Crisp, clear, and beautiful.  Excellent job keeping so much detail in the shadowed areas without overexposing the sky.  The colour is superb, and the composition is well balanced.', '2004-05-13 10:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(716351, 75045, 16790, '<td valign="top">Stunning detail and colours, and the focus is perfect.  This is an amazing capture, and I think the heavy border works well with the photograph.</td>', 'Stunning detail and colours, and the focus is perfect.  This is an amazing capture, and I think the heavy border works well with the photograph.', '2004-05-13 10:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(716358, 75449, 16790, '<td valign="top">Stunning detail and superb focus.  The colours are gorgeous.  Beautiful job!</td>', 'Stunning detail and superb focus.  The colours are gorgeous.  Beautiful job!', '2004-05-13 10:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(716359, 75098, 16790, '<td valign="top">The composition of this photo is nice, but here are the problems I have with it.  The highlights are blown out, and there appears to be some damage to the quality from compression.  Was this cropped from a larger photograph?  It might have looked better sized down a bit.  The colour also feels a tad cool, but overall this would have been a much better photograph had the lighting been more ideal, and had the noise/pixelation been eliminated or minimized.  Maybe try retaking this at another time of day :)</td>', 'The composition of this photo is nice, but here are the problems I have with it.  The highlights are blown out, and there appears to be some damage to the quality from compression.  Was this cropped from a larger photograph?  It might have looked better sized down a bit.  The colour also feels a tad cool, but overall this would have been a much better photograph had the lighting been more ideal, and had the noise/pixelation been eliminated or minimized.  Maybe try retaking this at another time of day :)', '2004-05-13 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(716361, 75369, 21317, '<td valign="top">Like it a lot</td>', 'Like it a lot', '2004-05-13 10:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(716362, 75360, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is a very lovely photograph, but it looks overprocessed to me, or at least overly soft.  I think it would look nicer with a bit more crispness; the colour is excellent, and the view is gorgeous, though.</td>', 'This is a very lovely photograph, but it looks overprocessed to me, or at least overly soft.  I think it would look nicer with a bit more crispness; the colour is excellent, and the view is gorgeous, though.', '2004-05-13 10:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(716365, 75267, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty photograph, but it looks a bit noisy/pixelated, and the colours are a tad cool, like it was perhaps taken on a foggy day or in early evening.  (I''m used to such days myself.)  The detail is slightly lacking, I think because of the noise.</td>', 'This is a pretty photograph, but it looks a bit noisy/pixelated, and the colours are a tad cool, like it was perhaps taken on a foggy day or in early evening.  (I''m used to such days myself.)  The detail is slightly lacking, I think because of the noise.', '2004-05-13 11:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(716372, 75273, 16790, '<td valign="top">I like this picture quite a lot, but am not fond of the selective blue toning.  It makes the child look a bit.... Smurfy.  All over black and white, or perhaps a mild sepia toning, would have done wonders, I think, especially considering the tone set by the title.  The composition itself is great, and the focus seems nice and crisp.</td>', 'I like this picture quite a lot, but am not fond of the selective blue toning.  It makes the child look a bit.... Smurfy.  All over black and white, or perhaps a mild sepia toning, would have done wonders, I think, especially considering the tone set by the title.  The composition itself is great, and the focus seems nice and crisp.', '2004-05-13 11:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(716376, 75480, 16790, '<td valign="top">The photo itself is good, but I think this is one instance where a neutral background takes away from the subject a bit.  If the woman stood out more from the background, or there was some dramatic lighting or colour, I think it would help convey more of a sense of strength.  Just my opinion :)</td>', 'The photo itself is good, but I think this is one instance where a neutral background takes away from the subject a bit.  If the woman stood out more from the background, or there was some dramatic lighting or colour, I think it would help convey more of a sense of strength.  Just my opinion :)', '2004-05-13 11:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(716511, 75369, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image. I like the soft glow around the trees and ground. Very nice image.</td>', 'This is a very nice image. I like the soft glow around the trees and ground. Very nice image.', '2004-05-13 13:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(716514, 74259, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the soft look to this image. The colors are very rich and vibrant. This is a very lovely scene.</td>', 'I like the soft look to this image. The colors are very rich and vibrant. This is a very lovely scene.', '2004-05-13 13:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(716516, 75526, 6845, '<td valign="top">I just love this photo. Great expression on her face, the soft light, the frozen water droplets, just a great image. I hope it does well.</td>', 'I just love this photo. Great expression on her face, the soft light, the frozen water droplets, just a great image. I hope it does well.', '2004-05-13 13:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(716518, 75360, 6845, '<td valign="top">Very nice landscape shot. I really find the colors and the soft glow very pleasing.</td>', 'Very nice landscape shot. I really find the colors and the soft glow very pleasing.', '2004-05-13 13:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(716520, 74645, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a great graphic image. It is just fun for me to look at.</td>', 'This is a great graphic image. It is just fun for me to look at.', '2004-05-13 13:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(716522, 75515, 6845, '<td valign="top">Great focus and expression. This is a great moment captured.</td>', 'Great focus and expression. This is a great moment captured.', '2004-05-13 13:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(716526, 74979, 6845, '<td valign="top">This looks a little soft, and the colors could be a little richer, maybe some more saturation, but other than that it is a nice image. I like the composition  and the dof is good.</td>', 'This looks a little soft, and the colors could be a little richer, maybe some more saturation, but other than that it is a nice image. I like the composition  and the dof is good.', '2004-05-13 13:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(716528, 75180, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like the choice of selective color here. It really adds an element to this image that I don''t think would otherwise be there.</td>', 'I really like the choice of selective color here. It really adds an element to this image that I don''t think would otherwise be there.', '2004-05-13 13:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
