(717822, 75524, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection, nice detail, incredible contrast with the reflection of the trees (?) on the water.  The only thing I would wish for would be for the duck to be swimming with more sun on it''s face.</td>', 'Nice reflection, nice detail, incredible contrast with the reflection of the trees (?) on the water.  The only thing I would wish for would be for the duck to be swimming with more sun on it''s face.', '2004-05-14 02:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(717823, 75480, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but she looks too posed.  But I think if you had her actually lift that weight 10 times or so, and snap the shot on the first lift she strained on you would have a better expression.  Other than that, the earrings just do not seem to go with the whole gym subject.</td>', 'Nice idea, but she looks too posed.  But I think if you had her actually lift that weight 10 times or so, and snap the shot on the first lift she strained on you would have a better expression.  Other than that, the earrings just do not seem to go with the whole gym subject.', '2004-05-14 03:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(717825, 74379, 18722, '<td valign="top">Hmm, second ''moon'' this challenge.  Seems to be popular.</td>', 'Hmm, second ''moon'' this challenge.  Seems to be popular.', '2004-05-14 03:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(717826, 75536, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nicely camoflauged, but I wish the straw was not so disorderly.  Yeah I know, It''s dried grass, what are you going to do, but it would still be nice if it added to the composition instead of taking from it.</td>', 'Nicely camoflauged, but I wish the straw was not so disorderly.  Yeah I know, It''s dried grass, what are you going to do, but it would still be nice if it added to the composition instead of taking from it.', '2004-05-14 03:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(717827, 75201, 18722, '<td valign="top">I think more light, so you could use a shorter shutter speed to reduce the motion blur woud have helped.</td>', 'I think more light, so you could use a shorter shutter speed to reduce the motion blur woud have helped.', '2004-05-14 03:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(717828, 75315, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but two things detract from this shot for me.  There is a blade of grass in the center forground that is outside the DOF (much closer to you) that is distracting and is unfortunately does not contrast very well.  The second is pehaps a personal preference, but I would have waited until one of them looked up (best of all, looked in my direction).</td>', 'Nice shot, but two things detract from this shot for me.  There is a blade of grass in the center forground that is outside the DOF (much closer to you) that is distracting and is unfortunately does not contrast very well.  The second is pehaps a personal preference, but I would have waited until one of them looked up (best of all, looked in my direction).', '2004-05-14 03:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(717829, 75288, 18722, '<td valign="top">Very nice sunset.  However, the near vertical clouds on the right and the near horizontal clouds just down from the top on the left (contrails perhaps) defeat the composition.  Using these as natural guidelines, and cropping just inside them, would have made a much more dramatic shot.</td>', 'Very nice sunset.  However, the near vertical clouds on the right and the near horizontal clouds just down from the top on the left (contrails perhaps) defeat the composition.  Using these as natural guidelines, and cropping just inside them, would have made a much more dramatic shot.', '2004-05-14 03:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(717830, 75115, 11078, '<td valign="top">This looks like a winner for sure I just love the way you have captured them<br/>Nice detail tone and focus 8</td>', 'This looks like a winner for sure I just love the way you have captured themNice detail tone and focus 8', '2004-05-14 03:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(717831, 75180, 18722, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, with a nice color matching between the walker and the scene.  The only dowside is the starkly white sky on the left.</td>', 'Very pretty, with a nice color matching between the walker and the scene.  The only dowside is the starkly white sky on the left.', '2004-05-14 03:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(717832, 75574, 11078, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colour I like the bottom part but the top is a bit dull Great idea and nice focus</td>', 'Beautiful colour I like the bottom part but the top is a bit dull Great idea and nice focus', '2004-05-14 03:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(717833, 75498, 18722, '<td valign="top">Would you believe it is the tilt that killed this photo for me.</td>', 'Would you believe it is the tilt that killed this photo for me.', '2004-05-14 03:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(717834, 75472, 11078, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well done nice focus colour and originality</td>', 'Great idea and well done nice focus colour and originality', '2004-05-14 03:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(717835, 75634, 18722, '<td valign="top">While the scene looks ok, the boy seems a bit washed out.</td>', 'While the scene looks ok, the boy seems a bit washed out.', '2004-05-14 03:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(717836, 75382, 11078, '<td valign="top">Great abstract and nice colour detail and tone but not all that interesting as an image 7</td>', 'Great abstract and nice colour detail and tone but not all that interesting as an image 7', '2004-05-14 03:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(717837, 75254, 18722, '<td valign="top">I think he sees you as well.</td>', 'I think he sees you as well.', '2004-05-14 03:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(717838, 75234, 11078, '<td valign="top">Spooky! I''ve heard of ''the hills are alive'' but maybe the trees are as well! <br/>Nice capture detail and nice find the only thing I find a bit distracting is the light seems a bit on the bright side at the top <br/>Very original 7</td>', 'Spooky! I''ve heard of ''the hills are alive'' but maybe the trees are as well! Nice capture detail and nice find the only thing I find a bit distracting is the light seems a bit on the bright side at the top Very original 7', '2004-05-14 03:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(717839, 75307, 18722, '<td valign="top">Tilting the image a bit to have the subject (the locomotive) straight would have given this a stronger composition.</td>', 'Tilting the image a bit to have the subject (the locomotive) straight would have given this a stronger composition.', '2004-05-14 03:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(717841, 75553, 18722, '<td valign="top">Taking the photo a little earlier (if sunrise) or a bit later (if sunset) would have provided more of glow to the sky, instead of just overexposing the sun.</td>', 'Taking the photo a little earlier (if sunrise) or a bit later (if sunset) would have provided more of glow to the sky, instead of just overexposing the sun.', '2004-05-14 03:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(717842, 75289, 11078, '<td valign="top">Nicely done with the negative space. <br/>The detail, focus  lightings also great. but it is not that interesting as an image in itself to me. 7</td>', 'Nicely done with the negative space. The detail, focus  lightings also great. but it is not that interesting as an image in itself to me. 7', '2004-05-14 03:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(717843, 75576, 11078, '<td valign="top">This must be an unusual find I have never seen them like this, so extra points for that plus detail and focus good I would like to see them closer but then that only my preference 8</td>', 'This must be an unusual find I have never seen them like this, so extra points for that plus detail and focus good I would like to see them closer but then that only my preference 8', '2004-05-14 03:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(717845, 75185, 18722, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better in landscape orientation.  The thorns of the cactus (on the left) direct my eyes to the left, only to run into an abrupt crop.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better in landscape orientation.  The thorns of the cactus (on the left) direct my eyes to the left, only to run into an abrupt crop.', '2004-05-14 03:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(717846, 75254, 11078, '<td valign="top">Nice image  lovely dog</td>', 'Nice image  lovely dog', '2004-05-14 03:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(717848, 75541, 11078, '<td valign="top">This is very unusual and nicely captured</td>', 'This is very unusual and nicely captured', '2004-05-14 03:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(717849, 75418, 18722, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop would have worked better, I think.</td>', 'A tighter crop would have worked better, I think.', '2004-05-14 03:38:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(717850, 75181, 18722, '<td valign="top">Too bad the elephant is not facing you.</td>', 'Too bad the elephant is not facing you.', '2004-05-14 03:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(717852, 75289, 18722, '<td valign="top">The perspective is a bit off, should have been shot from straight on, I think.</td>', 'The perspective is a bit off, should have been shot from straight on, I think.', '2004-05-14 03:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(717853, 75393, 11078, '<td valign="top">I like this image very much the greens are lovely but the fence seems wierd <br/>nice detail and focus 8</td>', 'I like this image very much the greens are lovely but the fence seems wierd nice detail and focus 8', '2004-05-14 03:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(717855, 75274, 18722, '<td valign="top">I think having more water drops would have helped.  Good focus and use of light, but I wish the DOF was a little tighter (specifically to reduce the effect of the sticks in the upper-right.  Did you consider a diagonal crop to eliminate them?</td>', 'I think having more water drops would have helped.  Good focus and use of light, but I wish the DOF was a little tighter (specifically to reduce the effect of the sticks in the upper-right.  Did you consider a diagonal crop to eliminate them?', '2004-05-14 03:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(717858, 75515, 18722, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF, but it is a shame the left side of her face and shirt are blown out.</td>', 'Great use of DOF, but it is a shame the left side of her face and shirt are blown out.', '2004-05-14 03:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(717859, 75528, 18722, '<td valign="top">The dark shadow on the old tree kills the vibrant colors of the scene.</td>', 'The dark shadow on the old tree kills the vibrant colors of the scene.', '2004-05-14 03:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(717860, 75630, 18722, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus and vibrant color.  The browns in the lower-left are distracting however.</td>', 'Very nice focus and vibrant color.  The browns in the lower-left are distracting however.', '2004-05-14 03:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(717862, 75100, 18722, '<td valign="top">A bit dark, particularly the rose.  It''s a shame, as it was a nice idea.</td>', 'A bit dark, particularly the rose.  It''s a shame, as it was a nice idea.', '2004-05-14 03:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(717863, 75094, 18722, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is superb.</td>', 'The lighting on this is superb.', '2004-05-14 03:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(717864, 75327, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  The reflections on the lower-right bead of water look like a dragon about to hatch.</td>', 'Nice macro.  The reflections on the lower-right bead of water look like a dragon about to hatch.', '2004-05-14 04:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(717865, 75398, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice stop-motion on the waterdrops, but unfortunately, that seems to be the only thing going on.</td>', 'Nice stop-motion on the waterdrops, but unfortunately, that seems to be the only thing going on.', '2004-05-14 04:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(717866, 75488, 18722, '<td valign="top">The tilt should have been removed.</td>', 'The tilt should have been removed.', '2004-05-14 04:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(717869, 75377, 18722, '<td valign="top">The iris seems to be mainly in shadow, putting more light on it would be better.</td>', 'The iris seems to be mainly in shadow, putting more light on it would be better.', '2004-05-14 04:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(717871, 75393, 18722, '<td valign="top">Looking more down the road would have controlled the viewers eyes better.  As it is, the fence is the subject, with the road a minor thing off to the side.</td>', 'Looking more down the road would have controlled the viewers eyes better.  As it is, the fence is the subject, with the road a minor thing off to the side.', '2004-05-14 04:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(717872, 75532, 18722, '<td valign="top">The crop is a bit too tight.  A landscape orientation may have worked better.</td>', 'The crop is a bit too tight.  A landscape orientation may have worked better.', '2004-05-14 04:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(717897, 75602, 21388, '<td valign="top">excellent shot<br/> <br/>I wonder if it would have been good to show the whole glass</td>', 'excellent shot I wonder if it would have been good to show the whole glass', '2004-05-14 06:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(717898, 75549, 21388, '<td valign="top">pretty shot<br/> <br/>It is a pitty the brown spot  on the left</td>', 'pretty shot It is a pitty the brown spot  on the left', '2004-05-14 06:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(717899, 75045, 21388, '<td valign="top">I love the colours and light.</td>', 'I love the colours and light.', '2004-05-14 06:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(717900, 75602, 16004, '<td valign="top">I gave two 10s in this challenge, and this is one of them.  This is a perfect example of a perfect shot - the timing of your captured is absolutely superb - one can only imagine how many attempts it took to get it (so go you for a display of commitment).  The monotone / blue appearance is also different but works well.  this truly is a fabulous picture, definitely a ribbon contender, and well done!</td>', 'I gave two 10s in this challenge, and this is one of them.  This is a perfect example of a perfect shot - the timing of your captured is absolutely superb - one can only imagine how many attempts it took to get it (so go you for a display of commitment).  The monotone / blue appearance is also different but works well.  this truly is a fabulous picture, definitely a ribbon contender, and well done!', '2004-05-14 06:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(717901, 75399, 21388, '<td valign="top">Precious landscape. Good composition</td>', 'Precious landscape. Good composition', '2004-05-14 06:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(717902, 75416, 21388, '<td valign="top">It is original</td>', 'It is original', '2004-05-14 06:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(717904, 74763, 21388, '<td valign="top">I love colours in this picture.<br/> <br/>Maybe some crop down of it??</td>', 'I love colours in this picture. Maybe some crop down of it??', '2004-05-14 06:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(717905, 75498, 21388, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I don''t understand what you mean.</td>', 'Sorry but I don''t understand what you mean.', '2004-05-14 07:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(717906, 75496, 21388, '<td valign="top">sorry but I do not feel good with the colours. It seems as not naturals.</td>', 'sorry but I do not feel good with the colours. It seems as not naturals.', '2004-05-14 07:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(717907, 74665, 21388, '<td valign="top">Beatiful landscape. <br/>I like so much the misty light and the waves on the water. Maybe the trees should no be so centered? I think you could have improved the composition a little bit.</td>', 'Beatiful landscape. I like so much the misty light and the waves on the water. Maybe the trees should no be so centered? I think you could have improved the composition a little bit.', '2004-05-14 07:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(717908, 75551, 21388, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and very original topic</td>', 'Nice colours and very original topic', '2004-05-14 07:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(717911, 75398, 21388, '<td valign="top">It is really fantastic.<br/> <br/>Maybe the picture would improve if the animals fits more the picture. I am waiting for  seeing  the head over the waterline....</td>', 'It is really fantastic. Maybe the picture would improve if the animals fits more the picture. I am waiting for  seeing  the head over the waterline....', '2004-05-14 07:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(717920, 75315, 21388, '<td valign="top">It is nice but I would like to look at them to the face...</td>', 'It is nice but I would like to look at them to the face...', '2004-05-14 07:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(717923, 75176, 21388, '<td valign="top">Nice, maye some crop at the bottom</td>', 'Nice, maye some crop at the bottom', '2004-05-14 07:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
