(717928, 75396, 21388, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2004-05-14 07:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(717931, 74780, 21388, '<td valign="top">I like the colour constrast. <br/> <br/>Maybe the upper part of the picture is not worthy. In my opinion some crop would improve it.</td>', 'I like the colour constrast.  Maybe the upper part of the picture is not worthy. In my opinion some crop would improve it.', '2004-05-14 07:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(717932, 75537, 21388, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours, light and composition 7</td>', 'Very nice colours, light and composition 7', '2004-05-14 07:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(717935, 75289, 16004, '<td valign="top">This was only one of two 10s i awarded this week.  For something seemingly simple, i found the image very striking and particularly appealing.  the red is very bold and the lighting from the side is very effective.  The white walls are brilliantly bare, and quite frankly, the whole thing is a joy to behold.  I have a tiniest slight reservation about the sign, but that can''t really be helped, and the way you cropped it makes the sign not very overbearing.  very excellent picture.</td>', 'This was only one of two 10s i awarded this week.  For something seemingly simple, i found the image very striking and particularly appealing.  the red is very bold and the lighting from the side is very effective.  The white walls are brilliantly bare, and quite frankly, the whole thing is a joy to behold.  I have a tiniest slight reservation about the sign, but that can''t really be helped, and the way you cropped it makes the sign not very overbearing.  very excellent picture.', '2004-05-14 07:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(717940, 75490, 16004, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what it is, but i normally hate baby shots.  it''s a matter of principal perhaps, it''s kind of a cross between blatant showing off, usually of snapshot quality and a dire lack of originality with no evidence of forethought.  whereas this is completely opposite to the norm and is totally fantastic.  truly, the only great baby shot ever.  The expression on the sprog is, though a bit on the mad / insane side, is riotuous and fantastic.  Also, technically, the quality of the shot is one of the best of the week.  Getting a living thing this sharp and clean is very difficult (i find), and this is flawless.  9.</td>', 'Don''t know what it is, but i normally hate baby shots.  it''s a matter of principal perhaps, it''s kind of a cross between blatant showing off, usually of snapshot quality and a dire lack of originality with no evidence of forethought.  whereas this is completely opposite to the norm and is totally fantastic.  truly, the only great baby shot ever.  The expression on the sprog is, though a bit on the mad / insane side, is riotuous and fantastic.  Also, technically, the quality of the shot is one of the best of the week.  Getting a living thing this sharp and clean is very difficult (i find), and this is flawless.  9.', '2004-05-14 08:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(717942, 75185, 18450, '<td valign="top">love the composition and dof...also  the contrast between the lines of the cactus and the thorns.</td>', 'love the composition and dof...also  the contrast between the lines of the cactus and the thorns.', '2004-05-14 08:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(717945, 75177, 18450, '<td valign="top">like this idea but would have preferred a more interesting view</td>', 'like this idea but would have preferred a more interesting view', '2004-05-14 08:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(717949, 75541, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice and calming!!  The two people positioned where they are is a great idea!  Full marks!</td>', 'Very nice and calming!!  The two people positioned where they are is a great idea!  Full marks!', '2004-05-14 08:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(717950, 75327, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really like this, good DOF and the clarity in the two droplets is great.  The only thing I would have liked different it so have seen less of the white glare in the droplets.</td>', 'Really like this, good DOF and the clarity in the two droplets is great.  The only thing I would have liked different it so have seen less of the white glare in the droplets.', '2004-05-14 08:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(717953, 75515, 10170, '<td valign="top">Too cute for words, just look at that smile!  Excellent photo, it has really captured an exciting moment well.  Great stuff.</td>', 'Too cute for words, just look at that smile!  Excellent photo, it has really captured an exciting moment well.  Great stuff.', '2004-05-14 08:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(717988, 75185, 21019, '<td valign="top">good pic</td>', 'good pic', '2004-05-14 10:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(718112, 75349, 9441, '<td valign="top">beautiful clear shot!  Such a smooth feel to this photograph....and what a wonderful view, you captured it beautifully.....</td>', 'beautiful clear shot!  Such a smooth feel to this photograph....and what a wonderful view, you captured it beautifully.....', '2004-05-14 11:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(718114, 75449, 9441, '<td valign="top">oh wow!  You captured this very nicely!  The clarity of the fly is awesome and the blurriness of the background is just as it should be.  You did an excellent job here....</td>', 'oh wow!  You captured this very nicely!  The clarity of the fly is awesome and the blurriness of the background is just as it should be.  You did an excellent job here....', '2004-05-14 11:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(718122, 75163, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice focus, good clear shot of the bug....</td>', 'nice focus, good clear shot of the bug....', '2004-05-14 11:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(718129, 75460, 9441, '<td valign="top">this is a sad picture...but a wonderfully clear one at that.  Nice job....<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-09 22:05:59.</i></td>', 'this is a sad picture...but a wonderfully clear one at that.  Nice job....', '2004-05-14 11:52:22.000000', '2004-06-09 23:05:59.000000', 1),
(718133, 75526, 9441, '<td valign="top">captured beautifully!  Awesome job!</td>', 'captured beautifully!  Awesome job!', '2004-05-14 11:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(718137, 75619, 9441, '<td valign="top">I love this picture!  It''s crisp and clear, and the color is great!  I love the subject matter!</td>', 'I love this picture!  It''s crisp and clear, and the color is great!  I love the subject matter!', '2004-05-14 12:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(718142, 75204, 9441, '<td valign="top">oh wow!  Tremendous capture!!!!  This is an awesome shot...and a wonderfully clear one at that!  I have to give a 10!</td>', 'oh wow!  Tremendous capture!!!!  This is an awesome shot...and a wonderfully clear one at that!  I have to give a 10!', '2004-05-14 12:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(718144, 75573, 9441, '<td valign="top">very nice DOF, and the reflections are great!  Nice color and clarity also....</td>', 'very nice DOF, and the reflections are great!  Nice color and clarity also....', '2004-05-14 12:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(718151, 75597, 2764, '<td valign="top">ugh - border 6<br/></td>', 'ugh - border 6', '2004-05-14 12:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(718235, 75543, 16106, '<td valign="top">Reread rules, rescored shot, revised comment. Nice shot well framed with perhaps a bit too saturated a sky for my taste. I find the grass in the lower right distracting, but if you cropped it above that the rocks wouldn''t work nearly as well.</td>', 'Reread rules, rescored shot, revised comment. Nice shot well framed with perhaps a bit too saturated a sky for my taste. I find the grass in the lower right distracting, but if you cropped it above that the rocks wouldn''t work nearly as well.', '2004-05-14 12:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(718242, 75526, 16106, '<td valign="top">beautifull exposure, good crop, focus and colors, but just a bit too stagey. I don''t really know why but it looks as if the subject is reacting to the situation for the camera. Hard to explain why this bothers me; other than that it is fine in every reguard.</td>', 'beautifull exposure, good crop, focus and colors, but just a bit too stagey. I don''t really know why but it looks as if the subject is reacting to the situation for the camera. Hard to explain why this bothers me; other than that it is fine in every reguard.', '2004-05-14 12:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(718252, 75583, 16106, '<td valign="top">you loose detail in the sky and the shadows , perhaps a polarising filter would have darkened the sky a bit, but I find myself squinting into this shot to try to see details that aren''t there. I also find the crop a bit too tight on the bottom given the space above the tree tip. Nice sense of place and quite though.</td>', 'you loose detail in the sky and the shadows , perhaps a polarising filter would have darkened the sky a bit, but I find myself squinting into this shot to try to see details that aren''t there. I also find the crop a bit too tight on the bottom given the space above the tree tip. Nice sense of place and quite though.', '2004-05-14 12:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(718256, 75398, 16106, '<td valign="top">shame the one who isn''t splashing isn''t head up; would have helped a very nice shot be even better</td>', 'shame the one who isn''t splashing isn''t head up; would have helped a very nice shot be even better', '2004-05-14 12:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(718266, 75408, 16106, '<td valign="top">the crop is a bit tight, I would like to see black at the top of the flame, and either show the reflection in all its glory or shoot it on somthing that is less reflective, as it is it just distracts from the overall composition. Great lighting on the glass while maintaining a full color spectrum on the flame, tough job to do and you did that part very well.</td>', 'the crop is a bit tight, I would like to see black at the top of the flame, and either show the reflection in all its glory or shoot it on somthing that is less reflective, as it is it just distracts from the overall composition. Great lighting on the glass while maintaining a full color spectrum on the flame, tough job to do and you did that part very well.', '2004-05-14 12:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(718273, 74866, 16106, '<td valign="top">one of the few borders I have ever seen that helps the shot. strong composition, the curves of the branch seem to echo the head feathers. top notch.</td>', 'one of the few borders I have ever seen that helps the shot. strong composition, the curves of the branch seem to echo the head feathers. top notch.', '2004-05-14 12:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
