(718295, 75632, 16106, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, quite evocative. great B&amp;W conversion. composition bothers me a bit, I find it the weakest part of a fine shot. The window on the right runs parralell while the one on the left slants out of the frame silghtly and the heavy base of the sidewalk has no compensating cap to stop the eye from sliding off the top of the picture while they follow the vertical lines upward.  Still, nice shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot, quite evocative. great B&W conversion. composition bothers me a bit, I find it the weakest part of a fine shot. The window on the right runs parralell while the one on the left slants out of the frame silghtly and the heavy base of the sidewalk has no compensating cap to stop the eye from sliding off the top of the picture while they follow the vertical lines upward.  Still, nice shot.', '2004-05-14 13:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
