(718536, 75555, 327, '<td valign="top">Not sure where you took this....but I know Scottish Broom when I see it. OREGON is full of it and it''s taking over in some areas. Pretty but kills native plants. Love your shot, very nice composition.</td>', 'Not sure where you took this....but I know Scottish Broom when I see it. OREGON is full of it and it''s taking over in some areas. Pretty but kills native plants. Love your shot, very nice composition.', '2004-05-14 15:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(718538, 75545, 16004, '<td valign="top">Interesting alternative to a seemingly site favourite effect-type shot...  using a picture of the earth is a good idea - however, the droplets don''t to me appear large or frequent enough to have a great startling impact.  the image of the earth is very clear  - i initially thought the place you''d never been before was outer space!  overall, the concept is good, the actual carrying out not as WOW as it might have been...  5.</td>', 'Interesting alternative to a seemingly site favourite effect-type shot...  using a picture of the earth is a good idea - however, the droplets don''t to me appear large or frequent enough to have a great startling impact.  the image of the earth is very clear  - i initially thought the place you''d never been before was outer space!  overall, the concept is good, the actual carrying out not as WOW as it might have been...  5.', '2004-05-14 15:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(718540, 75640, 327, '<td valign="top">I think to improve this shot you''d have to remove some of the clutter. Too much going on for the eye to stop. The focus, light, color.....all good. Just seems messy to me. The blue whale is the key.</td>', 'I think to improve this shot you''d have to remove some of the clutter. Too much going on for the eye to stop. The focus, light, color.....all good. Just seems messy to me. The blue whale is the key.', '2004-05-14 15:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
