(718549, 74627, 13136, '<td valign="top">You know, I''ve been looking at this picture several times for extended periods over the last few days, and I still can''t figure it out. It looks like a bed with large pills on it and a bag with a bright light coming out the opening. Whether this is new to you or not, it is definitely new to me. I''m just not sure (considering I don''t know what it is) whether I like it or not. Add points for originality. The most unusual shot I''ve seen in a long time. Looks like the cover to a fantansy book. I guess I''ll give it an 8.</td>', 'You know, I''ve been looking at this picture several times for extended periods over the last few days, and I still can''t figure it out. It looks like a bed with large pills on it and a bag with a bright light coming out the opening. Whether this is new to you or not, it is definitely new to me. I''m just not sure (considering I don''t know what it is) whether I like it or not. Add points for originality. The most unusual shot I''ve seen in a long time. Looks like the cover to a fantansy book. I guess I''ll give it an 8.', '2004-05-14 15:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(718552, 75539, 6532, '<td valign="top">Wow this is awesome - quiet an abstract....looks like a Monet.</td>', 'Wow this is awesome - quiet an abstract....looks like a Monet.', '2004-05-14 15:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(718553, 75574, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  You have some nasty noise on the left side.  I would have tilted the image a bit to get the water falling in a more natural-looking manner; as it is it looks as if it is being blown sideways by a strong wind, but nothing else indicates a wind present.</td>', 'Nice colors.  You have some nasty noise on the left side.  I would have tilted the image a bit to get the water falling in a more natural-looking manner; as it is it looks as if it is being blown sideways by a strong wind, but nothing else indicates a wind present.', '2004-05-14 15:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(718555, 75535, 16004, '<td valign="top">The red lighting is a decent part of this picture, but it is unfortunate that the long exposure (or however you got the ghost effect) kind of diminishes the impact.  it''s very difficult to determine what''s going on.  indeed there seems to be too much.  neatimage would reduce the amount of noise in the picture (the kind of speckly effect) and it might have improved if you opted to focus more on the girl or the lad on the left...</td>', 'The red lighting is a decent part of this picture, but it is unfortunate that the long exposure (or however you got the ghost effect) kind of diminishes the impact.  it''s very difficult to determine what''s going on.  indeed there seems to be too much.  neatimage would reduce the amount of noise in the picture (the kind of speckly effect) and it might have improved if you opted to focus more on the girl or the lad on the left...', '2004-05-14 15:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(718561, 75632, 18722, '<td valign="top">I like the window with the flowers in it and think it would have been better with just that; flowers framed by the window.</td>', 'I like the window with the flowers in it and think it would have been better with just that; flowers framed by the window.', '2004-05-14 15:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
