(718617, 74259, 16608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2004-05-14 16:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(718620, 75201, 16004, '<td valign="top">I really like this one a fair bit.  the choice of location is brilliant, the lighting really urban and the shape of the tunnel draws your attention to the centre subject.  this would be perfect for the new members challenge.  i think i would have tried  again with a slightly shorter exposure so we can see the ball a little better - without the titles guidance it''s unclear as to what''s happening.  however, the B&amp;W works really well, and in all, very very likeable.  hope it does well - 8.</td>', 'I really like this one a fair bit.  the choice of location is brilliant, the lighting really urban and the shape of the tunnel draws your attention to the centre subject.  this would be perfect for the new members challenge.  i think i would have tried  again with a slightly shorter exposure so we can see the ball a little better - without the titles guidance it''s unclear as to what''s happening.  however, the B&W works really well, and in all, very very likeable.  hope it does well - 8.', '2004-05-14 16:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(718623, 75306, 17065, '<td valign="top">I think this one would benefit from a bit wider DOF so the tail of the ... thing... would also be in focus. But then again, that is assuming you have all the time in the world to manage all the controls of your camera before the animal runs off... Still a good catch with neat textures. 8</td>', 'I think this one would benefit from a bit wider DOF so the tail of the ... thing... would also be in focus. But then again, that is assuming you have all the time in the world to manage all the controls of your camera before the animal runs off... Still a good catch with neat textures. 8', '2004-05-14 16:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(718631, 75620, 17065, '<td valign="top">Harmonic colors and nice framing. 9</td>', 'Harmonic colors and nice framing. 9', '2004-05-14 16:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(718632, 75533, 16608, '<td valign="top">Great title!!!  LOL and amen.</td>', 'Great title!!!  LOL and amen.', '2004-05-14 16:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(718637, 75568, 16608, '<td valign="top">Good one. tee hee.</td>', 'Good one. tee hee.', '2004-05-14 16:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(718639, 75390, 16608, '<td valign="top">Interesting .... but I confess, I have no idea what this is.</td>', 'Interesting .... but I confess, I have no idea what this is.', '2004-05-14 16:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(718642, 75519, 17065, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in this one. You should have cloned out the white spot in the sky though.<br/>Can''t decide whether I like or dislike that the entire top right part is empty... Hmm I just decided that I like it because it made me stop and think about it. <br/></td>', 'Nice colors in this one. You should have cloned out the white spot in the sky though.Can''t decide whether I like or dislike that the entire top right part is empty... Hmm I just decided that I like it because it made me stop and think about it. ', '2004-05-14 16:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(718644, 75527, 16004, '<td valign="top">No doubt joining the unseen bandwagon, but you should have done this for the proportion challenge...  It''s kind of cute.  did you try the same set up indoors?  I only ask because the whiteness on the near shaker is a little too intense - indoors you could control the lighting a bit and with darker lighting, might have picked up a granular appearance of the salt.  you have done a good job of hiding from the reflective chrome surfaces though - i quite impressed by that.  7.</td>', 'No doubt joining the unseen bandwagon, but you should have done this for the proportion challenge...  It''s kind of cute.  did you try the same set up indoors?  I only ask because the whiteness on the near shaker is a little too intense - indoors you could control the lighting a bit and with darker lighting, might have picked up a granular appearance of the salt.  you have done a good job of hiding from the reflective chrome surfaces though - i quite impressed by that.  7.', '2004-05-14 16:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(718648, 75064, 16608, '<td valign="top">creative ... and original.  Oh for a feather.  good job.</td>', 'creative ... and original.  Oh for a feather.  good job.', '2004-05-14 16:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(718649, 75545, 17065, '<td valign="top">2 words: Far out! Sorry couldn''t resist. <br/>The fact that the earth is slightly out of focus strengthens the illusion. Very nice!</td>', '2 words: Far out! Sorry couldn''t resist. The fact that the earth is slightly out of focus strengthens the illusion. Very nice!', '2004-05-14 16:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(718653, 75185, 17065, '<td valign="top">I actually miss the colors in this one, and I think you should have cropped away more of the background.</td>', 'I actually miss the colors in this one, and I think you should have cropped away more of the background.', '2004-05-14 16:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(718662, 75568, 18191, '<td valign="top">hehe funny</td>', 'hehe funny', '2004-05-14 16:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(718663, 75599, 18191, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like a zoom burst effect...really cool!</td>', 'This almost looks like a zoom burst effect...really cool!', '2004-05-14 16:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(718665, 75240, 18191, '<td valign="top">The background is too out of focus for a landscape for me</td>', 'The background is too out of focus for a landscape for me', '2004-05-14 16:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(718753, 75538, 16004, '<td valign="top">WOWSER!  where on (or off) earth was this taken?  this is a fab picture...  i do personally prefer the bottom half though - i think the expanse of water and the landmass in the background is a little surplus.  if i were you i might have been inclined to take advantage of the great detail you''ve captured on the buildings and focus on them.  it almost looks like a real screenshot from simcity!  i love the closest buildings.  what city is this?  v. good - 8.</td>', 'WOWSER!  where on (or off) earth was this taken?  this is a fab picture...  i do personally prefer the bottom half though - i think the expanse of water and the landmass in the background is a little surplus.  if i were you i might have been inclined to take advantage of the great detail you''ve captured on the buildings and focus on them.  it almost looks like a real screenshot from simcity!  i love the closest buildings.  what city is this?  v. good - 8.', '2004-05-14 17:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(718830, 75532, 6532, '<td valign="top">I usually like borders but this one is kinda drab!  Maybe a darker one would be more effective.  Photo seems a bit washed out as well.  Nice try.</td>', 'I usually like borders but this one is kinda drab!  Maybe a darker one would be more effective.  Photo seems a bit washed out as well.  Nice try.', '2004-05-14 17:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(718835, 74866, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Great color and composition.</td>', 'Nice.  Great color and composition.', '2004-05-14 17:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(718841, 75528, 6532, '<td valign="top">Definitely a ribbon!!!!</td>', 'Definitely a ribbon!!!!', '2004-05-14 17:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(718842, 75417, 6532, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful macro.  Good Luck.  One of my top picks!</td>', 'This is a wonderful macro.  Good Luck.  One of my top picks!', '2004-05-14 17:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(718957, 75490, 19184, '<td valign="top">Cute baby, but if that is your baby I can''t imagine that this would be something new.  I would have a million photos of my baby if I had one.  Good photo though.<br/> <br/>Added:  Well I guess I read the challenge wrong, said something you haven''t entered before in a place where you haven''t taken a photo.  Well I have no idea where you took this and if you ever taken one there before.  Anyway took away a point cause I first thought you didn''t meet the challenge, adding it back now :)</td>', 'Cute baby, but if that is your baby I can''t imagine that this would be something new.  I would have a million photos of my baby if I had one.  Good photo though. Added:  Well I guess I read the challenge wrong, said something you haven''t entered before in a place where you haven''t taken a photo.  Well I have no idea where you took this and if you ever taken one there before.  Anyway took away a point cause I first thought you didn''t meet the challenge, adding it back now :)', '2004-05-14 19:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(718974, 75533, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellent stop action capture at a great moment. Great focus and color. The background building building makes it appear there is no where for the biker to land except into it''s side.  You should be very pleased with this image. It is one of the best of this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent stop action capture at a great moment. Great focus and color. The background building building makes it appear there is no where for the biker to land except into it''s side.  You should be very pleased with this image. It is one of the best of this challenge.', '2004-05-14 19:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(718979, 75369, 5792, '<td valign="top">I like the surreal Tolkien feeling to this image. I''ll be interested to see how it does in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the surreal Tolkien feeling to this image. I''ll be interested to see how it does in the challenge.', '2004-05-14 19:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(718982, 75163, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent insect capture. It would be nicer if the noise in the background were removed. NeatImage would work well for that.</td>', 'This is an excellent insect capture. It would be nicer if the noise in the background were removed. NeatImage would work well for that.', '2004-05-14 19:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(718984, 74999, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting sunset perspective.</td>', 'Interesting sunset perspective.', '2004-05-14 19:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(718986, 75568, 9763, '<td valign="top">The composition needs a little work I think.  I may have even centered this little guy :)  I like the green face sticking out of the muddy water.  The blurry something on the bottom left is a bit distracting though.</td>', 'The composition needs a little work I think.  I may have even centered this little guy :)  I like the green face sticking out of the muddy water.  The blurry something on the bottom left is a bit distracting though.', '2004-05-14 19:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(718987, 74670, 9763, '<td valign="top">The black spots in the bottom corners is really distracting.  Were you looking through a hole or something?  Perhaps a tighter crop or a different angle would help.  There''s also a shadow running diagonal down the photo from the center top to the mid left.  I like the oclor, but the contrast &amp; clarity could be higher.</td>', 'The black spots in the bottom corners is really distracting.  Were you looking through a hole or something?  Perhaps a tighter crop or a different angle would help.  There''s also a shadow running diagonal down the photo from the center top to the mid left.  I like the oclor, but the contrast & clarity could be higher.', '2004-05-14 19:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(718991, 75517, 9763, '<td valign="top">The colors and clarity are nice.  I don''t care for the dust and dirt on the paperweight though.  There appears to be scratches &amp; blotches that could be buffed out in photoshop.</td>', 'The colors and clarity are nice.  I don''t care for the dust and dirt on the paperweight though.  There appears to be scratches & blotches that could be buffed out in photoshop.', '2004-05-14 19:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(718993, 75185, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of black and white for a cactus. Being experienced with cactus, I think you have done good job capturing this one. That main thing with them are the spines. It is hard to sharpen them just right to avoid the "jaggies". You do have have some here. Judicious use of the smudge tool or selecting out the offending spines before sharpening will reduce the "jaggy" effect.</td>', 'Interesting choice of black and white for a cactus. Being experienced with cactus, I think you have done good job capturing this one. That main thing with them are the spines. It is hard to sharpen them just right to avoid the "jaggies". You do have have some here. Judicious use of the smudge tool or selecting out the offending spines before sharpening will reduce the "jaggy" effect.', '2004-05-14 19:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(718994, 75438, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very nice star effect.  I like the blue too.  I think the center (light / sun) should not be so blueish though.</td>', 'Very nice star effect.  I like the blue too.  I think the center (light / sun) should not be so blueish though.', '2004-05-14 19:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(718995, 75094, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, colors, clarity, contrast.  I wish that tree weren''t in the photo.  I know there''s nothing you can do about that, but it does take away from the overall perfection.  I like this photo a lot though!  Great job!</td>', 'Very nice photo, colors, clarity, contrast.  I wish that tree weren''t in the photo.  I know there''s nothing you can do about that, but it does take away from the overall perfection.  I like this photo a lot though!  Great job!', '2004-05-14 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(718996, 75597, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good color in this floral capture</td>', 'Good color in this floral capture', '2004-05-14 19:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(718998, 75177, 9763, '<td valign="top">I like that this is a reflection, but the graininess in the corner is a bit too much.  Perhaps lower the ISO to 100 and try again?  Nice idea.</td>', 'I like that this is a reflection, but the graininess in the corner is a bit too much.  Perhaps lower the ISO to 100 and try again?  Nice idea.', '2004-05-14 19:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(718999, 75517, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, contrast and color.</td>', 'Nice composition, contrast and color.', '2004-05-14 19:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(719001, 75189, 5792, '<td valign="top">Insect bug me sometimes, but this is a good capture.</td>', 'Insect bug me sometimes, but this is a good capture.', '2004-05-14 19:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(719002, 74798, 9763, '<td valign="top">Wow, where were you?  Very heavenly.  I like the reflection of the clouds and bars.  The color is also nice.  The photo is a tad grainy though.  Perhaps a smaller ISO?</td>', 'Wow, where were you?  Very heavenly.  I like the reflection of the clouds and bars.  The color is also nice.  The photo is a tad grainy though.  Perhaps a smaller ISO?', '2004-05-14 19:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(719004, 75327, 327, '<td valign="top">The color and light are just magic......lovely shot.</td>', 'The color and light are just magic......lovely shot.', '2004-05-14 19:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(719005, 74371, 9763, '<td valign="top">This photo would be really nice with a diffuser filter and less light.  I like the idea, but the photo is lacking some luster, and that just might be it.  Just my opinion :)</td>', 'This photo would be really nice with a diffuser filter and less light.  I like the idea, but the photo is lacking some luster, and that just might be it.  Just my opinion :)', '2004-05-14 19:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(719007, 75545, 9763, '<td valign="top">I always love water drops, and this is an interesting shot indeed to put the earth behind glass.  I see some marks in the glass over toward the right that are a tiny bit distracting though.  It would be nice if the entire background was black, I think.  I see the gradient does help the water drops.  I am conflicted.  Something needs to change, but I think it''s in the background.</td>', 'I always love water drops, and this is an interesting shot indeed to put the earth behind glass.  I see some marks in the glass over toward the right that are a tiny bit distracting though.  It would be nice if the entire background was black, I think.  I see the gradient does help the water drops.  I am conflicted.  Something needs to change, but I think it''s in the background.', '2004-05-14 19:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(719009, 75328, 9763, '<td valign="top">This could use more warm tones (yellows and reds).  I would adjust the white balance and shoot again.  Also, try to get more of the cottage / hut in the photo.</td>', 'This could use more warm tones (yellows and reds).  I would adjust the white balance and shoot again.  Also, try to get more of the cottage / hut in the photo.', '2004-05-14 19:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(719011, 75551, 9763, '<td valign="top">I really like shots like this.  I get marks down all the time for putting parts of my subject (in the foreground) out of focus, but I really love that feel.  To each his/her own.  This is a great photo.  I like the lighting, color, composition and overall feel.  I wish the bottom right wasn''t so cornered (dark), but it''s great anyhow 9</td>', 'I really like shots like this.  I get marks down all the time for putting parts of my subject (in the foreground) out of focus, but I really love that feel.  To each his/her own.  This is a great photo.  I like the lighting, color, composition and overall feel.  I wish the bottom right wasn''t so cornered (dark), but it''s great anyhow 9', '2004-05-14 19:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(719013, 75501, 9763, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be on a very dark wooden post.  I would light up the post more if that''s where you are going to focus your photo.  The house in the background is very bright.  You can try shooting with a faster shutter speed and putting the flash on a low setting to light the post a bit.</td>', 'The focus seems to be on a very dark wooden post.  I would light up the post more if that''s where you are going to focus your photo.  The house in the background is very bright.  You can try shooting with a faster shutter speed and putting the flash on a low setting to light the post a bit.', '2004-05-14 19:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(719014, 74703, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors!  I like the feel of the photo and the angle too.  I would probably move to the right a bit to put the post off center a little more though.  I might also use a fill flash to light up the cow from your right just a tad.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice colors!  I like the feel of the photo and the angle too.  I would probably move to the right a bit to put the post off center a little more though.  I might also use a fill flash to light up the cow from your right just a tad.  Good job.', '2004-05-14 19:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(719016, 75234, 9763, '<td valign="top">I really like the eye, but the photo is lacking sharpness and clarity.  I would try to refocus the photo and shoot it a few more times.  You''ll get it.  Try just before / at sunset too.  You may get some of that yellow lighting back into the photo and less bright white.</td>', 'I really like the eye, but the photo is lacking sharpness and clarity.  I would try to refocus the photo and shoot it a few more times.  You''ll get it.  Try just before / at sunset too.  You may get some of that yellow lighting back into the photo and less bright white.', '2004-05-14 19:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(719017, 75637, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very dark, but intersting idea.  I wish the photo showed some more of the horizon to help orient ourselves.  I like the composition for the most part, and if you didn''t want to show the horizon, you did a good job with the composing to keep it out..  I wish it were brighter though.</td>', 'Very dark, but intersting idea.  I wish the photo showed some more of the horizon to help orient ourselves.  I like the composition for the most part, and if you didn''t want to show the horizon, you did a good job with the composing to keep it out..  I wish it were brighter though.', '2004-05-14 19:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(719018, 75635, 9763, '<td valign="top">Was this taken through a window?  It has a glare feel.  I love the vivid colors and the composition too.  See if you can take your next rainbow with a polarizer and 100 ISO.  It may help a little bit.  :)</td>', 'Was this taken through a window?  It has a glare feel.  I love the vivid colors and the composition too.  See if you can take your next rainbow with a polarizer and 100 ISO.  It may help a little bit.  :)', '2004-05-14 19:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(719022, 74665, 9763, '<td valign="top">Oooh, nice fog!  I like to see the fog rolling in.  Very rare!  I like the colors of the morning too.  You captured it well.  The tree (and corner shrub) off to the right are a bit distracting.  Either more or less of it would help.  Nice work.</td>', 'Oooh, nice fog!  I like to see the fog rolling in.  Very rare!  I like the colors of the morning too.  You captured it well.  The tree (and corner shrub) off to the right are a bit distracting.  Either more or less of it would help.  Nice work.', '2004-05-14 20:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(719025, 75273, 9763, '<td valign="top">crop too tight at the bottom.  Color is a bit green, but maybe that was your choice.  I would like to see this in black / white or sepia.</td>', 'crop too tight at the bottom.  Color is a bit green, but maybe that was your choice.  I would like to see this in black / white or sepia.', '2004-05-14 20:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(719029, 75417, 9763, '<td valign="top">Great macro!  It''s always hard to decide how to crop these.  I have taken hundreds of butterfly shots.  I always try different crops when I go with them too.  I think for this one, I''d either cut out the antenna and part of the flower and top and about an inch of the left side.  Or, I''d open up the crop on the left and top to include the entire wing.  Nice color, a little bright, but nice :)</td>', 'Great macro!  It''s always hard to decide how to crop these.  I have taken hundreds of butterfly shots.  I always try different crops when I go with them too.  I think for this one, I''d either cut out the antenna and part of the flower and top and about an inch of the left side.  Or, I''d open up the crop on the left and top to include the entire wing.  Nice color, a little bright, but nice :)', '2004-05-14 20:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(719052, 75094, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice night photo, everything is in good focus and there is no noise in the sky. The building looks a bit crooked.</td>', 'Very nice night photo, everything is in good focus and there is no noise in the sky. The building looks a bit crooked.', '2004-05-14 20:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(719054, 75100, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture. The reflections in the glasses are nice. The lighting is a bit low which makes some of the colors seem dull.</td>', 'Very interesting picture. The reflections in the glasses are nice. The lighting is a bit low which makes some of the colors seem dull.', '2004-05-14 20:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(719057, 75555, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, I love old castles - wish we had them in the USA. The colors are great. I think more of the yellow flowers on the bottom could have been cropped off.</td>', 'Very nice picture, I love old castles - wish we had them in the USA. The colors are great. I think more of the yellow flowers on the bottom could have been cropped off.', '2004-05-14 20:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(719060, 75069, 18552, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, like the way you have captured the sunlight and shade. The focus on the grass is a bit soft.</td>', 'Nice colors, like the way you have captured the sunlight and shade. The focus on the grass is a bit soft.', '2004-05-14 20:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(719061, 75543, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really interesting subject and good composition and colors. The focus seems soft all over the whole picture, don''t know if this was something you were trying for or not.</td>', 'Really interesting subject and good composition and colors. The focus seems soft all over the whole picture, don''t know if this was something you were trying for or not.', '2004-05-14 20:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(719063, 74780, 18552, '<td valign="top">Colors are good. Focus seems a bit off and perhaps the composition might have been improved by not having the machine thing in the middle of the picture. You did a good job of making this interesting.</td>', 'Colors are good. Focus seems a bit off and perhaps the composition might have been improved by not having the machine thing in the middle of the picture. You did a good job of making this interesting.', '2004-05-14 20:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(719069, 75583, 18552, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject which might have been better not in the middle of the picture but more to one side. The focus seems off. The sky looks a bit overexposed.</td>', 'Interesting subject which might have been better not in the middle of the picture but more to one side. The focus seems off. The sky looks a bit overexposed.', '2004-05-14 20:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(719093, 75327, 9136, '<td valign="top">Can''t vote, but this is a stunning photo. Good luck.</td>', 'Can''t vote, but this is a stunning photo. Good luck.', '2004-05-14 21:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(719100, 75490, 17148, '<td valign="top">Very crisp, love the eyes</td>', 'Very crisp, love the eyes', '2004-05-14 21:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(719136, 75539, 11738, '<td valign="top">This would have been AWESOME for the abstract challenge.</td>', 'This would have been AWESOME for the abstract challenge.', '2004-05-14 21:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(719138, 74670, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad that dial is out of focus.  Nice lighting and good tones throughout image.</td>', 'Too bad that dial is out of focus.  Nice lighting and good tones throughout image.', '2004-05-14 21:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(719148, 75098, 11738, '<td valign="top">Very nice image with good reflection in water.  Does need to be sharpened quite a bit though.</td>', 'Very nice image with good reflection in water.  Does need to be sharpened quite a bit though.', '2004-05-14 21:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(719155, 74703, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad you had to crop that left ear.  Nice colours</td>', 'Too bad you had to crop that left ear.  Nice colours', '2004-05-14 21:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(719158, 75483, 11738, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, but this shot might have looked better rotated 180 degrees.  Great job on focussing on the little blood sucker.  Nice colours too.  Good work.</td>', 'I don''t know, but this shot might have looked better rotated 180 degrees.  Great job on focussing on the little blood sucker.  Nice colours too.  Good work.', '2004-05-14 22:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(719159, 75555, 11738, '<td valign="top">A little too much flowers in the foreground.  Love the rest of the image.</td>', 'A little too much flowers in the foreground.  Love the rest of the image.', '2004-05-14 22:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(719165, 75042, 11078, '<td valign="top">A great image! a little on the dark side but really good</td>', 'A great image! a little on the dark side but really good', '2004-05-14 22:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(719237, 75490, 7350, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot.  I think I recognize this mini-Jacko.  I love the expression, and the eyes are perfect.  I somehow don''t believe you''ve never shot this subject before, but you''re getting a 10 anyway, cuz with his arms the way they are, it looks like little Samuel is holding the camera out in front of him and taking his own picture!  10.</td>', 'Fantastic shot.  I think I recognize this mini-Jacko.  I love the expression, and the eyes are perfect.  I somehow don''t believe you''ve never shot this subject before, but you''re getting a 10 anyway, cuz with his arms the way they are, it looks like little Samuel is holding the camera out in front of him and taking his own picture!  10.', '2004-05-14 23:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(719243, 75460, 18349, '<td valign="top">Composition:<br/>  (Subject Placement, Cropping, Background):  8<br/>Technical:<br/>  (Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing):  7<br/>Appeal:<br/>  (Is it Interesting, Motivating, etc.):  8<br/>Challenge:<br/>  (How well it meets the challenge):  9<br/>Average: 8</td>', 'Composition:  (Subject Placement, Cropping, Background):  8Technical:  (Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing):  7Appeal:  (Is it Interesting, Motivating, etc.):  8Challenge:  (How well it meets the challenge):  9Average: 8', '2004-05-14 23:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(719247, 75619, 7350, '<td valign="top">This shot is absolutely fantastic.  The toning is perfect, the composition is perfect, and I love the lighting/shadows.  It would be a crime to give it less than a 10, and I hope I see a ribbon on this one.  At any rate, it''s gonna be in my favorites as soon as the challenge ends - this is in my top 2 favorite DPC shots of all time.  Congratulations on a fantastic capture.</td>', 'This shot is absolutely fantastic.  The toning is perfect, the composition is perfect, and I love the lighting/shadows.  It would be a crime to give it less than a 10, and I hope I see a ribbon on this one.  At any rate, it''s gonna be in my favorites as soon as the challenge ends - this is in my top 2 favorite DPC shots of all time.  Congratulations on a fantastic capture.', '2004-05-14 23:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(719248, 75369, 18349, '<td valign="top">Looks mystical and almost surreal.  How beautiful!   What a gift you have.  Thanks for sharing!</td>', 'Looks mystical and almost surreal.  How beautiful!   What a gift you have.  Thanks for sharing!', '2004-05-14 23:52:11.000000', NULL, 1);
