(719414, 75307, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a nice train picture. The colors are great and so is the composition. It looks perhaps a bit oversharpened. It looks like the heat from the exhaust is changing the focus on that rock face behind the train - kind of cool.</td>', 'What a nice train picture. The colors are great and so is the composition. It looks perhaps a bit oversharpened. It looks like the heat from the exhaust is changing the focus on that rock face behind the train - kind of cool.', '2004-05-15 03:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(719416, 75377, 18552, '<td valign="top">The colors are so lovely. To my eyes, it would be even more beautiful if more were in focus. It makes one feel cool and refreshed to look at your picture.</td>', 'The colors are so lovely. To my eyes, it would be even more beautiful if more were in focus. It makes one feel cool and refreshed to look at your picture.', '2004-05-15 03:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
