(720068, 75289, 14603, '<td valign="top">One of those simple but very effective images..which means it`s been done right !!<br/>The lighting is all important in this type of work and I think you have got it perfect.<br/>Compositionally, I might have tried bringing the extinguisher in towards the centre ..just a touch..but that`s being trivial and will assume that you tried that and it looks better this way ?<br/>Well done</td>', 'One of those simple but very effective images..which means it`s been done right !!The lighting is all important in this type of work and I think you have got it perfect.Compositionally, I might have tried bringing the extinguisher in towards the centre ..just a touch..but that`s being trivial and will assume that you tried that and it looks better this way ?Well done', '2004-05-15 17:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
