(720449, 75553, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the deicate detail in the silhouetted tree balancing the stronger  detail of the fence.  The  cropped ratio feels awkward to me...  I''d like to see it more rectangular so I could see more of the fence.</td>', 'I like the deicate detail in the silhouetted tree balancing the stronger  detail of the fence.  The  cropped ratio feels awkward to me...  I''d like to see it more rectangular so I could see more of the fence.', '2004-05-15 22:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
