(720459, 75174, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the motion blur in this shot - works very well for me,</td>', 'I like the motion blur in this shot - works very well for me,', '2004-05-15 22:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(720462, 75398, 20204, '<td valign="top">The splash is great!  I think a tighter crop might help to emphasize it more.</td>', 'The splash is great!  I think a tighter crop might help to emphasize it more.', '2004-05-15 22:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(720464, 75460, 9821, '<td valign="top">photo''s like these are tough for me because I feel it''s a little unethical to take them, but I can''t deny that it''s well done ... 9. If I were this guy, I wouldn''t want people taking pictures of me in an attempt to win a photo contest. But I realize that this is my opinion and shouldn''t have anything to do with my vote on the photo''s quality.</td>', 'photo''s like these are tough for me because I feel it''s a little unethical to take them, but I can''t deny that it''s well done ... 9. If I were this guy, I wouldn''t want people taking pictures of me in an attempt to win a photo contest. But I realize that this is my opinion and shouldn''t have anything to do with my vote on the photo''s quality.', '2004-05-15 22:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(720465, 75483, 9821, '<td valign="top">great ... 9</td>', 'great ... 9', '2004-05-15 22:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(720466, 74259, 9821, '<td valign="top">awesome ... 9</td>', 'awesome ... 9', '2004-05-15 22:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(720467, 75549, 20204, '<td valign="top">The cropping is excellent, and the background is interesteing - having the colors in it compliments the monochromatic subject nicely.  I''d like to see more sharpness in the foreground to bring out the intricate detail in it.</td>', 'The cropping is excellent, and the background is interesteing - having the colors in it compliments the monochromatic subject nicely.  I''d like to see more sharpness in the foreground to bring out the intricate detail in it.', '2004-05-15 22:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(720469, 75089, 9821, '<td valign="top">you took something relatively boring and made an awesome picture out of it ... well seen ... 8</td>', 'you took something relatively boring and made an awesome picture out of it ... well seen ... 8', '2004-05-15 22:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(720472, 75412, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of small splotches of color in the mess of bikes.  It''s also an interesting contrast with the natural backdrop - this image has a lot of interest to me on that ground.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the effect of small splotches of color in the mess of bikes.  It''s also an interesting contrast with the natural backdrop - this image has a lot of interest to me on that ground.  Well done.', '2004-05-15 22:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(720473, 74627, 20204, '<td valign="top">Ruins, or runes?  Seems like a bit of overexposure on the right washes out some detail.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Ruins, or runes?  Seems like a bit of overexposure on the right washes out some detail.  Nice composition.', '2004-05-15 22:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(720474, 75189, 9821, '<td valign="top">it''s great, but I wish it were a little closer to the bug (probably not possible) and it seems just a little blown out ... 8</td>', 'it''s great, but I wish it were a little closer to the bug (probably not possible) and it seems just a little blown out ... 8', '2004-05-15 22:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(720475, 75201, 20204, '<td valign="top">Underexposure is keeping the subject''s details hidden.  Makes for a neat composition in the tunnel, just needs some lighting tweaks.</td>', 'Underexposure is keeping the subject''s details hidden.  Makes for a neat composition in the tunnel, just needs some lighting tweaks.', '2004-05-15 22:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(720477, 75543, 20204, '<td valign="top">Seems like some overexposure is washing out detail and sharpness.</td>', 'Seems like some overexposure is washing out detail and sharpness.', '2004-05-15 22:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(720480, 75408, 20204, '<td valign="top">The glass seems blurry to me.  With sharpness this would be a very interesting image,  Cropping seems too tight at the top.</td>', 'The glass seems blurry to me.  With sharpness this would be a very interesting image,  Cropping seems too tight at the top.', '2004-05-15 22:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(720481, 75273, 6597, '<td valign="top">That was a climb wish I could see his face that would add more interest to this photo 5</td>', 'That was a climb wish I could see his face that would add more interest to this photo 5', '2004-05-15 22:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(720482, 75286, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''ve been wanting to catch droplets on a spiderweb for some time now - this is great!  If you could change the point of view so that there was less variation in the background''s brightness it would improve it some, but the web is amazing!</td>', 'I''ve been wanting to catch droplets on a spiderweb for some time now - this is great!  If you could change the point of view so that there was less variation in the background''s brightness it would improve it some, but the web is amazing!', '2004-05-15 22:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(720483, 75399, 6597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors 8</td>', 'Beautiful colors 8', '2004-05-15 22:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(720484, 75634, 20204, '<td valign="top">There is an unnatural definition between the boay and background.  Possibly oversharpening?  Seems generally washed out as well, which I''m guessing is overexposure.</td>', 'There is an unnatural definition between the boay and background.  Possibly oversharpening?  Seems generally washed out as well, which I''m guessing is overexposure.', '2004-05-15 22:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(720485, 75381, 6597, '<td valign="top">not very interesting</td>', 'not very interesting', '2004-05-15 22:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(720488, 75632, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and detail in this.  I love the balanced feel...  I could ewnvision this on the wall in a restaurant somewhere.  Very nice!</td>', 'Great lighting and detail in this.  I love the balanced feel...  I could ewnvision this on the wall in a restaurant somewhere.  Very nice!', '2004-05-15 22:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(720489, 74645, 20204, '<td valign="top">The blurring on the signs is distracting, but you''ve got a great eye for composition.  This looks like a scene from StarTrek.</td>', 'The blurring on the signs is distracting, but you''ve got a great eye for composition.  This looks like a scene from StarTrek.', '2004-05-15 22:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(720490, 75048, 6597, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement</td>', 'Nice arrangement', '2004-05-15 22:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(720493, 75551, 20204, '<td valign="top">The blurring in the lower sticks is a significant didtraction froman otherwise well composed image.  Needs more depth of field to bring it all into focus.</td>', 'The blurring in the lower sticks is a significant didtraction froman otherwise well composed image.  Needs more depth of field to bring it all into focus.', '2004-05-15 22:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(720494, 74703, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve got a bit too much sky in the picture.  More top cropping would help to balance it and emphasize the cow more.</td>', 'I think you''ve got a bit too much sky in the picture.  More top cropping would help to balance it and emphasize the cow more.', '2004-05-15 22:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(720495, 75390, 20204, '<td valign="top">Not enough depth of field.  There is blurring int he foreground and background.  Great composition - I really like the idea and "feel" of the image.</td>', 'Not enough depth of field.  There is blurring int he foreground and background.  Great composition - I really like the idea and "feel" of the image.', '2004-05-15 22:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(720499, 75341, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the top - bottom balance of this, but I find the city to be the more interesting focus.  Unfortunately, the foreground boat is what the image''s composition and perspective emphasizes to me.    Also feels hazy - some more lighting would and sharpness would bring out more of the architectural detail.  Great idea - there is a lot of interest in this city scape.</td>', 'I like the top - bottom balance of this, but I find the city to be the more interesting focus.  Unfortunately, the foreground boat is what the image''s composition and perspective emphasizes to me.    Also feels hazy - some more lighting would and sharpness would bring out more of the architectural detail.  Great idea - there is a lot of interest in this city scape.', '2004-05-15 22:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(720501, 75636, 20204, '<td valign="top">The depth of field is too shallow.  The body is just too out of focus and acts as a distraction from the cat''s  engaging expression.</td>', 'The depth of field is too shallow.  The body is just too out of focus and acts as a distraction from the cat''s  engaging expression.', '2004-05-15 22:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(720502, 75576, 20204, '<td valign="top">Awesome detail!  I like the depth of field in this as almost anything more in focus would compete with the busy subject.  Great job!</td>', 'Awesome detail!  I like the depth of field in this as almost anything more in focus would compete with the busy subject.  Great job!', '2004-05-15 23:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(720504, 75460, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice eye for composition.  Unfortunately the overexposure really washes out some detail here.  This would be a great photojournalistic image with a bit less lighting oradditional  exposure compensation.</td>', 'Nice eye for composition.  Unfortunately the overexposure really washes out some detail here.  This would be a great photojournalistic image with a bit less lighting oradditional  exposure compensation.', '2004-05-15 23:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(720506, 74670, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject but enough out of focus as to really undermine the image.</td>', 'Interesting subject but enough out of focus as to really undermine the image.', '2004-05-15 23:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(720507, 75565, 20204, '<td valign="top">Significant overexposure, and lacking a point of interest.</td>', 'Significant overexposure, and lacking a point of interest.', '2004-05-15 23:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(720509, 75556, 20204, '<td valign="top">The background feels like too much contrast to me - too heavy.  Nice candid expression - this has a very natural feel to it.</td>', 'The background feels like too much contrast to me - too heavy.  Nice candid expression - this has a very natural feel to it.', '2004-05-15 23:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(720510, 74765, 20204, '<td valign="top">Foreground blurring is a problem here.  Also, the point of view obstructs the subject enough to be distracting.</td>', 'Foreground blurring is a problem here.  Also, the point of view obstructs the subject enough to be distracting.', '2004-05-15 23:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(720516, 75524, 20204, '<td valign="top">Could use some sharpening.  I like the green on the water complimenting the Mallard''s head.</td>', 'Could use some sharpening.  I like the green on the water complimenting the Mallard''s head.', '2004-05-15 23:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(720554, 75210, 13772, '<td valign="top">Very nice Macro. I like the desaturation on the log or tree stump. Nice job!</td>', 'Very nice Macro. I like the desaturation on the log or tree stump. Nice job!', '2004-05-15 23:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(720563, 75537, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hey, this looks like Chicago, sailing into the lake from Navy Pier.  Is it?  Beautiful four-master!  Beautiful sky.  Good work!</td>', 'Hey, this looks like Chicago, sailing into the lake from Navy Pier.  Is it?  Beautiful four-master!  Beautiful sky.  Good work!', '2004-05-16 00:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(720564, 75277, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice catch!  Looks a tad on the hazy side, like the histogram could have been adjusted in post-processing or something like that.  But it''s a beautiful shot.</td>', 'Nice catch!  Looks a tad on the hazy side, like the histogram could have been adjusted in post-processing or something like that.  But it''s a beautiful shot.', '2004-05-16 00:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(720565, 75598, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Pretty good for your first flower picture.  8</td>', 'Wow!  Pretty good for your first flower picture.  8', '2004-05-16 00:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(720566, 75539, 7485, '<td valign="top">Would have done really well in the Abstract challenge! Wonderful mess of colors-8</td>', 'Would have done really well in the Abstract challenge! Wonderful mess of colors-8', '2004-05-16 00:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(720567, 75189, 5112, '<td valign="top">They''re high in protein, you know :)</td>', 'They''re high in protein, you know :)', '2004-05-16 00:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(720571, 75528, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great perspective! Color fringing (from sharpening?) is a little distracting, and I wish I could see more of the foliage on the left, to balance the log on the right, but still an excellent shot.</td>', 'Great perspective! Color fringing (from sharpening?) is a little distracting, and I wish I could see more of the foliage on the left, to balance the log on the right, but still an excellent shot.', '2004-05-16 00:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(720576, 75636, 7485, '<td valign="top">Those eyes are quite something! Good perspective and use of shallow DOF.</td>', 'Those eyes are quite something! Good perspective and use of shallow DOF.', '2004-05-16 00:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(720578, 75400, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. But it isn''t tack-sharp, which is important for a photo where everything is based on form.</td>', 'Very cool idea. But it isn''t tack-sharp, which is important for a photo where everything is based on form.', '2004-05-16 00:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(720582, 75519, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very clean composition, great balance between the dark blue sky and green-blue windows. But what is that sole white pixel, a star?</td>', 'Very clean composition, great balance between the dark blue sky and green-blue windows. But what is that sole white pixel, a star?', '2004-05-16 00:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(720590, 74665, 7485, '<td valign="top">Almost a magical shot, but desperately needs a crop to get rid of that vignetting and the distracting twigs in the lower right corner.</td>', 'Almost a magical shot, but desperately needs a crop to get rid of that vignetting and the distracting twigs in the lower right corner.', '2004-05-16 00:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(720708, 75630, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wery vivid colors!<br/>Tc</td>', 'Wery vivid colors!Tc', '2004-05-16 02:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(720710, 75555, 9906, '<td valign="top">When I look at this scrolled down, in effect cropping out a portion of hte yellow flowers in the foreground, it becomes a much more potent shot!<br/>TC</td>', 'When I look at this scrolled down, in effect cropping out a portion of hte yellow flowers in the foreground, it becomes a much more potent shot!TC', '2004-05-16 02:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(720712, 75513, 9906, '<td valign="top">Having taken some shots in a cave and realizing the light that you have to use (mostly flash and easiest to use the on board flash) I understand how hard it is to get a good shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'Having taken some shots in a cave and realizing the light that you have to use (mostly flash and easiest to use the on board flash) I understand how hard it is to get a good shot.TC', '2004-05-16 02:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(720713, 75066, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Too bad it isn''t a bit bigger so it would be easier to see.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice shot!  Too bad it isn''t a bit bigger so it would be easier to see.TC', '2004-05-16 02:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(720715, 74866, 9906, '<td valign="top">My eye is drawn to the perch more than the bird.  I think this is because your focus is a touch off.  It may be because of the colors and textures and lines though...<br/>TC</td>', 'My eye is drawn to the perch more than the bird.  I think this is because your focus is a touch off.  It may be because of the colors and textures and lines though...TC', '2004-05-16 02:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(720717, 75632, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very quaint scene!  I can almost smell the old city smells! <br/>TC</td>', 'Very quaint scene!  I can almost smell the old city smells! TC', '2004-05-16 02:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(720719, 75048, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry about your border...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m sorry about your border...TC', '2004-05-16 02:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(720721, 75498, 9906, '<td valign="top">I could handle the subject material here, but it''s extremely un-interesting.  A unique angle...  An interesting crop...  Cool lighting...If you''re gonna shoot a toilet, at least do something diffent with it.<br/>TC</td>', 'I could handle the subject material here, but it''s extremely un-interesting.  A unique angle...  An interesting crop...  Cool lighting...If you''re gonna shoot a toilet, at least do something diffent with it.TC', '2004-05-16 02:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(720722, 75412, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too much detail, too small a space.  In a different media, this would probably be an awesome shot (8x10 for example).  At 640 by what ever, it''s just too damn busy...<br/>TC</td>', 'Too much detail, too small a space.  In a different media, this would probably be an awesome shot (8x10 for example).  At 640 by what ever, it''s just too damn busy...TC', '2004-05-16 02:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(720725, 75460, 9906, '<td valign="top">Hope ya at least threw the guy a fiver...<br/>TC</td>', 'Hope ya at least threw the guy a fiver...TC', '2004-05-16 02:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(720726, 75200, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too much detail, too small a space.  At 8x10 this might be nice, but in this media it''s too busy.  Something to keep in mind for future challenges!<br/>TC</td>', 'Too much detail, too small a space.  At 8x10 this might be nice, but in this media it''s too busy.  Something to keep in mind for future challenges!TC', '2004-05-16 02:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
