(720732, 75551, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines!  Would like a little more DOF towards the viewer though.  It''s also a little hot on the sticks closest to the bottom toward the left.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice leading lines!  Would like a little more DOF towards the viewer though.  It''s also a little hot on the sticks closest to the bottom toward the left.TC', '2004-05-16 02:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(720734, 75515, 9906, '<td valign="top">Tres cute!<br/>TC</td>', 'Tres cute!TC', '2004-05-16 02:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(720735, 75416, 9906, '<td valign="top">Need to clip those toenails...<br/>TC</td>', 'Need to clip those toenails...TC', '2004-05-16 02:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(720736, 75189, 9906, '<td valign="top">EEEEWWWWW!<br/>TC</td>', 'EEEEWWWWW!TC', '2004-05-16 02:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(720737, 75246, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out if it''s over saturated or over sharpened.  It IS a little busy...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out if it''s over saturated or over sharpened.  It IS a little busy...TC', '2004-05-16 02:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(720741, 75634, 9906, '<td valign="top">Curious about how you converted this to B/W.  The boy looks like a cardboard cut out or like he was added in.  There are many ways of converting to B/W where you have great control over the total effect.  You do have great contrasts here which lead to a nice B/W shot.  I would love to see the original and play around with the conversion to see if it would pop more!<br/>TC</td>', 'Curious about how you converted this to B/W.  The boy looks like a cardboard cut out or like he was added in.  There are many ways of converting to B/W where you have great control over the total effect.  You do have great contrasts here which lead to a nice B/W shot.  I would love to see the original and play around with the conversion to see if it would pop more!TC', '2004-05-16 02:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(720770, 75274, 8054, '<td valign="top">Either the focus is a bit off or it''s compression. Great colors and saturation and the composition is also very good. The background (brown branch) could have been blurred a bit more but it''s not overly distracting in it''s current state as the bright color of the flowers really grab one''s attention.</td>', 'Either the focus is a bit off or it''s compression. Great colors and saturation and the composition is also very good. The background (brown branch) could have been blurred a bit more but it''s not overly distracting in it''s current state as the bright color of the flowers really grab one''s attention.', '2004-05-16 03:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(720772, 75542, 8054, '<td valign="top">These dogs are co cute! They remind me of my sister''s dogs. I really like the green fence as a frame for their faces. The bottom looks like the camera was not level when this was shot but the left side vertical portion looks truly vertical so I guess we can chalk it up to fence craftsmanship not photographer error.  :) Exposure looks good, focus is a bit soft but I really love the application of DOF to blur the background doggie. Good job!<br/> <br/>(fixed typo)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-17 02:36:20.</i></td>', 'These dogs are co cute! They remind me of my sister''s dogs. I really like the green fence as a frame for their faces. The bottom looks like the camera was not level when this was shot but the left side vertical portion looks truly vertical so I guess we can chalk it up to fence craftsmanship not photographer error.  :) Exposure looks good, focus is a bit soft but I really love the application of DOF to blur the background doggie. Good job! (fixed typo)', '2004-05-16 03:45:46.000000', '2004-05-17 03:36:20.000000', 1),
(720775, 75599, 8054, '<td valign="top">Funny and creative title, I like it. Kind of like a pine tree''s version of fireworks. Anyway, nice exposure, sharp details, and very creative use of DOF to blur (most of) the needles. I would give this extra brownie points if the background was pure sky vs trees. 8</td>', 'Funny and creative title, I like it. Kind of like a pine tree''s version of fireworks. Anyway, nice exposure, sharp details, and very creative use of DOF to blur (most of) the needles. I would give this extra brownie points if the background was pure sky vs trees. 8', '2004-05-16 03:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(720780, 75515, 11034, '<td valign="top">I love her expression. Too bad ligth in the left, but she looks vey well. Good luck</td>', 'I love her expression. Too bad ligth in the left, but she looks vey well. Good luck', '2004-05-16 03:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(720786, 75573, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is simply amazing. You were VERY lucky to get the water as still as it is in the photo. On top of that, you have perfect reflections of the sky and mountains. I am jealous I can''t get images like this.  :)  10</td>', 'This is simply amazing. You were VERY lucky to get the water as still as it is in the photo. On top of that, you have perfect reflections of the sky and mountains. I am jealous I can''t get images like this.  :)  10', '2004-05-16 04:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(720792, 75277, 18722, '<td valign="top">I would prefer a bit more contrast in the horse''s face (perhaps a catchlight).</td>', 'I would prefer a bit more contrast in the horse''s face (perhaps a catchlight).', '2004-05-16 04:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(720793, 75597, 18722, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors, with good contrast between the various shades of pink and red.  But I do not see much composition in the arrangement.</td>', 'Very nice colors, with good contrast between the various shades of pink and red.  But I do not see much composition in the arrangement.', '2004-05-16 04:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(720794, 75636, 18722, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and detail, but I think giving the eyes more contrast would have helped.  I am not too crazy about the tilt and cropped ears either, but it was obviously intentional -- so be it.</td>', 'Good DOF and detail, but I think giving the eyes more contrast would have helped.  I am not too crazy about the tilt and cropped ears either, but it was obviously intentional -- so be it.', '2004-05-16 04:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(720795, 74271, 18722, '<td valign="top">I like the curves of the lines and the contrast between the regular and rigid pattern of foreground and the complex patterns of barely controlled chaos in the background.  I do not see how the drop-shadow border added to the composition however.</td>', 'I like the curves of the lines and the contrast between the regular and rigid pattern of foreground and the complex patterns of barely controlled chaos in the background.  I do not see how the drop-shadow border added to the composition however.', '2004-05-16 04:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(720796, 75240, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery -- a little dark, but nice.  However, with the flower as the primary point of interest, it would have been better (I think) with it more forward facing.</td>', 'Nice scenery -- a little dark, but nice.  However, with the flower as the primary point of interest, it would have been better (I think) with it more forward facing.', '2004-05-16 04:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(720797, 75409, 18722, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be on the leaves to the right of the flower, not on the flower itself.</td>', 'The focus seems to be on the leaves to the right of the flower, not on the flower itself.', '2004-05-16 04:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(720799, 74371, 18722, '<td valign="top">I think I have taken that walk many times (not in the same location, but a walk with the same meaning none-the-less).</td>', 'I think I have taken that walk many times (not in the same location, but a walk with the same meaning none-the-less).', '2004-05-16 04:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(720800, 75549, 18722, '<td valign="top">The dark speck on the left is the only real distraction.</td>', 'The dark speck on the left is the only real distraction.', '2004-05-16 04:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(720802, 75069, 18722, '<td valign="top">Shooting straight down the trail draws the eye fine, however there is no place for it to go -- the trail just ends with no indication that it continues on past that point.  If the shot had been taken at a bit more of an angle, say with the trail travelling from the lowever left to the upper-right third corner, the trail would attempt to draw the viewer in even further with the appearance that it continues.</td>', 'Shooting straight down the trail draws the eye fine, however there is no place for it to go -- the trail just ends with no indication that it continues on past that point.  If the shot had been taken at a bit more of an angle, say with the trail travelling from the lowever left to the upper-right third corner, the trail would attempt to draw the viewer in even further with the appearance that it continues.', '2004-05-16 05:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(720805, 75586, 18722, '<td valign="top">This is great -- if only the shadows were not so dark.</td>', 'This is great -- if only the shadows were not so dark.', '2004-05-16 05:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(720806, 74670, 18722, '<td valign="top">The sepia works well with this.</td>', 'The sepia works well with this.', '2004-05-16 05:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(720818, 75536, 17551, '<td valign="top">it is pretty damn good camoflauge isn''t it.. nice job actually spotting the little hopper in the first place</td>', 'it is pretty damn good camoflauge isn''t it.. nice job actually spotting the little hopper in the first place', '2004-05-16 06:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(720820, 74361, 17551, '<td valign="top">great colours &amp; contrast.. are they bison?</td>', 'great colours & contrast.. are they bison?', '2004-05-16 06:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(720823, 75327, 17551, '<td valign="top">exquisite !</td>', 'exquisite !', '2004-05-16 06:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(720829, 74726, 4517, '<td valign="top">Did you miss the eclipse or on the wrong side of the world.</td>', 'Did you miss the eclipse or on the wrong side of the world.', '2004-05-16 06:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(720831, 75181, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great detail. A touch of unsharp mask would get it really sharp.7</td>', 'Great detail. A touch of unsharp mask would get it really sharp.7', '2004-05-16 06:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(720833, 75635, 17551, '<td valign="top">nice capture!</td>', 'nice capture!', '2004-05-16 06:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(720847, 74665, 18722, '<td valign="top">More light needed.  Elves are usually portrayed as light mannered and given to frolicking about -- this is too dark and moody.</td>', 'More light needed.  Elves are usually portrayed as light mannered and given to frolicking about -- this is too dark and moody.', '2004-05-16 07:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(720848, 75115, 18722, '<td valign="top">If only it was not sticking its tounge out at me...</td>', 'If only it was not sticking its tounge out at me...', '2004-05-16 07:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(720851, 75640, 17551, '<td valign="top">very busy picture... I would perhaps take away some of the artifacts so you can concentrate on the whales</td>', 'very busy picture... I would perhaps take away some of the artifacts so you can concentrate on the whales', '2004-05-16 07:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(720852, 75045, 18722, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I think a different perspective would have worked a bit better, the neck is at a rather odd angle.</td>', 'Very nice.  I think a different perspective would have worked a bit better, the neck is at a rather odd angle.', '2004-05-16 07:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(720855, 74866, 18722, '<td valign="top">The detail is very nice.  Good job.  Although the nose, just above the beak, seems a bit to soft compared to the rest of the image.</td>', 'The detail is very nice.  Good job.  Although the nose, just above the beak, seems a bit to soft compared to the rest of the image.', '2004-05-16 07:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(720857, 74645, 18722, '<td valign="top">Wonderful symmetry and lighting.  The only thing I would prefer different is the loss of detail in the lighting between the stairs.</td>', 'Wonderful symmetry and lighting.  The only thing I would prefer different is the loss of detail in the lighting between the stairs.', '2004-05-16 07:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(720859, 74259, 18722, '<td valign="top">I like how the moss coverd log(?) in the right forground seems to have a couple of animal spirits hiding in it.  I swear I see faces.</td>', 'I like how the moss coverd log(?) in the right forground seems to have a couple of animal spirits hiding in it.  I swear I see faces.', '2004-05-16 07:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(720860, 74919, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry.  I like the dual-tone, but the right half of the sky is a bit bright.</td>', 'Nice symmetry.  I like the dual-tone, but the right half of the sky is a bit bright.', '2004-05-16 07:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(720862, 75400, 18722, '<td valign="top">Labscape?  Looks like you have a little big-nosed elf sitting on the right side of the beaker blowing smoke-rings while his pet looks on!  :D  Very nice capture, it looks like he is having a good time.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, the bottom of the beaker looks blown out; not to bad, but it is a bit distracting.  I think a tighter crop around the ''elf and pet'' would have worked better, but I don''t know how many will see what I see.  Probably not very many. :D  But then, I think I would have cropped it above the blown out region in any event.<br/> <br/>Cheers, and thanks for making me laugh out loud.  I do not usually tell the score I give, but you have an 8</td>', 'Labscape?  Looks like you have a little big-nosed elf sitting on the right side of the beaker blowing smoke-rings while his pet looks on!  :D  Very nice capture, it looks like he is having a good time. Unfortunately, the bottom of the beaker looks blown out; not to bad, but it is a bit distracting.  I think a tighter crop around the ''elf and pet'' would have worked better, but I don''t know how many will see what I see.  Probably not very many. :D  But then, I think I would have cropped it above the blown out region in any event. Cheers, and thanks for making me laugh out loud.  I do not usually tell the score I give, but you have an 8', '2004-05-16 07:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(720863, 75306, 18722, '<td valign="top">Love the detail and color.</td>', 'Love the detail and color.', '2004-05-16 07:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(720864, 75408, 17551, '<td valign="top">cool angles</td>', 'cool angles', '2004-05-16 07:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(720865, 75328, 18722, '<td valign="top">The color saturation is great. Tthe composition wonderful.  If there was anything I would change abou this, it would be to darken the sky a bit -- the ''exit'' of the woods needs to be the brightest object in the frame, but the sky (especially its reflection) are competing with it.<br/> <br/>After much deliberation, you have my one 10.</td>', 'The color saturation is great. Tthe composition wonderful.  If there was anything I would change abou this, it would be to darken the sky a bit -- the ''exit'' of the woods needs to be the brightest object in the frame, but the sky (especially its reflection) are competing with it. After much deliberation, you have my one 10.', '2004-05-16 07:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(720871, 75098, 17551, '<td valign="top">a little blurry</td>', 'a little blurry', '2004-05-16 07:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(720877, 75533, 17551, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot and great title</td>', 'wonderful shot and great title', '2004-05-16 08:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(720880, 75277, 17551, '<td valign="top">I think that extra glare is caused by the sun? Shame because it''s a really nice shot.</td>', 'I think that extra glare is caused by the sun? Shame because it''s a really nice shot.', '2004-05-16 08:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(720885, 75541, 17551, '<td valign="top">I like the different shades in this photo, great use of negative space.</td>', 'I like the different shades in this photo, great use of negative space.', '2004-05-16 08:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(720890, 75368, 17551, '<td valign="top">such wonderful colours... must be somewhere in england</td>', 'such wonderful colours... must be somewhere in england', '2004-05-16 08:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(720954, 75460, 13305, '<td valign="top">The wall is way overexposed due to the sun directly overhead. Re-shoot at a different time of day.</td>', 'The wall is way overexposed due to the sun directly overhead. Re-shoot at a different time of day.', '2004-05-16 09:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(720955, 75185, 13305, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.  Great DOF,  I''m curious, does it look this good in color?</td>', 'Nice pic.  Great DOF,  I''m curious, does it look this good in color?', '2004-05-16 09:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(720957, 75069, 13305, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, but it lacks something to really make it interesting. Yes the green trail does sort of lead  the eye, but to what?   Add a person or something to make it more interesting.</td>', 'Nice pic, but it lacks something to really make it interesting. Yes the green trail does sort of lead  the eye, but to what?   Add a person or something to make it more interesting.', '2004-05-16 09:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(720959, 75398, 13305, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. The tiny upturned rump and the arc of water droplets just make the picture.  If I could vote on this challenge, I''d give you a 10;</td>', 'Wonderful capture. The tiny upturned rump and the arc of water droplets just make the picture.  If I could vote on this challenge, I''d give you a 10;', '2004-05-16 09:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(720960, 75412, 13305, '<td valign="top">Lots of bicycles, yup.  this wold be more effective if you filled the frame with just the bikes.  The river and trees are not important to the shot.</td>', 'Lots of bicycles, yup.  this wold be more effective if you filled the frame with just the bikes.  The river and trees are not important to the shot.', '2004-05-16 09:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(720962, 75498, 13305, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to make this subject interesting.  I''m not sure what would help.  Maybe color the water (not yellow), or add a dog trying to get a drink.  Keep trying.</td>', 'It''s hard to make this subject interesting.  I''m not sure what would help.  Maybe color the water (not yellow), or add a dog trying to get a drink.  Keep trying.', '2004-05-16 09:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(720963, 75066, 13305, '<td valign="top">Interesting,  Needs just a little more contrast to make the turtles stand out.  Alternatively, I''d like to see a bit of shoreline to add scale, but that might not be possible.</td>', 'Interesting,  Needs just a little more contrast to make the turtles stand out.  Alternatively, I''d like to see a bit of shoreline to add scale, but that might not be possible.', '2004-05-16 09:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(720965, 74379, 13305, '<td valign="top">Alone in the desert quite fit the pic.  If the subject is alone, why is he looking back at the camera?   Take the same pic with the subject facing directly towards the horizon.</td>', 'Alone in the desert quite fit the pic.  If the subject is alone, why is he looking back at the camera?   Take the same pic with the subject facing directly towards the horizon.', '2004-05-16 09:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(720968, 75488, 13305, '<td valign="top">I like your color selection. My question is only, wouldn''t you expect a kid this age to be playing with a basketball instead?  Nicely done though.</td>', 'I like your color selection. My question is only, wouldn''t you expect a kid this age to be playing with a basketball instead?  Nicely done though.', '2004-05-16 09:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(720970, 75100, 13305, '<td valign="top">Great pic and title for the "off screen expecations" challenge.  Nicely done. Perhaps add a corner of a blanket in the background just for impact, but fine as is.</td>', 'Great pic and title for the "off screen expecations" challenge.  Nicely done. Perhaps add a corner of a blanket in the background just for impact, but fine as is.', '2004-05-16 09:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(720973, 75515, 13305, '<td valign="top">Bad Hair Day?  I think "Do it again Daddy!" would be more appropriate. Really charming pic of the little gil.</td>', 'Bad Hair Day?  I think "Do it again Daddy!" would be more appropriate. Really charming pic of the little gil.', '2004-05-16 09:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(720975, 75176, 13305, '<td valign="top">I dont'' believe I''ve ever seen such utter disdain for a human anywhere else.  Great kitty pic</td>', 'I dont'' believe I''ve ever seen such utter disdain for a human anywhere else.  Great kitty pic', '2004-05-16 10:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(721000, 75492, 16636, '<td valign="top">very unusual photo and it does have a certain appeal, but not sure what at the moment?</td>', 'very unusual photo and it does have a certain appeal, but not sure what at the moment?', '2004-05-16 10:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(721011, 75483, 16636, '<td valign="top">great macro, the red backdrop really enhances the image</td>', 'great macro, the red backdrop really enhances the image', '2004-05-16 10:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(721016, 75369, 16636, '<td valign="top">great image, slightly too dark in the foreground but a great atmosphere</td>', 'great image, slightly too dark in the foreground but a great atmosphere', '2004-05-16 10:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(721087, 75488, 16126, '<td valign="top">The red contrasts nicely with the rest of the picture, but everything looks slightly out of focus, and the tilt to me doesn''t really help the shot.</td>', 'The red contrasts nicely with the rest of the picture, but everything looks slightly out of focus, and the tilt to me doesn''t really help the shot.', '2004-05-16 11:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(721089, 74290, 16126, '<td valign="top">The lack of colors make this an uninteresting shot for me.</td>', 'The lack of colors make this an uninteresting shot for me.', '2004-05-16 11:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(721090, 75616, 16126, '<td valign="top">Colors are okay. Because it''s all out of focus, I don''t know what to look at or look for.</td>', 'Colors are okay. Because it''s all out of focus, I don''t know what to look at or look for.', '2004-05-16 11:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(721092, 75565, 16126, '<td valign="top">Colors are a bit bland, focus seems unsharp. Also, to me the picture doesn''t seem to have a topic, other than a rather uninteresting sign.</td>', 'Colors are a bit bland, focus seems unsharp. Also, to me the picture doesn''t seem to have a topic, other than a rather uninteresting sign.', '2004-05-16 11:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(721093, 75273, 16126, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the colors: it looks partly unsaturated,  which leaves the kid in rather bland colors. Composition is good, but I think I would have cropped off a little bit more off the top.</td>', 'Not sure about the colors: it looks partly unsaturated,  which leaves the kid in rather bland colors. Composition is good, but I think I would have cropped off a little bit more off the top.', '2004-05-16 11:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(721095, 74979, 16126, '<td valign="top">DOF is very good, although I wonder why parts of the bird seem a little unsharp. There seems to be a quite heavy colored reflection on his belly, would have been nice if you could have corrected that.</td>', 'DOF is very good, although I wonder why parts of the bird seem a little unsharp. There seems to be a quite heavy colored reflection on his belly, would have been nice if you could have corrected that.', '2004-05-16 11:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(721100, 75616, 11897, '<td valign="top">Great idea but needs to have some detail in focus.</td>', 'Great idea but needs to have some detail in focus.', '2004-05-16 11:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(721103, 74771, 11897, '<td valign="top">Lovely subject and the colour looks good. A closer aspect or a different angle maybe, the fence distracts the eyes from the main subject.</td>', 'Lovely subject and the colour looks good. A closer aspect or a different angle maybe, the fence distracts the eyes from the main subject.', '2004-05-16 11:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(721104, 75637, 11897, '<td valign="top">A little dark.</td>', 'A little dark.', '2004-05-16 11:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(721145, 75515, 19952, '<td valign="top">If this is actually your child, I can''t imagine that you haven''t taken thousands of pictures of such a cutey before, but I''m happy to give some benefit of the doubt for such a stunning photo. I''ve tried many times to take swingset pictures of my daughters and this one is better than any I''ve ever taken. Great shot!</td>', 'If this is actually your child, I can''t imagine that you haven''t taken thousands of pictures of such a cutey before, but I''m happy to give some benefit of the doubt for such a stunning photo. I''ve tried many times to take swingset pictures of my daughters and this one is better than any I''ve ever taken. Great shot!', '2004-05-16 12:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(721146, 74259, 19952, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the ethereal quality you''ve given this scene with the focus and lighting that you chose. Beautiful picture.</td>', 'I absolutely love the ethereal quality you''ve given this scene with the focus and lighting that you chose. Beautiful picture.', '2004-05-16 12:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(721154, 74627, 11738, '<td valign="top">That overly bright lightsource on the right is very distracting.  The intensity of it seems to almost wash out the crispness of the runes on the stones.  There also seems to be some sort of reflection on the bottom part of the background image with the swords and cross.  Continue experimenting with your lighting technique to refine it.</td>', 'That overly bright lightsource on the right is very distracting.  The intensity of it seems to almost wash out the crispness of the runes on the stones.  There also seems to be some sort of reflection on the bottom part of the background image with the swords and cross.  Continue experimenting with your lighting technique to refine it.', '2004-05-16 13:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(721163, 75636, 11738, '<td valign="top">Shecky is so handsome!    My only suggestion would be to rotate this shot just a smidgeon more counter clockwise.  Excellent focus on this shot.</td>', 'Shecky is so handsome!    My only suggestion would be to rotate this shot just a smidgeon more counter clockwise.  Excellent focus on this shot.', '2004-05-16 13:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(721167, 75634, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The only thing bugging me about this shot is that the kid looks washed out, almost like he''s faded out or almost transparent.  An articfact of the technique you used to go from RGB to B&amp;W?</td>', 'Nice composition.  The only thing bugging me about this shot is that the kid looks washed out, almost like he''s faded out or almost transparent.  An articfact of the technique you used to go from RGB to B&W?', '2004-05-16 13:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(721170, 75393, 8610, '<td valign="top">A bit to dark, but I think if it wsa any brighter it would damage "the mood" in this picture so tried ti bright it up by myself,  I run Shadow/Highlegt effect (15%) on this pictur and I thougt i was better in that way - 8</td>', 'A bit to dark, but I think if it wsa any brighter it would damage "the mood" in this picture so tried ti bright it up by myself,  I run Shadow/Highlegt effect (15%) on this pictur and I thougt i was better in that way - 8', '2004-05-16 13:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(721171, 75526, 11738, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl with beautiful smile.  You are lucky to be able to be able to work with such an interesting model.  Too bad about her left forearm being overexposed.</td>', 'Pretty girl with beautiful smile.  You are lucky to be able to be able to work with such an interesting model.  Too bad about her left forearm being overexposed.', '2004-05-16 13:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(721172, 74665, 11738, '<td valign="top">Vignetting in the corners.  I think I know what you were after, but that island is too small and isn''t distinct enough from the background to make an effective focal point in the image.  I think it would be a good subject in autumn, though.  That fog must have looked awesome that morning.</td>', 'Vignetting in the corners.  I think I know what you were after, but that island is too small and isn''t distinct enough from the background to make an effective focal point in the image.  I think it would be a good subject in autumn, though.  That fog must have looked awesome that morning.', '2004-05-16 13:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(721182, 74979, 6130, '<td valign="top">So cute.</td>', 'So cute.', '2004-05-16 13:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(721186, 75620, 11738, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF to have captured the horse and the groomer in focus.  I''ll be very surprised if this doesn''t show up top-5, maybe even top-3.  Good work and good luck.</td>', 'Excellent DOF to have captured the horse and the groomer in focus.  I''ll be very surprised if this doesn''t show up top-5, maybe even top-3.  Good work and good luck.', '2004-05-16 13:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(721208, 75289, 18838, '<td valign="top">i like the off-center composition ... good focus, light and texture, too - 7</td>', 'i like the off-center composition ... good focus, light and texture, too - 7', '2004-05-16 14:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(721209, 75500, 18838, '<td valign="top">7 - because the motion of the train is very well captured</td>', '7 - because the motion of the train is very well captured', '2004-05-16 14:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(721227, 75483, 6130, '<td valign="top">Amazing.</td>', 'Amazing.', '2004-05-16 15:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(721228, 74379, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2004-05-16 15:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(721229, 75599, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice color.</td>', 'Nice color.', '2004-05-16 15:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(721232, 75620, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good detail and exposure. The textures on the horses, roof, and pole is great and all share complimentary tones. Shame about the overcast ''blown'' sky, but that was partly why you had good lighting on the rest of the image. Neat shot.</td>', 'Good detail and exposure. The textures on the horses, roof, and pole is great and all share complimentary tones. Shame about the overcast ''blown'' sky, but that was partly why you had good lighting on the rest of the image. Neat shot.', '2004-05-16 15:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(721235, 75193, 20285, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2004-05-16 15:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(721236, 75417, 20285, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL!!</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL!!', '2004-05-16 15:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(721237, 75382, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. The texture isnt bad and the play of light and shadow is ok. I guess it could be considered abstract. Doesn''t really do much for me, though, sorry.</td>', 'Interesting subject. The texture isnt bad and the play of light and shadow is ok. I guess it could be considered abstract. Doesn''t really do much for me, though, sorry.', '2004-05-16 15:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(721239, 75640, 6008, '<td valign="top">The image is quite cluttered but I guess it gives an atmosphere of a workman''s study. The lighting and focus seems ok. The subject choice is different and I guess overall it works as either a documentary or photojournalistic type shot.</td>', 'The image is quite cluttered but I guess it gives an atmosphere of a workman''s study. The lighting and focus seems ok. The subject choice is different and I guess overall it works as either a documentary or photojournalistic type shot.', '2004-05-16 15:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(721241, 75556, 6008, '<td valign="top">The exposure/lighting and pose are all good. Ideally having a hairlight to give the top of his head some form instead of blending into the background could have been good but then it wouldnt be very candid. Not a bad portrait.</td>', 'The exposure/lighting and pose are all good. Ideally having a hairlight to give the top of his head some form instead of blending into the background could have been good but then it wouldnt be very candid. Not a bad portrait.', '2004-05-16 15:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(721244, 74726, 6008, '<td valign="top">Getting the exposure on moon shots can be tough but you''ve managed to get it right here. Good detail on the surface, although it still seems a little blurry. Definitely a good effort!</td>', 'Getting the exposure on moon shots can be tough but you''ve managed to get it right here. Good detail on the surface, although it still seems a little blurry. Definitely a good effort!', '2004-05-16 15:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(721246, 75542, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very cute and good use of natural framing. The expression on the foremost dog is kind of a mix between curious and sadness. I like the depth of field with the two dogs filling up the ''space'' between the fence posts. And the color combo of white/green is good too. I like it!</td>', 'Very cute and good use of natural framing. The expression on the foremost dog is kind of a mix between curious and sadness. I like the depth of field with the two dogs filling up the ''space'' between the fence posts. And the color combo of white/green is good too. I like it!', '2004-05-16 15:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(721249, 75400, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very mad scientist look. The smoke (or whatever it is called) is lit well and the beaker almost seems to have a slight glow to it also. Interesting shot!</td>', 'Very mad scientist look. The smoke (or whatever it is called) is lit well and the beaker almost seems to have a slight glow to it also. Interesting shot!', '2004-05-16 15:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(721253, 75526, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea! She has a great smile, which I think infects the rest of the image. I think everyone has been caught out in a sudden rain shower and although it''s annoying you just have to smile and find it humorous. This image certainly captures that ''spirit''</td>', 'Interesting idea! She has a great smile, which I think infects the rest of the image. I think everyone has been caught out in a sudden rain shower and although it''s annoying you just have to smile and find it humorous. This image certainly captures that ''spirit''', '2004-05-16 15:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(721255, 74676, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good color combination with the red, white, and blue, and an interesting blend of textures between the tarp and whatever material the red is (looks kinda like metal). The subject doesnt really do much for me, though, sorry.</td>', 'Good color combination with the red, white, and blue, and an interesting blend of textures between the tarp and whatever material the red is (looks kinda like metal). The subject doesnt really do much for me, though, sorry.', '2004-05-16 15:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(721256, 75409, 6008, '<td valign="top">The placement of the flower is good, but there is a lot of other detail in the shot that seems to competing for attention. What looks like the petal of another flower on the right is a little distracting. Getting closer to the flower and filling the frame with it would have been ideal, especially if your camera is unable to control the depth of field and put the branches/leaves out of focus more.</td>', 'The placement of the flower is good, but there is a lot of other detail in the shot that seems to competing for attention. What looks like the petal of another flower on the right is a little distracting. Getting closer to the flower and filling the frame with it would have been ideal, especially if your camera is unable to control the depth of field and put the branches/leaves out of focus more.', '2004-05-16 15:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(721257, 75100, 6008, '<td valign="top">Tilted roof? The color combo is great, although the rose seems a tad dark. The texture of the roof is great. Original shot.</td>', 'Tilted roof? The color combo is great, although the rose seems a tad dark. The texture of the roof is great. Original shot.', '2004-05-16 16:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(721270, 75519, 4517, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many people have told you to take out the hot pixel. Millions i bet.</td>', 'I wonder how many people have told you to take out the hot pixel. Millions i bet.', '2004-05-16 16:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(721272, 75597, 4517, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Are you sure you`ve not tried this before :). Great colours and i think i like the border too. 10</td>', 'Excellent. Are you sure you`ve not tried this before :). Great colours and i think i like the border too. 10', '2004-05-16 16:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(721273, 75550, 4517, '<td valign="top">very sharp and clear :)</td>', 'very sharp and clear :)', '2004-05-16 16:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(721274, 75523, 20285, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well!</td>', 'Meets the challenge well!', '2004-05-16 16:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(721275, 75115, 4517, '<td valign="top">I love a good lion pic. 7</td>', 'I love a good lion pic. 7', '2004-05-16 16:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(721279, 74259, 4517, '<td valign="top">I`m guessing England because 50% of the worlds bluebells are here. I shot some yesterday but nothing as good as this.   10</td>', 'I`m guessing England because 50% of the worlds bluebells are here. I shot some yesterday but nothing as good as this.   10', '2004-05-16 16:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(721281, 75631, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nice crepuscular rays.</td>', 'Nice crepuscular rays.', '2004-05-16 16:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(721289, 75526, 1368, '<td valign="top">Þú ert sjálfur með massa mynd væni, Tók sig mjög vel út á forsíðunni!</td>', 'Þú ert sjálfur með massa mynd væni, Tók sig mjög vel út á forsíðunni!', '2004-05-16 17:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(721295, 75490, 11897, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this the more I love it, scary but beautiful expression.<br/>top marks from me and hope you get a ribbon.</td>', 'The more I look at this the more I love it, scary but beautiful expression.top marks from me and hope you get a ribbon.', '2004-05-16 17:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(721296, 74798, 11897, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot.</td>', 'Incredible shot.', '2004-05-16 17:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(721298, 75526, 11897, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.</td>', 'Wonderful.', '2004-05-16 17:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(721301, 75555, 11897, '<td valign="top">This is one landscape I think is better than my own :)<br/>Marvelous picture 10</td>', 'This is one landscape I think is better than my own :)Marvelous picture 10', '2004-05-16 17:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(721303, 75064, 11897, '<td valign="top">Funny but I don''t expect it to get up with the ribbons.</td>', 'Funny but I don''t expect it to get up with the ribbons.', '2004-05-16 17:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(721306, 75315, 11897, '<td valign="top">If you could have just caught them lifting up their heads this would have been a great shot, but as it is with them hidden it is missing that extra detail needed.</td>', 'If you could have just caught them lifting up their heads this would have been a great shot, but as it is with them hidden it is missing that extra detail needed.', '2004-05-16 17:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(721307, 75177, 11897, '<td valign="top">Good subject but doesn''t quite work from a car/vehicle window I''m afraid.</td>', 'Good subject but doesn''t quite work from a car/vehicle window I''m afraid.', '2004-05-16 17:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(721313, 75305, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflections. I really like the placement of the fishers in the frame. A black border would have looked better, but thats only my taste.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Very nice reflections. I really like the placement of the fishers in the frame. A black border would have looked better, but thats only my taste. Good luck...', '2004-05-16 17:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(721315, 75417, 16301, '<td valign="top">Great macro, the colors are really beautiful. It would also look good if the rest of the wings were in focus.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Great macro, the colors are really beautiful. It would also look good if the rest of the wings were in focus. Good luck...', '2004-05-16 17:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(721319, 75369, 16301, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouettes, the light really adds a mood to the whole photo. The placement of the mountain in the frame really enhances the composition. It almost looks like a painting.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Nice silhouettes, the light really adds a mood to the whole photo. The placement of the mountain in the frame really enhances the composition. It almost looks like a painting. Good luck...', '2004-05-16 17:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(721321, 75210, 16301, '<td valign="top">Great macro, I like the off-centering of the ant. The desaturation works well here. A black border wouldn''t hurt.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Great macro, I like the off-centering of the ant. The desaturation works well here. A black border wouldn''t hurt. Good luck...', '2004-05-16 17:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(721326, 75533, 16301, '<td valign="top">Excellent motion stopping. Great clarity/detail and colors. I wouldn''t be surprised if this got a ribbon.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Excellent motion stopping. Great clarity/detail and colors. I wouldn''t be surprised if this got a ribbon. Good luck...', '2004-05-16 17:53:59.000000', NULL, 1);
