(721351, 74430, 18080, '<td valign="top">I set my self the challange every comp to find the money.<br/>There always is some.<br/>Well done though. This is an interesting entry.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'I set my self the challange every comp to find the money.There always is some.Well done though. This is an interesting entry.Good luck', '2004-05-16 18:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(721352, 75616, 18080, '<td valign="top">Good idea.<br/>Not nearly clear enough.</td>', 'Good idea.Not nearly clear enough.', '2004-05-16 18:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(721371, 75573, 14614, '<td valign="top">I really like all the blues in this shot -- you''ve captured them with such a deep dof that pulls my eye through the shot.  One of my favorites this challenge -- minor distraction is the motor -- I''m not sure why but could be that it interupts the nature? breaks the reflection?  I think it would be better cloned out.</td>', 'I really like all the blues in this shot -- you''ve captured them with such a deep dof that pulls my eye through the shot.  One of my favorites this challenge -- minor distraction is the motor -- I''m not sure why but could be that it interupts the nature? breaks the reflection?  I think it would be better cloned out.', '2004-05-16 18:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(721374, 75490, 14614, '<td valign="top">What a "Yahoo" expression.  Your full-face shot emphasizes the eyes, nose and mouth.  One of my favorites this challenge!</td>', 'What a "Yahoo" expression.  Your full-face shot emphasizes the eyes, nose and mouth.  One of my favorites this challenge!', '2004-05-16 18:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(721378, 75620, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this challenge.  There''s a lot to like: natural frame of the rail, excellent dof, nice tight cropping, full face of the horse but the profile of the groomer puts has me focus on the horse first, wonderful candid.</td>', 'One of my favorites this challenge.  There''s a lot to like: natural frame of the rail, excellent dof, nice tight cropping, full face of the horse but the profile of the groomer puts has me focus on the horse first, wonderful candid.', '2004-05-16 18:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(721381, 74290, 14614, '<td valign="top">well, not that engaging a subject for me but you certainly shot something few here have :)<br/> <br/>Would like not to see your reflection in the water -- sure is cleaner than mine ;)</td>', 'well, not that engaging a subject for me but you certainly shot something few here have :) Would like not to see your reflection in the water -- sure is cleaner than mine ;)', '2004-05-16 18:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(721382, 75515, 11738, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture!  She looks like she is having SO much fun!  My only beef with this image is that it is slightly overexposed.  The DOF and nice nondescript background make this photo work so well.  Oh heck!  This is a happy picture and happy pictures have lots of light.  A 10.</td>', 'Excellent capture!  She looks like she is having SO much fun!  My only beef with this image is that it is slightly overexposed.  The DOF and nice nondescript background make this photo work so well.  Oh heck!  This is a happy picture and happy pictures have lots of light.  A 10.', '2004-05-16 18:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(721384, 75575, 14614, '<td valign="top">a bit too much going on here... I''d suggest limiting your subjects to a few (one''s without writing would be best).  I''d like a sharper focus all around.</td>', 'a bit too much going on here... I''d suggest limiting your subjects to a few (one''s without writing would be best).  I''d like a sharper focus all around.', '2004-05-16 18:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(721385, 75208, 14614, '<td valign="top">I''d like a bit more light on the still life and more oof in the brown background.  Certainly captured a duo that''s not a cliche!  :)</td>', 'I''d like a bit more light on the still life and more oof in the brown background.  Certainly captured a duo that''s not a cliche!  :)', '2004-05-16 18:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(721386, 75640, 14614, '<td valign="top">fewed subjects would make this a more powerful shot</td>', 'fewed subjects would make this a more powerful shot', '2004-05-16 18:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(721387, 75409, 1031, '<td valign="top">I actually like creative borders, but don''t care for the color of the inner line; I think I''d use black, white, or a color sampled from a leaf.</td>', 'I actually like creative borders, but don''t care for the color of the inner line; I think I''d use black, white, or a color sampled from a leaf.', '2004-05-16 19:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(721388, 75597, 1031, '<td valign="top">Makes a good abstract of color and texture; this would be a fun image to play around with shifting the colors on as well, with big sweeping areas of color and tone, with subtle details.</td>', 'Makes a good abstract of color and texture; this would be a fun image to play around with shifting the colors on as well, with big sweeping areas of color and tone, with subtle details.', '2004-05-16 19:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(721390, 75515, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks like a darned fine hair day to me! I see no complaints ...  :)</td>', 'Looks like a darned fine hair day to me! I see no complaints ...  :)', '2004-05-16 19:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(721391, 75302, 1031, '<td valign="top">The look of concentration helps establish that this is possibly a new endeavor. Good stop-motion exposure, focus, framing/cropping.</td>', 'The look of concentration helps establish that this is possibly a new endeavor. Good stop-motion exposure, focus, framing/cropping.', '2004-05-16 19:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(721392, 75277, 6900, '<td valign="top">Needs some contrast.  Try a high pass sharpen.</td>', 'Needs some contrast.  Try a high pass sharpen.', '2004-05-16 19:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(721395, 75555, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think you could crop out some foreground to a 3:2 aspect ratio. You could also change the mood of this considerably by darkening the background area ...</td>', 'I think you could crop out some foreground to a 3:2 aspect ratio. You could also change the mood of this considerably by darkening the background area ...', '2004-05-16 19:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(721396, 74259, 6900, '<td valign="top">This is so Sidwell-esque.  I think that''s a compliment, too!  :)  I LOVE the soft focus and the UNBELIEVABLY dreamlike quality here.  I''d love to know what the original looked like and how you PP''d it.  10.</td>', 'This is so Sidwell-esque.  I think that''s a compliment, too!  :)  I LOVE the soft focus and the UNBELIEVABLY dreamlike quality here.  I''d love to know what the original looked like and how you PP''d it.  10.', '2004-05-16 19:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(721401, 74726, 1031, '<td valign="top">It would be fun to have the gear to do this sometime!</td>', 'It would be fun to have the gear to do this sometime!', '2004-05-16 19:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
