(721696, 75634, 8891, '<td valign="top">when I first saw this I thought the lad had been imported....on second viewing it appears that he is not but it looks like you over  dodged his head it as the detail and tone look out of place.</td>', 'when I first saw this I thought the lad had been imported....on second viewing it appears that he is not but it looks like you over  dodged his head it as the detail and tone look out of place.', '2004-05-16 22:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
