(721756, 75307, 13381, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the brightly colored locomotive against the earthy background and the bright blue sky.  I like that you can tell the difference between the color schemes of the two locomotives.  The color definition in this shot is wonderful, but it appears a bit over-sharpened in the background.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the brightly colored locomotive against the earthy background and the bright blue sky.  I like that you can tell the difference between the color schemes of the two locomotives.  The color definition in this shot is wonderful, but it appears a bit over-sharpened in the background.', '2004-05-16 23:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(721757, 75300, 13381, '<td valign="top">lovely macro, and great use of light to illuminate the flower from behind.  I love the little curlycues of the center.</td>', 'lovely macro, and great use of light to illuminate the flower from behind.  I love the little curlycues of the center.', '2004-05-16 23:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(721758, 75632, 13381, '<td valign="top">I like the use of black and white on this shot. It lends a sense of nostalgia to what appears to be a classic scene.</td>', 'I like the use of black and white on this shot. It lends a sense of nostalgia to what appears to be a classic scene.', '2004-05-16 23:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(721760, 75436, 13381, '<td valign="top">I like the desaturated effect of this photo.  I think the staircase has great vectors and lighting, but the shoes seem out of place.</td>', 'I like the desaturated effect of this photo.  I think the staircase has great vectors and lighting, but the shoes seem out of place.', '2004-05-16 23:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(721763, 75515, 13381, '<td valign="top">An adorable portrait, though a bit washed out around the girl''s nose.</td>', 'An adorable portrait, though a bit washed out around the girl''s nose.', '2004-05-16 23:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(721764, 75616, 13381, '<td valign="top">This has the potential to be something very cool, but it has no focus.</td>', 'This has the potential to be something very cool, but it has no focus.', '2004-05-16 23:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(721765, 74703, 13381, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, though I think I''d love it even more with a slightly greater depth of field, so that the grasses in the foreground would be in focus as well.</td>', 'I love this shot, though I think I''d love it even more with a slightly greater depth of field, so that the grasses in the foreground would be in focus as well.', '2004-05-16 23:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(721766, 74259, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful; I love the "darkness" of it, combined with the rich colors.  It might have been nice to have some more of the tree tops/greenery though.</td>', 'Very beautiful; I love the "darkness" of it, combined with the rich colors.  It might have been nice to have some more of the tree tops/greenery though.', '2004-05-16 23:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(721767, 75163, 13381, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. I think low depth of field works very well for this shot.</td>', 'Nice macro. I think low depth of field works very well for this shot.', '2004-05-16 23:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(721770, 75204, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of this fast moving coaster and the people''s expressions!  Good composition as well.</td>', 'Nice capture of this fast moving coaster and the people''s expressions!  Good composition as well.', '2004-05-16 23:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(721771, 75289, 13381, '<td valign="top">There''s a journalistic starkness to this photo.  My first impression was that it was sort of dull and without focus, but on second thought, I like the contrast of the bright red on white background and the subtle shading in the top corner and around the fire extinguisher.</td>', 'There''s a journalistic starkness to this photo.  My first impression was that it was sort of dull and without focus, but on second thought, I like the contrast of the bright red on white background and the subtle shading in the top corner and around the fire extinguisher.', '2004-05-16 23:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(721772, 75539, 12253, '<td valign="top">This would ave made a great entry into abstract.  Very beautiful colors.</td>', 'This would ave made a great entry into abstract.  Very beautiful colors.', '2004-05-16 23:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(721773, 75541, 12253, '<td valign="top">I love the use of negative space here.  It adds great drama along with the light and how it strikes the water almost in a misty fashion.  Fantastic work.  I predict a ribbon the color of the water.</td>', 'I love the use of negative space here.  It adds great drama along with the light and how it strikes the water almost in a misty fashion.  Fantastic work.  I predict a ribbon the color of the water.', '2004-05-16 23:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(721774, 74866, 13381, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail, nice ambience.</td>', 'Beautiful detail, nice ambience.', '2004-05-16 23:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(721777, 75528, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the tree and foreground objects to give depth to this gorgeous view.  A little fill flash might have been an interesting way to get a little more light on the trunk of the tree.</td>', 'Nice use of the tree and foreground objects to give depth to this gorgeous view.  A little fill flash might have been an interesting way to get a little more light on the trunk of the tree.', '2004-05-16 23:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(721779, 75393, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very moody shot!  Love the rich greens and mist!  To me, I think it would have been better to catch more of the vertical for those center trees.  They just seem chopped, and the grass in the foreground not as necessary.  In fact, yo umight have been able to get the fence coming from the bottom left, and extending to just below center, and then the foggy sky, including a bit more of the trees.</td>', 'Very moody shot!  Love the rich greens and mist!  To me, I think it would have been better to catch more of the vertical for those center trees.  They just seem chopped, and the grass in the foreground not as necessary.  In fact, yo umight have been able to get the fence coming from the bottom left, and extending to just below center, and then the foggy sky, including a bit more of the trees.', '2004-05-16 23:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(721780, 75508, 13381, '<td valign="top">despite the low light, this shot is razor sharp. I love the fiery colors, and it plays nicely as an abstract work.</td>', 'despite the low light, this shot is razor sharp. I love the fiery colors, and it plays nicely as an abstract work.', '2004-05-16 23:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
