(721847, 75540, 13336, '<td valign="top">FYI - just because it was your first, doesn''t make it new.  and despite that, the challenge was supposed to be about photographing something for the first time.  somehow i doubt this was the first shot you took of your own barn.  but i''m not docking points, just sayin''</td>', 'FYI - just because it was your first, doesn''t make it new.  and despite that, the challenge was supposed to be about photographing something for the first time.  somehow i doubt this was the first shot you took of your own barn.  but i''m not docking points, just sayin''', '2004-05-17 00:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
