(721895, 74259, 9906, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite images in this series.  I did think it was a touch overprocessed, but still gave it a 7!  If the distant bluebells didn''t look so painted in it would have been an 8 or 9 (which I don''t give out lightly!)<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon!<br/>TC</td>', 'One of my favorite images in this series.  I did think it was a touch overprocessed, but still gave it a 7!  If the distant bluebells didn''t look so painted in it would have been an 8 or 9 (which I don''t give out lightly!) Congrats on the ribbon!TC', '2004-05-17 01:03:58.000000', NULL, 0),
