(721902, 75490, 17148, '<td valign="top">Great pic, love it...but didn''t meet the challenge, I thought this baby looked familure, I saw him in your past work and new it was yours, I called it (and now that I''ve read the other comments it looks as if some others reconized the face too)...and yet knew that it was still going to beat mine...man, great job though...like you need anyone to reasure your work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-17 00:16:01.</i></td>', 'Great pic, love it...but didn''t meet the challenge, I thought this baby looked familure, I saw him in your past work and new it was yours, I called it (and now that I''ve read the other comments it looks as if some others reconized the face too)...and yet knew that it was still going to beat mine...man, great job though...like you need anyone to reasure your work.', '2004-05-17 01:06:57.000000', '2004-05-17 01:16:01.000000', 0),
