(721908, 74763, 14012, '<td valign="top">This should have placed much higher. The lighting, colors, mood, everything is excellent. I may have cropped it a bit different though. No doubt in my mind that this should have at least been in the top 20.<br/> <br/>Sounds like you posted this in the forums, before you entered it. The fact that others saw it before, may have impacted your score a bit. <br/> <br/>Adding to my favorites.</td>', 'This should have placed much higher. The lighting, colors, mood, everything is excellent. I may have cropped it a bit different though. No doubt in my mind that this should have at least been in the top 20. Sounds like you posted this in the forums, before you entered it. The fact that others saw it before, may have impacted your score a bit.  Adding to my favorites.', '2004-05-17 01:11:02.000000', NULL, 0),
