(721927, 75061, 17148, '<td valign="top">I wanted to thank everyone who voted me high, I stood around this tree for three hours because someone had spotted him there, right when I had given up and put my camera away he comes running out of the nest, glad I didn''t leave.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-17 00:21:29.</i></td>', 'I wanted to thank everyone who voted me high, I stood around this tree for three hours because someone had spotted him there, right when I had given up and put my camera away he comes running out of the nest, glad I didn''t leave.', '2004-05-17 01:19:12.000000', '2004-05-17 01:21:29.000000', 0),
