(722104, 75048, 7350, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable.  I expected a top 10 finish on this one!  Well, I''m adding it to my favorites, anyway.  I still really like it.  I guess I can see the point that the neck of the lamp perhaps could have been included in the shot somehow, but I really like this just how it is.  I gave it a 9 (the highest vote it received, apparently), and I stand by it.  Congrats on a nice photo.</td>', 'Unbelievable.  I expected a top 10 finish on this one!  Well, I''m adding it to my favorites, anyway.  I still really like it.  I guess I can see the point that the neck of the lamp perhaps could have been included in the shot somehow, but I really like this just how it is.  I gave it a 9 (the highest vote it received, apparently), and I stand by it.  Congrats on a nice photo.', '2004-05-17 02:38:03.000000', NULL, 0),
