(722245, 75369, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good going Gordon - great shot. Leading for the UK in the top 3! <br/> <br/>Love this composition and that beautifully lit moss.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-17 12:20:55.</i></td>', 'Good going Gordon - great shot. Leading for the UK in the top 3!  Love this composition and that beautifully lit moss.', '2004-05-17 04:45:30.000000', '2004-05-17 13:20:55.000000', 0),
(722308, 75369, 14603, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the kind words,<br/>this was my first chance since joining DPC to get out and into my beloved hills..it was also my first attempt at dodging and burning (which helped to emphasise the sunlight and shadows)Hopefully, I`ll get a little better as time goes on.<br/>For the people who expressed an interest in how this was achieved...(nothing too difficult)Took around 6 exposures at different settings, chose the one which had the most sky detail..then used curves to return some detail to the dark areas, finished it off with a little dodging and burning (for reasons above)then reduced noise slightly in Neat image.<br/>Thanks again to everyone who voted and commented.<br/>Gordon</td>', 'Thanks to all for the kind words,this was my first chance since joining DPC to get out and into my beloved hills..it was also my first attempt at dodging and burning (which helped to emphasise the sunlight and shadows)Hopefully, I`ll get a little better as time goes on.For the people who expressed an interest in how this was achieved...(nothing too difficult)Took around 6 exposures at different settings, chose the one which had the most sky detail..then used curves to return some detail to the dark areas, finished it off with a little dodging and burning (for reasons above)then reduced noise slightly in Neat image.Thanks again to everyone who voted and commented.Gordon', '2004-05-17 05:12:24.000000', NULL, 0),
