(722557, 74437, 19035, '<td valign="top">Just once when I feel I am submitting a great photo - can I not get a 1 or a 2?  I know it sounds petty and everyone has their own opinions, but I''ll never understand why some pictures get scored so low.  I know my picture is not the best, in fact those that won were my favorites too, congrats to them.  But I would love to at least hear why people didnt like my pic so it will help me in later picture taking efforts.  Thanks for listening.</td>', 'Just once when I feel I am submitting a great photo - can I not get a 1 or a 2?  I know it sounds petty and everyone has their own opinions, but I''ll never understand why some pictures get scored so low.  I know my picture is not the best, in fact those that won were my favorites too, congrats to them.  But I would love to at least hear why people didnt like my pic so it will help me in later picture taking efforts.  Thanks for listening.', '2004-05-17 09:36:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(722609, 74798, 8522, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning. Your work just keeps getting better and better, I don''t know how you do it!</td>', 'Absolutely stunning. Your work just keeps getting better and better, I don''t know how you do it!', '2004-05-17 10:20:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(722614, 74361, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, shame about the extra animal on the right behind the horns of the one in front. Superb sharpness.</td>', 'Lovely shot, shame about the extra animal on the right behind the horns of the one in front. Superb sharpness.', '2004-05-17 10:23:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(722617, 75204, 8522, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally good roller coaster shot. A lot harder than it looks to get a shot like this.</td>', 'Exceptionally good roller coaster shot. A lot harder than it looks to get a shot like this.', '2004-05-17 10:25:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(722681, 75094, 19608, '<td valign="top">Hi Judy and *Greetings from the Critique Club *<br/> <br/>As you will note, I left a fairly long comment on your image during the challenge.  I stand by my earlier comments and am very surprised your image didn''t finish higher.<br/> <br/>There was a comment about the image being tilted - which is not the case.  If you look at the left and right sides of the image - the building is victim of the effect called "keystoning" which is caused by shooting up with a wide angle lens.  Keystoning can be corrected by a) Using a shift perspective lens (expensive and probably not available on the 717), b) Shooting level with the building (have a heliocopter?) or c) Post processing.<br/> <br/>Once again - a very strong and vibrant submission - congratulations.</td>', 'Hi Judy and *Greetings from the Critique Club * As you will note, I left a fairly long comment on your image during the challenge.  I stand by my earlier comments and am very surprised your image didn''t finish higher. There was a comment about the image being tilted - which is not the case.  If you look at the left and right sides of the image - the building is victim of the effect called "keystoning" which is caused by shooting up with a wide angle lens.  Keystoning can be corrected by a) Using a shift perspective lens (expensive and probably not available on the 717), b) Shooting level with the building (have a heliocopter?) or c) Post processing. Once again - a very strong and vibrant submission - congratulations.', '2004-05-17 10:58:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(722752, 75490, 14514, '<td valign="top">wo scary eyes! nice shot, its good to see a baby shot with some appeal!</td>', 'wo scary eyes! nice shot, its good to see a baby shot with some appeal!', '2004-05-17 11:52:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(722759, 74633, 2764, '<td valign="top">what am I missing??  I gave this a nine.  I love it.</td>', 'what am I missing??  I gave this a nine.  I love it.', '2004-05-17 11:56:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(722775, 75533, 6999, '<td valign="top">Highly competent shooting ... I just can''t believe it''s been voted into first place. Well, I can, but... <br/> <br/>Every now and again I get confused, and think that dpc might have something to do with imagination and vision. More fool me.<br/> <br/>Apologies for posting this on your photo - but I think it needs saying, and I''m sure you have enough congratulations to keep you happy.<br/> <br/>Ed</td>', 'Highly competent shooting ... I just can''t believe it''s been voted into first place. Well, I can, but...  Every now and again I get confused, and think that dpc might have something to do with imagination and vision. More fool me. Apologies for posting this on your photo - but I think it needs saying, and I''m sure you have enough congratulations to keep you happy. Ed', '2004-05-17 12:12:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(722787, 74645, 6999, '<td valign="top">As there''s no mention of it in your comments, I strongly suggest that you go, as soon as you possibly can (like on the way home this evening), to the World Press Photo 04 exhibition in the foyer of the Festival Hall - I absolutely promise you you won''t be disappointed. Head for the furthest right-hand section if you go in from the terrace level, where you''ll find some of the work of Raul Belinchon. <br/> <br/>Honestly, you really MUST do this. <br/> <br/>Ed</td>', 'As there''s no mention of it in your comments, I strongly suggest that you go, as soon as you possibly can (like on the way home this evening), to the World Press Photo 04 exhibition in the foyer of the Festival Hall - I absolutely promise you you won''t be disappointed. Head for the furthest right-hand section if you go in from the terrace level, where you''ll find some of the work of Raul Belinchon.  Honestly, you really MUST do this.  Ed', '2004-05-17 12:18:22.000000', NULL, 0),
