(722814, 75369, 6999, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by e301:</b></div><hr/><i> The only way i can see this wonderfully atmospheric and exemplary shot not winning this week is if the ''don''t believe it''s legal'' crows get to it too heavily. Has a quality reminiscent of the painter Caspar David Friedrich; and there is little higher praise than that. When i grow up, <i>I</i> want to be able to take photos like this. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Of course, I forgot about motorcycles in mid-air ... :-(<br/> <br/>Wonderful work, as ever.<br/> <br/>Ed</td>', 'Originally posted by e301: The only way i can see this wonderfully atmospheric and exemplary shot not winning this week is if the ''don''t believe it''s legal'' crows get to it too heavily. Has a quality reminiscent of the painter Caspar David Friedrich; and there is little higher praise than that. When i grow up, I want to be able to take photos like this.   Of course, I forgot about motorcycles in mid-air ... :-( Wonderful work, as ever. Ed', '2004-05-17 12:33:37.000000', NULL, 0),
