(723149, 75327, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot! Excellent macro and DOF. I was lazy and didn''t vote on all of the entries but I got close. Anyway, beautiful shade of blue and excellent detail in the drops of water. The only thing that bothers me is the reflection in the left side drop. I would have voted this an 8. Great work! BTW, which macro lens did you get?</td>', 'This is a nice shot! Excellent macro and DOF. I was lazy and didn''t vote on all of the entries but I got close. Anyway, beautiful shade of blue and excellent detail in the drops of water. The only thing that bothers me is the reflection in the left side drop. I would have voted this an 8. Great work! BTW, which macro lens did you get?', '2004-05-17 16:19:13.000000', NULL, 0),
