(724251, 75533, 472, '<td valign="top">i think this is an uncalled-for remark.  given that you yourself have won a fair number of ribbons, and assuming you think your own shots full of imagination and vision, wouldn''t that be enough for you to not make such a cranky comment?  <br/> <br/>and please, pray tell us the last timen you SAW, let alone SHOT, a motorcycle in mid-air surrounded by tall buildings?  <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by e301:</b></div><hr/><i> Highly competent shooting ... I just can''t believe it''s been voted into first place. Well, I can, but... <br/> <br/>Every now and again I get confused, and think that dpc might have something to do with imagination and vision. More fool me.<br/> <br/>Apologies for posting this on your photo - but I think it needs saying, and I''m sure you have enough congratulations to keep you happy.<br/> <br/>Ed </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-18 12:45:53.</i></td>', 'i think this is an uncalled-for remark.  given that you yourself have won a fair number of ribbons, and assuming you think your own shots full of imagination and vision, wouldn''t that be enough for you to not make such a cranky comment?   and please, pray tell us the last timen you SAW, let alone SHOT, a motorcycle in mid-air surrounded by tall buildings?   Originally posted by e301: Highly competent shooting ... I just can''t believe it''s been voted into first place. Well, I can, but...  Every now and again I get confused, and think that dpc might have something to do with imagination and vision. More fool me. Apologies for posting this on your photo - but I think it needs saying, and I''m sure you have enough congratulations to keep you happy. Ed ', '2004-05-18 08:49:20.000000', '2004-05-18 13:45:53.000000', 0),
(724373, 75533, 20139, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by soheil:</b></div><hr/><i> Hi, Great shot, will you explain how you did the focusing?? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes I would like to know how you did that focusing also.</td>', 'Originally posted by soheil: Hi, Great shot, will you explain how you did the focusing??   Yes I would like to know how you did that focusing also.', '2004-05-18 11:41:22.000000', NULL, 0),
