(1403221, 75327, 38126, '<td valign="top">please contact me.  amazing shot.  I adore the blue color.  This shot required MUCH work and effort.  I''ve been doing and evaluating photgraphy for 43 years.  This is a MUST HAVE for my gallery.  But as stated, please contact me.<br/>THIS should have taken one of the top 2 spots.<br/>10/10</td>', 'please contact me.  amazing shot.  I adore the blue color.  This shot required MUCH work and effort.  I''ve been doing and evaluating photgraphy for 43 years.  This is a MUST HAVE for my gallery.  But as stated, please contact me.THIS should have taken one of the top 2 spots.10/10', '2005-05-22 00:37:12.000000', NULL, 0),
