(1403235, 75619, 38126, '<td valign="top">PLEASE get rid of the sepia or discolored b/w. If you left the cannon in b/c and the remainder in original color or enhanced colr and submit it (e-mail) it to my, I may be interested in this for my gallery for a good price.   It''s old v. new in every aspect and BRILLIANT!  Deserved a top-10 rating.<br/>9/10</td>', 'PLEASE get rid of the sepia or discolored b/w. If you left the cannon in b/c and the remainder in original color or enhanced colr and submit it (e-mail) it to my, I may be interested in this for my gallery for a good price.   It''s old v. new in every aspect and BRILLIANT!  Deserved a top-10 rating.9/10', '2005-05-22 00:41:39.000000', NULL, 0),
